translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_23ae28c4:

    # "You cannot resist your lust anymore, you lunge into your own bed, grinding yourself against the bedsheet before looking down at your crotch, it is remarkably hard now."
    "你再也按捺不住欲望，扑到床上，在床单上摩擦身体；低头看向胯间时，那里已经硬得惊人。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_28952bf0:

    # "The sexual desire in your mind is overrunning your logical thinking, you cannot wait any longer. Quickly, you strip off all your equipment except for the loincloth."
    "脑海中的性欲压过了理智，你再也等不下去。你迅速脱下所有装备，只留下兜裆布。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_53add2df:

    # "You wake up 4 hours later, all of the lust in your body is gone now. You feel ready to go out again."
    "四小时后，你醒了过来，体内的欲望已经消退。你觉得自己又可以出门了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_1fed3c0a:

    # msg "This is a debug screen for fixing all bugs related issues in some saves." nointeract
    msg "这是用于修复某些存档中各种错误的调试界面。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_ace82b66:

    # msg "This function is only available to {b}Roommate{/b} and {b}Keeper{/b} Tier on Patreon. Passcode will change every update."
    msg "此功能仅对 Patreon 的 {b}Roommate{/b} 和 {b}Keeper{/b} 等级开放。每次更新后解锁码都会更改。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_585bc2fb:

    # msg "Turn off Gallery Unlock feature? You have to re-enter the passcode to access it again." nointeract
    msg "要关闭画廊解锁功能吗？你需要再次输入解锁码才能重新访问画廊。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_b1fe1731:

    # msg "This fix is for when you constantly get approached by an error screen regarding quest progress."
    msg "这个修复选项用于你不断遇到与任务进度有关的错误界面时。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_9fca8cb1:

    # msg "This fix is for when you are stuck in the whispering hollow, not able to turn in Uffe's quest."
    msg "这个修复选项用于你被困在低语空洞、无法交还乌菲的任务时。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_b888a9f9:

    # msg "If you hold a Moonstone Amulet. Proceeding while the quest is active will refresh your quest status, allowing you to complete the quest again." nointeract
    msg "如果你持有月石护身符，在任务进行期间继续操作会刷新任务状态，让你可以再次完成任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_0fe4e953:

    # msg "You may need to cut the grass again to complete the quest."
    msg "你可能需要再次割草才能完成任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_e7343c25:

    # msg "This fix is for when your stats are lower than normal after unequipping."
    msg "这个修复选项用于解决脱下装备后属性低于正常值的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_2416edc8:

    # msg "Proceeding will unequip all your equipment and recalculate your stats." nointeract
    msg "继续操作会脱下你的所有装备并重新计算属性。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite main_bedroom_20c24f88:

    # msg "Done! Please put your clothes back on after reset, or not!"
    msg "完成！重置后请重新穿上衣服，当然也可以不穿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gallery_Input_Passcode_54fbfb87:

    # msg "All gallery scenes are successfully unlocked!"
    msg "所有画廊场景均已成功解锁！"

translate schinese_rewrite Gallery_Input_Passcode_f555efae:

    # msg "Passcode incorrect. Do you want to try again?" nointeract
    msg "密码不正确。要再试一次吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite bedroom_sleep_6ad06346:

    # "You get on the bed and slowly fall asleep."
    "你躺上床，渐渐飘入了梦乡。"

translate schinese_rewrite bedroom_sleep_b20d9dca:

    # "You wake up in the morning, feeling energized and ready for the day."
    "你早晨醒来，精神饱满，准备迎接新的一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite bedroom_rest_a239a84c:

    # "You get on the bed and rest for a few hours."
    "你躺上床，短暂休息了几小时。"

translate schinese_rewrite bedroom_rest_cff4dfd7:

    # "You recovered a portion of your HP and MP."
    "你恢复了部分生命值和魔力值。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_78f76c27:

    # "A doodle of Sebas' and Ole's portrait, it captures the lion's charming smile, and the lizard's kindness, they seem to be situated behind the same wall this drawing is hanged."
    "这幅涂鸦画着狮子迷人的笑容和蜥蜴的温和神态；画中的两人似乎站在同一面墙后，而画就挂在那面墙上。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_149bf4d7:

    # "The paper has aged quite a bit, but seemingly well-groomed along the years."
    "纸张已经颇有年头，却保养得相当好，历经多年仍然完好。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_7d29a2be:

    # e "Seb, I like this drawing, maybe I should pay the drawer a visit."
    e "塞巴斯，我喜欢这幅画。也许我该去拜访画这幅画的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_b60a5264:

    # s "Oh! That's my favourite doodle right there, it's quite old, honestly, we invited Rahim's... partner to sketch us when the shop first opened."
    s "哦！那就是我最喜欢的涂鸦，已经很旧了。说实话，商店刚开张时，我们请了雷希姆的……伴侣来给我们画像。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_b75b8db1:

    # s "That's a long time, damn. She is quite an artist isn't she, look at those strokes, you might have thought it takes longer than 10 minutes."
    s "那已经是很久以前了，真见鬼。她确实很有艺术天分，对吧？看看这些笔触，你会以为她花了不止十分钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_48de4e4b:

    # e "You two looks so cozy here."
    e "你们在这里看起来真亲密。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_9e1e5e15:

    # s "Well, we should've made a better pose if we knew she's going away, maybe request a full body ones like those you hang in a palace or something, but Ole's too piffy-puffy."
    s "如果早知道她会离开，我们本该摆个更好的姿势。也许该请她画一幅像宫殿里挂的那种全身像，不过奥利太爱胡闹了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_de9561c6:

    # "You found a book on the top of the cabinet, flipping over the pages, it seems to be a brief history of Lusterfield."
    "你在柜子顶上发现一本书。翻过几页后，你发现那似乎是乐斯民菲尔德简史。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_cd51d499:

    # "It doesn't look like Ole will mind you taking an old book, probably. With that in mind, you slowly place the book in your bag."
    "奥利应该不会介意你拿走一本旧书。你这么想着，慢慢把书放进包里。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_e0d72571:

    # "You find an account journal lying on top of the counter. It seems to record the daily activities of the pawn shop."
    "你发现柜台上放着一本账簿，似乎记录着当铺的日常经营。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_0a2d6e46:

    # "A lizard plush doll that closely resembles Ole, except that it seems to stand on four legs."
    "一个长得很像奥利的蜥蜴毛绒玩偶，只是它似乎是四脚站立的。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_e79c8597:

    # "You stare at the doll, it aged well over the years, the scales seem to be painted on, but it falls off quite easily."
    "你盯着这个玩偶。它已经保存了很多年，鳞片看起来是画上去的，却很容易脱落。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_8b67e040:

    # e "Is this you, Ole?"
    e "这是你吗，奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_a06a6743:

    # "You point towards the plush doll, urging Ole to look this way."
    "你指向那个毛绒玩偶，示意奥利看过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_84b2da92:

    # o "Oh, there're not many green lizards crawling around here are there, kiddo."
    o "哦，这附近爬来爬去的绿蜥蜴不多，对吧，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_cb755c86:

    # o "And, well, before you ask, this is not for sale, even for a roommate."
    o "还有，在你开口之前先说好：这个不卖，就算是室友也不行。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_71241cf1:

    # e "Well, it's not like I was about to ask you about it. Did Seb make this too?"
    e "我又没打算问这个。这个也是塞巴斯做的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_bf529385:

    # o "Yes, he did. There was a time when he was fervent about making some cute dolls, of him mostly but sometimes he used the doll as an excuse to... study my proportions."
    o "没错。有段时间他特别热衷于做可爱的玩偶，大多是做自己的样子；不过有时他会拿玩偶当借口……研究我的身材比例。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_7aa8e4af:

    # o "I just let him have his fun anyway, the proportion never turned out that well because he's not cutting the fabric correctly, and the wool isn't filling up all the nooks and crannies inside."
    o "我就由着他开心了。只是成品的比例总是不太对，因为他裁布的手法不行，羊毛也填不满里面所有的角落。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_09d48dd9:

    # "Ole picks up the doll, feinting a soft smile."
    "奥利捡起玩偶，露出温柔的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_317f961f:

    # o "But, it looks pretty cute, and I've never received such a gift before, so this one has a special place in my heart."
    o "不过它看起来挺可爱的。我以前从没收到过这么好的礼物，所以它在我心里有着特殊的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_52811803:

    # o "And, maybe, he'll pick the needle up and sew you one! Seb's totally fond of you being here so I can't see a world where there won't be a dragon plush in the shop one day."
    o "而且，说不定他会拿起针线，也给你缝一个！塞巴斯可喜欢你住在这里了，所以我想象不出店里有一天会没有龙玩偶。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_113aab10:

    # e "You bet."
    e "那当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_d61ca3ea:

    # "A mysterious statue of a goat sitting and wearing a simple mask. Doesn't seem to be for sale like the other items in the shop."
    "一尊戴着简朴面具、盘坐着的神秘山羊石像。它不像店里的其他物品那样出售。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_7f7293df:

    # e "Hey, Ole, what's this statue about? It looks kinda creepy."
    e "嘿，奥利，这尊石像是怎么回事？看着有点瘆人。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_e06ee59e:

    # o "A traveller pawned this away a long time ago, it's from an old religion of some sort, it's very valuable, actually, considering the rarity."
    o "很久以前有个旅行者把它拿来典当。它似乎属于某种古老宗教；考虑到其稀有程度，其实相当值钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_fd37a6dc:

    # e "Wait, what's this old religion?"
    e "等等，什么叫古老宗教？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_ac68ab4c:

    # o "According to the old Kechioeren tales, the goats seemed to worship Tapjoo, who they believe to give them the magical flowing water."
    o "山羊似乎崇拜塔普朱；他们相信塔普朱能赐予他们魔法流水。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_5ac93b3e:

    # o "But, I suppose they stopped worshipping when the god's been gone for such a long time."
    o "不过，神明已经消失这么久了，我想他们也就不再崇拜了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_01fb39ab:

    # o "It's hastily made, bad texture and materials, but the value comes from its history."
    o "它的制作很粗糙，质地和材料都很差；它的价值来自历史。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_4e24ade2:

    # o "this is what Tapjoo's supposed to look like, at least it's what the goats imagined him to be."
    o "山羊们想象中的塔普朱就是这副模样。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kingspawn_c918c57c:

    # e "Oh, I see I see."
    e "哦，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield02_ad070029:

    # "Right as you walk into the main square, in front of Cane's tavern, You hear a shout from over to your right, where you normally meet Jog and Amble."
    "你刚走进主广场，来到凯恩酒馆前，就听见右边传来喊声——那是你平时与乔格和安布碰面的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield02_5254a42f:

    # my "Hey, [e] get over here!"
    my "嘿，[e]，过来！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield02_1db6d93e:

    # "Realistically, you should head over there now, but it's honestly up to you at the end of the day."
    "严格来说，你现在该往那边去，不过最终决定权在你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_9ba1f33d:

    # "A series of drawings scatters around the house, but you notice two distinctively different style in them, one looks like innocent doodles, while the others are almost exclusively detailed drawing of a young Rahim."
    "房子周围散落着一系列画作，但你注意到两种截然不同的风格：一类看起来只是天真的涂鸦，另一类几乎都是对年轻雷希姆的细致描绘。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_56d3db03:

    # "One of them describes his choice of clothes. And the arrows point to the materials used and sewing techniques."
    "其中一幅描绘着他挑选的衣服，箭头指向所用的材料和缝纫手法。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_79f5dfb0:

    # e "Hey Rahim, who drew these drawings?"
    e "嘿，雷希姆，这些画是谁画的？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_834458c7:

    # "Rahim turns his head towards the wall half-heartedly, before turning again to stare at you."
    "雷希姆敷衍地把头转向墙壁，随后又转回来盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_822bb17c:

    # r "Who do you think?"
    r "你觉得是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_df81e672:

    # e "Uhm... I- uh I don't want to guess."
    e "呃……我、我不想猜。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_f02f9089:

    # r "The better looking ones were my former wife's. She has a tendency to draw whatever was in front of her eyes."
    r "那些画得更好的，是我前妻的作品。她总喜欢把眼前看到的东西画下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_90be366a:

    # e "I see, it seems you were in front of her eyes a lot."
    e "我明白了。看来你经常出现在她眼前。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_415a28a3:

    # e "And, I'd say she captured your handsomeness perfectly. You looked pretty cheerful in the drawings."
    e "而且我得说，她把你的英俊展现得淋漓尽致。画里的你看起来相当开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_f0992fe6:

    # "You turn to Rahim, waiting for a response, but it seems he'd already returned to work."
    "你转向雷希姆等他回应，却发现他已经回去工作了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_2b7aa352:

    # "A tanning station with a stack of some leathers of uneven shapes, waiting to be tanned for use in certain equipment and clothing."
    "一张鞣皮台旁堆着形状不一的皮革，正等着被鞣制成装备和衣物。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_b0b9d4e0:

    # "You don't doubt these are ethically collected."
    "你毫不怀疑这些皮革都是以合乎道德的方式取得的。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_119e0f75:

    # "A basket full of miscellaneous items placed on the ground, one of them were a golden badge, seemingly from somewhere fancy."
    "地上放着一篮杂物，其中有一枚金色徽章，看起来来自某个显赫之地。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_83feca6d:

    # e "Rahim, what's the use of this basket over here?"
    e "雷希姆，这篮子是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_df17f211:

    # r "Hey, don't put your dirty hands on my old stuff, they're most delicate and flimsy."
    r "喂，别用你那双脏手碰我的旧物，它们精致又脆弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_91c876d6:

    # e "I saw a crown, and... a badge? Are they yours?"
    e "我看见一顶王冠，还有……一枚徽章？都是你的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_681ad974:

    # r "These were leftovers from when I tailored the king's wardrobe."
    r "这是我为国王裁制衣物时留下的边角料。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_rahimshop_42555244:

    # r "Obviously, when I retired from the palace, we left on good terms, so I took some high-quality fabric and sundry items for myself."
    r "很明显，我离开宫廷时双方好聚好散，所以我拿了些高档布料和杂物留给自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_df2eb2eb:

    # "The paper is an old flyer reporting on the news. It writes:"
    "这张纸是一份报道新闻的旧传单。上面写着："

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_08311910:

    # "'Hear ye, hear ye, good folk of Lusterfield! Our beloved champion, Lothar the Brave, has once again proven why his name echoes in the hearts of Lusterfolks!'"
    "听好了，听好了，乐斯民菲尔德的各位乡亲！我们敬爱的勇士洛萨尔再次证明了，为什么他的名字会回响在每一位乐斯民菲尔德人的心中！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_fc3052ab:

    # "'Yesterday, a dire threat descended upon our peaceful village — a loincloth thief, caught by the local tailor, fled across the streets and brushed off a basket of oranges!'"
    "昨天，一个可怕的威胁降临我们和平的村庄——一个被当地裁缝当场抓住的兜裆布小偷逃过街道，还撞翻了一篮橙子！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_a7667f76:

    # "'With the courage of a goat-slayer, Lothar, strode forth to strike down the thief. Eyewitness report that our hero wrestled the loincloth from the hands of the running thief.'"
    "凭着屠羊勇士的勇气，洛萨尔挺身而出，击倒小偷。目击者称，我们的英雄从奔逃的小偷手中夺回了兜裆布。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_eeac9941:

    # "''It was like lightning - Lothar shoved that guy into the ground in one swoop!' Witness proclaimed.'"
    "‘简直快如闪电——洛萨尔一招就把那家伙按进了地里！’证人宣称。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_5a1ad5c2:

    # "'The thief was quickly apprehended by the hero. 'It's not fair, the whole village can smell that bull's musk from streets away.' The loincloth thief is now prohibited from using the local clothsline.'"
    "小偷很快被英雄擒获。‘这不公平，整座村子隔着几条街都能闻到那头公牛的麝香味。’兜裆布小偷如今被禁止使用本地晾衣绳。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_bd8d0609:

    # "'But the stolen loincloths, lost in the chaos, are nowhe-'"
    "‘但是那些在混乱中丢失的兜裆布，现在他——’"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_8e6e91b2:

    # "The flyer tears off from here."
    "传单从这里撕裂了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_760ee70f:

    # "'Archery Skill Showdown'"
    "‘射箭技巧大比拼’"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_d3e13b90:

    # "'For every points won over the other, the winner gets to slap the loser's ass. Everyone gets three arrows.'"
    "‘每领先对手一分，胜者就能打输家的屁股。每人有三支箭。’"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_55fcf753:

    # "'Bull's Eye is 10 points, the inner white ring is worth 5 points, then 3 points, then 1 points.'"
    "‘靶心10分，内圈白环5分，接着是3分，再外圈1分。’"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_7c56b83a:

    # "'Amble (Left) against Jog (Right)'"
    "‘安布（左）对乔格（右）’"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_cf08fdcb:

    # "'First shot, out of bound-'"
    "‘第一箭，脱靶——’"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_92a1d838:

    # "The note ends here."
    "笔记到此为止。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_67787666:

    # "There's another line behind the notes: 'Finally he said yes! I'm gonna slap his ass so much both cheek's gonna go red for weeks.'"
    "笔记背后还有一行字：‘他终于答应了！我要把他的屁股打得两边红上好几个星期。’"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_676af6a1:

    # "The metal clank against each other with a heavy, dull thud. It doesn't seem to be correct..."
    "金属彼此碰撞，发出沉重而沉闷的声响。似乎不太对劲……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_0253f0a3:

    # "With a swift twist, the tumblers behind the lock quickly fall into places, you can hear a smooth, subtle click before the chest's lid bounces up."
    "你灵巧地一拧，锁后的簧片迅速归位；箱盖弹起前，你听见一声平滑而细微的咔哒声。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_50a067c1:

    # "You push the lid up curiously, there doesn't seem to be a lot of items lying inside. It was mostly a pile of yellow leaves, papers with faded inks and some dried plum pits..."
    "你好奇地推开箱盖，里面没放多少东西。大多是一些发黄的叶子、墨迹褪色的纸张，以及几颗风干的李子核……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_e28192b3:

    # "Within the leaves, you find an old white rag that says 'small hyena, wanted alive, bounty 10 gold-' with the red doodle of a poorly-drawn face."
    "在叶子堆里，你找到一块旧白布，上面写着‘小型豺狼人，活捉，赏金10金币——’，旁边画着一张潦草的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_ea39b6b4:

    # "You also find two green ointments, and five pieces of patches scattered around the chest."
    "箱子周围还散落着两瓶绿色药膏和五块补丁。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_a1185a9b:

    # "At the bottom of the chest, you find a wooden cylinder, it seems to be a flute of some sort."
    "箱底有个木制圆筒，似乎是某种笛子。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_a2ca1888:

    # "There's a hyena head at one end, it looks primitive, the canines poking outwards does not resemble someone like Jog at all."
    "一端刻着豺狼人的脑袋，模样很原始；向外突出的犬齿完全不像乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_5fde9759:

    # "You can feel your mind fluttering as you hold the mouthpart in your hand, your eyes roll back as you find yourself staring at a group of gnolls surrounding something."
    "你把笛嘴握在手里，感觉意识一阵飘忽。眼前一转，你发现自己正看着一群围绕着某物的豺狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_88372ca5:

    # "With a heavy breath, you return to reality once more, staring at the flute, you feel compelled to keep it for now."
    "你沉重地喘了口气，再次回到现实。你盯着笛子，觉得自己暂时必须把它留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_e5a67b6c:

    # msg "The ruttish flute keepsake is added to your inventory. You can use the item to experience its past."
    msg "淫乐笛已加入你的背包。你可以使用它，体验它的过往。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_range_chest_abc68838:

    # "You stand up from the chest."
    "你从箱子旁站起身。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_mayors_longhouse_loop_7b3f7638:

    # "After clearing the last patch of moss, you stand back to admire your efforts."
    "清除最后一片苔藓后，你退后一步，欣赏自己的成果。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_mayors_longhouse_loop_a05bcf98:

    # r "Well, that's all of them. The place looks much better now, don't you think?"
    r "好了，全部清理完了。这里现在好看多了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_mayors_longhouse_loop_b08e9c4b:

    # e "It does, it's a lot brighter in here as well, and the air's drier."
    e "是啊，里面也明亮多了，空气也干燥了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_lusterfield_mayors_longhouse_loop_99b32fe0:

    # "Rahim pats your back lightly enough to make you stagger forward. At least you've bought a faint smile from his face."
    "雷希姆轻轻拍了拍你的背，力道却让你踉跄着向前。至少你让他脸上露出了一丝淡淡的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_dialogue_e789f8e5:

