    s "当然！看看外面，太阳都升起来照你了！我猜是我们的床太舒服了……不过，你的伤怎么样了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_dialogue_f0f68570:

    # e "I'm feeling pretty well right now, Ole's ointment really worked!"
    e "我现在感觉好多了，奥利的药膏真管用！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_dialogue_dca38e93:

    # s "Heh... He has his own recipe for all medicines like this, if you want to know more you can always ask him for some."
    s "呵……这类药都是他自己配的。想多了解的话，随时可以找他问问。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_dialogue_9d20aedd_1:

    # s "Good Fucking Morning, [e]!"
    s "早安个屁，[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_dialogue_a2be4c8d_1:

