    e "你需要什么吗？塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_094c362b:

    # s "Uh... U-hm.. Beer! I- uh... need uh beer. more... I told y-you I can take 6 bottles, 7-...uhh."
    s "啤酒，我需要啤酒……我告诉过你，我能喝六瓶，七——呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_817c442f:

    # e "He seems... too drunk already. Should I give him... a beer?" nointeract
    e "他似乎已经醉得不省人事了。我要给他啤酒吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_3a45cc31:

    # e "Here's your... beer."
    e "给……你的啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_c72e3e48:

    # s "Bier Beer... uhh- t-thanks server."
    s "啤……啤酒……呃——谢、谢谢服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_f1ce3b14:

    # "Sebas takes a beer from your hand and pour it straight into his mouth."
    "塞巴斯从你手里接过啤酒，直接往嘴里灌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_6ae689f9:

    # e "Hey... Slow down, Seb."
    e "嘿……慢点，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_5969b824:

    # "The lion continues gulping down the alcohol like a whale gulping water. You look at him, can't decide if you are mesmerised or traumatised."
    "狮子继续像鲸鱼吞水一样灌酒。你看着他，一时分不清自己是被迷住了，还是受到了惊吓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_976a30f7:

    # s "Haaaah...so... good."
    s "哈啊……好……舒服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_555fc0d4:

