    "塞巴斯看着手里空空的瓶子……盯了你几秒，随后又笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_68466dec:

    # s "S-server... you look like... a d-dragon. Like [e]."
    s "服、服务员……你看起来像……一条龙。像[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_875cdd45:

    # s "I wanna... f-fuck your ass, [e]. Y-you're... so. hot. Hotty. hot-"
    s "我想……操你的屁股，[e]。你、你真……性感。大美人……热——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_81029163:

    # s "Hmmph... your mouth... it was s-so... good."
    s "嗯……你的嘴……真、真舒服……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_0e0eba67:

    # s "L-lemme hug you... and p-put yer good ass and mouth to use..."
    s "让、让我抱抱你……把你那漂亮的屁股和嘴派上用场……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_9bb17ab5:

    # "You are a little confused as to what's going on, or whether all of this is true."
    "你有些困惑，不知道究竟发生了什么，也不知道这一切是否属实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_c494ae54:

    # "But he soon fell asleep... so you decide against asking nor confirming his words."
    "但他很快就睡着了……于是你决定既不追问，也不去确认他的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_479a11b1:

    # e "I don't think you should drink more, Seb."
    e "我觉得你不该再喝了，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_8f142ebb:

    # s "Ugh. one star S-service. Hmm..."
    s "呃……一星级服、服务。嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_578e054a:

    # e "Hmm... I don't have any beer here."
    e "我这儿已经没有啤酒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_8f142ebb_1:

    # s "Ugh. one star S-service. Hmm..."
    s "呃……一星级服、服务。嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_71f69f8a:

    # o "He's doing fine, just don't give him any beer."
    o "他没事，只是别再给他啤酒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Drunk_How_Doing_9a7bb4ed:

