    # e "Ahem... so! What's the plan...?"
    e "咳……那么，计划是什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_50187609:

    # o "As usual, we'll meet at the Tavern."
    o "照常，我们在酒馆碰头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6938f316:

    # s "Meet us there at night time. Alright."
    s "晚上到那里来找我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b3a9474f:

    # s "Uh... No need to bring anything, we've got gold."
    s "呃……不用带什么，我们有金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4e00d00e:

    # s "But bring some for yourself so you can actually bet on something."
    s "不过你还是带点自己的，这样才有东西可赌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_5cfad1f0:

    # o "I suppose that bat friend of yours can get you a bag of coins if you ever need one."
    o "要是你需要，我想你的蝙蝠朋友能给你一袋硬币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_c736099d:

    # o "Don't bring too much, you're gonna lose it to Cane anyway."
    o "别带太多，反正最后都会输给凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b656cdae:

    # "Ole chuckles, casually fidgeting with his dewlap."
    "奥利轻笑起来，随手摆弄着自己颈下的肉垂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_430e4bc0:

    # "You haven't ever seen Ole look this... this relaxed. He's always seemed so cautious, so attentive."
    "你从没见过奥利如此……如此放松。他平时总是那么谨慎、专注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7bd8df44:

    # "It Somehow comes as a surprise to you that he can actually relax, even as he closes his eyes in front of you."
    "即使他当着你的面闭上眼睛，你仍然很惊讶他居然真的能放松下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_c2716d5c:

    # s "Well buddy, we'll see you there then."
    s "好，兄弟，那我们晚上见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4ae8394a:

    # e "See you, Seb and Ole."
    e "回头见，塞巴斯、奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_27dcabc5:

    # o "Hmmph... I've told you this a few times, but, it's good to have you here."
    o "我都告诉过你几次了，不过……有你在这里真好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dd99fd32:

    # "Ole stands back up, and gets back to work."
    "奥利重新站起身，回去工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6ce79733:

    # o "Remember to come tonight. We'll be waiting for you."
    o "记得今晚过来。我们会等你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b988d61b:

    # e "Well I'd maybe, uh. I'll- Uhem..."
    e "我也许……呃。我——呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_d979735b:

    # "You have no idea what your brain is doing, but it's not going great. Only a mush of words comes out of your mouth, leaving the lion confused."
    "你完全不知道自己的大脑在做什么，但显然情况不妙。你嘴里只能吐出一团含混的话，让狮子一头雾水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7b40b6b8:

    # e "I'll go with you guys next tim-"
    e "下、下次我和你们一起去——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_2772e2e6:

    # s "Why?"
    s "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_e7c62786:

    # "The sudden injection of the lion caught you off guard. His tone is much more firm and stern than you're used to."
    "狮子突然插话，让你措手不及。他的语气比平时坚定、严厉得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_0c2167bd:

    # e "I'll need to uhm... attend other businesses."
    e "我需要……呃……去处理别的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_48ee2f5e:

    # s "But I'm your buddy, right?"
    s "但我是你的朋友，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_9dab544e:

    # e "Seb. I'm still here, I'll go with you whenever I'm ready."
    e "塞巴斯，我还在这儿。等我准备好就跟你去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_3f62caac:

    # s "But I have been always ready for you."
    s "但我随时都为你准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_e3b78845:

    # "Sebas stares at you, his mouth hangs agape. All the while Ole furrows his brows, interjecting."
    "塞巴斯盯着你，张着嘴说不出话。奥利皱起眉头，插话道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b9dc0dbc:

    # o "Stop with the whining, Seb. Let him decide for himself."
    o "别抱怨了，塞巴斯。让他自己决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_13f9f9d1:

    # "The shop soon becomes silent as Ole finishes his sentence."
    "奥利说完后，店里很快安静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_94cdc7f3:

    # "Sebas is still in shock. You didn't expect his reaction to be this strong. But he slowly calms down."
    "塞巴斯仍处于震惊之中。你没想到他的反应会这么强烈，但他慢慢平静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_27e73340:

    # s "I- uhm... yes. Well, sorry if I acted strange."
    s "我——呃……好吧。如果我刚才表现得很奇怪，抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_568de443:

    # e "You're fine with this... right?"
    e "你对此……没意见吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_1dfecf4f:

    # s "I am. I'll probably just wait until the frivolous lizard is done with his inventory and we'll go to the Tavern."
    s "我没意见。我大概会等这条冒失的蜥蜴整理完库存，然后我们再去酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_8b3306bf:

    # "The lion shifts back to his lively self quite quickly, as opposed to your expectation."
    "出乎你的意料，狮子很快就恢复了活泼的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6cf859cd:

    # o "Well, this frivolous lizard isn't going to bring your drunk butt back home if you're still bubbling with your gabby mouth."
    o "如果你还在喋喋不休，这只冒失的蜥蜴可不会把你这醉醺醺的屁股拖回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_3e7345d4:

    # s "Ha, he can't even beat a drunk lion in that disk game."
    s "哈，他在那个圆盘游戏里连一头醉狮子都赢不了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_840e3118:

    # s "He lost to me last time we did, it was soooo embarrassing. I was drunk as hell and I drank like a full barrel of that beer."
    s "上次玩的时候他还输给我，丢人极了。我当时醉得要命，喝下了整整一桶那种啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dca3d84f:

    # o "I only lost because you begged me to take it easy to impress that someone else."
    o "我只是因为你求我手下留情，好在某个人面前出风头，才输的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b76b0d97:

    # s "Excuses!"
    s "借口！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_73679941:

    # o "Believe it or not, there was one time when we went there, you got so drunk you basically fell on the pile of bottles."
    o "信不信由你，有一次我们去那里时，你醉得直接栽进了瓶子堆里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dfe223d8:

    # s "That's not relevant to what we're talking about, you lost!"
    s "那和我们现在说的无关——你就是输了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_aec64dd0:

    # "You are not sure if Seb is still angry over your answer... but seeing him back to his old self is certainly a bit of relief."
    "你不确定塞巴斯是否还在为你的回答生气……但看着他恢复往常的样子，你确实松了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4d60299f:

    # e "Uhmm..." nointeract
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4e3b1024:

    # e "Give some credit to Seb, I think he may have really nailed the throw."
    e "承认一下塞巴斯的本事吧，我觉得他那一投确实很准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4955614c:

    # s "See? Even [e] agrees with my amazing talent at throwing."
    s "看吧？连[e]都认可我惊人的投掷天赋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_8eaac967:

    # o "Don't get flattered. [e] is just being polite after you threw a tantrum at him just minutes ago."
    o "别得意。[e]只是因为你几分钟前还对他发脾气，所以才客气一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_846da231:

    # s "Heh, if this is being polite then I'd gladly tantrum all over [e]... Is there something as tantruming?"
    s "呵，如果这也算客气，那我倒乐意让[e]对我发一通脾气……‘对我发脾气’有这种说法吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7aa043d6:

    # s "Hey, that's not fair, I don't see him as rude at any point."
    s "嘿，这不公平，我从没觉得他粗鲁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6b2c6c12:

    # e "I wasn't just being polite, I genuinely believe in Seb."
    e "我不只是出于礼貌，我是真心相信塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_0972165c:

    # s "Aww... Don't worry, [e]. Ole is just salty that I am your favourite roomie."
    s "啊……别担心，[e]。奥利只是嫉妒，因为我是你最喜欢的室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4190e869:

    # s "His aiming was so fucking bad he hit a dude's crotch from the other side of the tavern. It's amazing actually how you can do that."
    s "他的准头差得要命，竟然从酒馆另一头射中了一个人的胯部。你居然能做到这一点，真是不可思议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7c14b01d:

    # o "Ok, you should go back to attend your table now before I take over the shop and kick you out of it."
    o "好了，你现在该回去招呼你的桌子了，不然我就接管这家店，再把你踢出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_ad3df93e:

    # s "Oh No! I'm so scared!. Ha."
    s "哦，不！我好害怕！哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_647b2edc:

    # "He turns back at you and gives your hand a huge squeeze."
    "他转身面对你，用力握了握你的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_709f2726:

    # e "I don't think Ole's gonna unintentionally be that bad, and I doubt Seb's going to remember the score that vividly when he's drunk."
    e "我不觉得奥利会无意中差到那种程度，而且我怀疑塞巴斯喝醉后还能记清比分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_82c985ec:

    # s "Really? Don't get fooled by this guy's appearance, he's a master of sucking at tavern games I tell you buddy."
    s "真的？别被这家伙的外表骗了，他可是酒馆游戏的绝顶菜鸟——我跟你说，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4190e869_1:

    # s "His aiming was so fucking bad he hit a dude's crotch from the other side of the tavern. It's amazing actually how you can do that."
    s "他的准头差得要命，竟然从酒馆另一头射中了一个人的胯部。你居然能做到这一点，真是不可思议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b55f9515:

    # o "[e] said it. You're too complacent just because I played one game badly."
    o "[e]说得对。你只是因为有一局玩得很差，就太自满了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_c16d75f7:

    # "Wait, Ole, you actually lost to a drunk Seb?"
    e "等等，奥利，你真的输给一个醉醺醺的塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_0af7971f:

    # o "No... I mean, the ball there was chipped, it steered off mid-way there."
    o "不……我的意思是，那个球有缺口，中途偏离了方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_092a91d2:

    # s "See? I told you, it actually happened. Maybe you should join us next time so we can hang out, and see how bad this little lizard throws."
    s "看吧？我就说是真的。下次你也该加入我们，看看这只小蜥蜴的投掷有多糟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_5b6a776e:

    # e "O-okay! But I'll bet on Ole over a drunk lion any other day."
    e "好、好吧！不过其他时候，我还是会押奥利赢，而不是一头醉狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_fee87e41:

    # s "Ha, you'll see, you'll see, you naughty little roomie."
    s "哈，你到时候就知道了——你这个淘气的小室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_5fa0ad10:

    # o "At least [e] has my back."
    o "至少[e]站在我这边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_257b64f0:

    # "Ole gives you a gentle smile."
    "奥利朝你温柔地笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_54238028:

    # s "Anyway, we shouldn't keep [e] here too long."
    s "总之，我们不该让[e]在这里待太久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_61578aba:

    # s "But you have to remember to let me know when you have time, alright?"
    s "不过你有空时记得告诉我，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dbd14c20:

    # e "Yes, thanks Seb."
    e "好，谢谢你，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_747ca868:

    # s "Hehe."
    s "嘿嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_e5c53a7f:

    # s "Gooooo-d Fu-"
    s "早……安……操——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_81988f9c:

    # "Sebas pauses."
    "塞巴斯停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_adb35810:

    # s "Anyway, [e]! we were just going to head out. Want to join us here?"
    s "总之，[e]！我们正准备出发。要不要一起？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_1e2e50da:

    # e "I thought you two were there...?"
    e "我还以为你们已经在那边了……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_0d1213a8:

    # o "If it didn't take Seb so long to pack his stuff we'd be there already."
    o "要不是塞巴斯收拾东西花了这么久，我们早就到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_5a19c34d:

    # s "You're making me so nervous here looking at me all the time."
    s "你一直盯着我看，搞得我好紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_e67c3e48:

    # "The lizard looks away as he opens the door for both you and Seb."
    "蜥蜴给你和塞巴斯开门时，移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_9d103852:

    # s "Forget it, let's go..."
    s "别管了，我们走吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_467b9970:

    # "The bell on the door clanks as you three have arrived at the Nocturnal Trunk."
    "门上的铃铛叮当作响，你们三人到了夜夜椿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_5879c31b:

    # "You are beginning to anticipate the familiar scent of alcohol and meat, the frequented patrons wave at you, seemingly greeting a familiar face here."
    "你开始闻到熟悉的酒肉香气。常来的客人向你挥手，仿佛在向一张熟悉的面孔打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_25febc16:

    # "Sebas swiftly finds an empty table at the center of the tavern."
    "塞巴斯迅速在酒馆中央找到一张空桌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_da63231b:

    # o "Well, take a seat here, [e]."
    o "来，坐这儿，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_6e6c7174:

    # "Ole drags out a chair gently, gesturing you to sit between Ole and Sebas."
    "奥利轻轻拉出一把椅子，示意你坐在他和塞巴斯之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_b457f085:

    # "You take the empty seat between the lion and the lizard."
    "你在狮子和蜥蜴之间的空位坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_59eb1747:

    # s "H-hey! Goooooo-d Fuckin- Morning- [e]-."
    s "早……啊！该死的早上好，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_a44e2294:

    # o "Heya!"
    o "嘿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_a8687385:

    # "You notice the two familiar faces in the Tavern, one is Sebas, and the other Ole. You wave at them, heartily walking towards the two shopkeepers."
    "你注意到酒馆里那两张熟悉的面孔——塞巴斯和奥利。你朝他们挥手，兴冲冲地走向这两位店主。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_da63231b:

    # o "Well, take a seat here, [e]."
    o "来，坐这儿，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_6e6c7174:

    # "Ole drags out a chair gently, gesturing you to sit between Ole and Sebas."
    "奥利轻轻拉出一把椅子，示意你坐在他和塞巴斯之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_b457f085:

    # "You take the empty seat between the lion and the lizard."
    "你在狮子和蜥蜴之间的空位坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_36503303:

    # "As you settle, you lean forwards in anticipation, waiting for shopkeepers to start talking."
    "你坐稳后，满怀期待地身体前倾，等着两位店主开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_12888e62:

    # "But immediately, you notice both of them are staring towards your posture, causing you to sit up straight."
    "可你立刻注意到，他们都盯着你的坐姿，于是赶紧坐直了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_077e4f7e:

    # e "Are you two doing alright?"
    e "你们两个还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fa3369f3:

    # s "Yep. So very alright, I've finally got my favorite roommate out."
    s "好得很！我总算把我最喜欢的室友带出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_817bf605:

    # o "Not as so when I waited for almost an hour for Seb to actually get going."
    o "可我等了差不多一个小时，塞巴斯才终于肯动身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_71274785:

    # s "Hey, that's not my problem at all. It wasn't even evening and you closed the shop much earlier than usual."
    s "嘿，那根本不是我的错！天还没黑你就关店了，比平时早得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f266a1e6:

    # o "That should give you more time to organize your bags, not the other way around."
    o "那本来是想给你更多时间收拾行李，结果你反而花得更久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c8291b9a:

    # e "You two usually come here at this time right?"
    e "你们平时这个时候都会来这里，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3ff5b22f:

    # s "Well, Ole and I come here on the weekend."
    s "我和奥利周末会来这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_789821da:

    # s "It's usually just me who comes to drink here on the weekend, sometimes I can get Ole to go with me, but it's not like he's drinking beer."
    s "通常只有我会在周末来这里喝酒。有时我能把奥利叫来陪我，但他又不喝啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_377b4e17:

    # o "I'm just cruising, bread is good enough for me."
    o "我只是来消遣的，有面包对我来说就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_77220bb9:

    # e "So, what are we doing here today?"
    e "那么，我们今天来这里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_07aeee36:

    # s "We feast! That's what we do. That disk game looks available today, perhaps you should try it out."
    s "我们来大吃一顿！这就是我们要做的。今天飞盘游戏似乎也能玩，也许你该试试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_43f62810:

    # e "I suppose I have been in the Tavern more than a couple times."
    e "我在酒馆待过不止几次了，这点我倒是知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_dd823823:

    # s "Yes but I can ask Cane to set up those little games here-"
    s "是啊，不过我可以让凯恩把那些小游戏摆出来——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4a2e9e09:

    # "Before Sebas finishes his sentence, you notice a familiar figure arriving to your table."
    "塞巴斯话还没说完，你就注意到一个熟悉的人影来到了桌边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_328bca85:

    # "It's Cane, you can smell his scent from afar without even looking at him."
    "是凯恩。即使不用抬头看，你也能从远处闻到他的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_42a4f1c6:

    # s "Ha, talk of the devil."
    s "哈，说曹操曹操到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e2fcee74:

    # c "If it ain't my favorite customer and server on the same table! And the lizard fella too."
    c "哟，这不是我最喜欢的客人和服务员嘛，居然坐到同一桌了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e6f0d15c:

    # c "What'cha like, same one beer for the lion eh?"
    c "狮子还是老样子，来一杯啤酒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2982fb11:

    # s "The usual best dinner you have, and a pot of that hearty Hunter's Stew, with extra portions for my buddy right here."
    s "照旧，来你这儿最好的晚餐，再来一锅丰盛的猎人炖菜，给我这位朋友多分一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0aea56b7:

    # s "And give me the best of the best beer! I'm gonna get so fucking drunk tonight."
    s "再给我最好的啤酒！今晚我要他妈的喝个痛快！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d0ba4de7:

    # "Cane chuckles as he writes down his order on a piece of paper."
    "凯恩笑着把订单写在纸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0ed78ac8:

    # c "Sure, and lizard, ye in fer a treat today. We've got some rye bread fresh out of the oven."
    c "当然。还有你，蜥蜴，今天有口福了。刚出炉的黑麦面包，热乎着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_742c0d23:

    # o "Alright, then I'll have two... or three."
    o "好吧，那我就要两片……或者三片。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9699b64d:

    # "Ole smirks."
    "奥利露出一抹坏笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_00e144f4:

    # o "And give me some water please."
    o "再给我一些水，谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1b77bffb:

    # o "It's fine, I'll just get a piece of maslin as usual."
    o "没关系，我照常吃一块马斯林面包就好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_26c33441:

    # "Ole looks around, before reluctantly turning back to Cane."
    "奥利环顾四周，随后不情不愿地转回凯恩那边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fab51459:

    # c "We're on it."
    c "马上就来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_08f29f2b:

    # c "And lad, anything yer like?" nointeract
    c "小伙子，你想来点什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_380e1b70:

    # e "I'll have some Ale."
    e "我要一杯麦芽酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e23e59a8:

    # "Cane raises his brows slightly."
    "凯恩微微挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfb5d9ba:

    # c "Ain't cha hardy little fella. Alright, ale it is."
    c "哟，原来你还挺能喝。好，麦芽酒就麦芽酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fec3a6c8:

    # e "I'll have a Beer."
    e "我要一杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2571af92:

    # s "You can have mine, heh. I've ordered lots of them just for me and you!"
    s "喝我的就行，嘿嘿。我可是专门给咱俩点了好多杯！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b4aa80a0:

    # c "Then one more for the lad. How ya say, lion."
    c "那就再给这小子来一杯。狮子，你说呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9ed6a67b:

    # s "Well, my beer is his and his beer is mine."
    s "我的啤酒就是他的，他的啤酒就是我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_090dd8da:

    # "Sebas gives you a wink."
    "塞巴斯朝你眨了眨眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_374dc113:

    # e "I'll just get some bread."
    e "我就要些面包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3f23e772:

    # c "Oh? Not drinking tonight eh?"
    c "哦？今晚不喝酒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5588b171:

    # o "He's staying sober so we can both drag Seb back home."
    o "他得保持清醒，这样我们才能把塞巴斯拖回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_50ec86c1:

    # c "Well we have rooms here."
    c "我们这儿有房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b934df3b:

    # s "Not today, Cane. I have my best buddy [e] here, isn't that right."
    s "今天不行，凯恩。我最好的朋友[e]在这儿，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b1600753:

    # c "Alright then, we've got yer order."
    c "好，那就这么点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_920aaa73:

    # c "And lad, remember to check us out more often, we've got a nice job fer ya."
    c "小伙子，记得多来我们这儿看看。我们这里有份不错的活儿给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f6d29648:

    # "Cane turns back towards his counter, preparing food and drinks for your table."
    "凯恩转回柜台，为你们准备食物和饮料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b6a4e718:

    # e "So... what's a Hunter's Stew?"
    e "猎人炖菜是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4eeb26c6:

    # s "Oh? Didn't you work for the Tavern for quite a while? You should know that already."
    s "你不是在酒馆工作过挺长时间吗？应该早就知道了吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d0ed9dcc:

    # e "Hmmph... I didn't work in the kitchen, and it's not like Cane let me eat here. But it seems like the ingredients change every time I work here."
    e "我又没在厨房工作，而且凯恩也没让我在这里吃东西。不过我每次来帮忙时，食材好像都不一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3552fea9:

    # s "Damn, how can he do that to [e]. The Hunter's Stew is pretty good here, but it depends on the day."
    s "他怎么能这样对[e]？这里的猎人炖菜很不错，不过得看当天的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ef29efe3:

    # e "W-why's that?"
    e "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9c1e9ccf:

    # s "The hunters... namely, Lothar and others alike. Brings in meat and ingredients they collected today, and Cane puts them into a single stew."
    s "猎人们……也就是洛萨尔，还有其他那些人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d02978f8:

    # s "If they get something good today, we'll get to taste something good."
    s "他们会把今天找到的肉和食材带回来，凯恩再把它们全炖到一锅里。要是他们今天收获不错，我们就能尝到好东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e607f57e:

    # e "And if they get nothing..."
    e "那要是他们什么都没找到……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8ec97c0e:

    # o "You'll still get something to eat, the stew is never emptied all the way, but it's replenished every day."
    o "你还是有东西吃。炖菜从来不会彻底见底，只是每天都会补充新的食材。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bb744a10:

    # e "S-so... I'll have something from yesterday's hunt?"
    e "所以……我会吃到昨天猎来的东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_437183f5:

    # "Ole nods."
    "奥利点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0d6af7c0:

    # "The lion looks away for a second, and he smiles."
    "狮子移开视线，笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7784c33f:

    # s "Well there he goes, and here he comes."
    s "来了来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0e952bec:

    # "The tavern keeper arrives at your table with a plate full of beer, with some bread on the side."
    "酒馆老板端着一盘啤酒来到你们桌边，旁边还放着一些面包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_34e06233:

    # "Another plate comes with a variety of glistening meat pies, a pot of stew and a basket of fruits and tarts."
    "另一只盘子里装着各种油光发亮的肉馅饼，还有一锅炖菜，以及一篮水果和果馅挞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_42ef230c:

    # "Soon, the table is filled to brim with food and drinks, with a very happy lion on the side, drooling."
    "很快，桌上就摆满了食物和饮料；一旁的狮子开心得直流口水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_10e77e86:

    # c "There ya go, enjoy the night fer me, young lads."
    c "来，年轻人们，好好享受今晚吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0c0b5748:

    # s "Thanks a lot, Cane."
    s "多谢了，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bdfd99e4:

    # "Cane chuckles, he gives the lion a pat on the shoulder, before leaving to serve another table."
    "凯恩笑了笑，拍了拍狮子的肩膀，随后去招呼另一桌客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8ac20559:

    # o "So, anything interesting going on lately, [e]?"
    o "最近有什么有趣的事吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_933802a0:

    # "Ole says as he scoops up a spoonful of the pottage, you can see him gulping down different ingredients cheerfully."
    "奥利一边说，一边舀起一勺炖菜；你看着他开心地把各种食材咽下肚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_75eae884:

    # e "I ran some errands for Haskell lately."
    e "我最近替哈斯克尔跑了几趟腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0ec5b764:

    # s "Haskell? You mean the potions for our shop, right."
    s "哈斯克尔？你是说给咱们店送药水那件事，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_92f16cc0:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0c8596ca:

    # "Ole stands and scoops up another portion onto your bowl, dropping a huge chunk of meat inside."
    "奥利站起身，又舀了一勺炖菜到你的碗里，还放进一大块肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9e76e8ab:

    # "He doesn't need to speak, just gestures for you to take the stew from his hand."
    "他没有说话，只是示意你从他手里接过炖菜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_63827e3f:

    # "You extend your arm to accept the bowl, only to lightly scrape against his scaled paws."
    "你伸手接碗时，爪子轻轻擦过了他覆着鳞片的手掌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0614e2b7:

    # "He gasps and flinches a little before you wrap your paws around it, feeling the warmth emanating from the handsome lizard."
    "他倒吸一口气，微微瑟缩。你用爪子接住碗时，感受到这条英俊蜥蜴身上散发出的温度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bd926702:

    # "Ole looks completely flustered, he puts the stew in front of you, as he sits and nudges against the back of his claws for some time."
    "奥利显得十分慌乱。他把炖菜放到你面前，坐下后还用爪背不自在地蹭了好一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_83e07547:

    # "You take the bowl of stew from Ole, thanking him with a slight nod."
    "你从奥利手里接过一碗炖菜，微微点头向他道谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_70fd2ab2:

    # s "Ha, we were actually collecting materials for ourselves before you came along."
    s "哈，在你来之前，我们原本都是自己收集材料的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5d17f933:

    # s "But it really feels like you're part of the shop now, getting us materials and all."
    s "不过现在你给我们带材料，真的已经像是店里的一员了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_70d88f4d:

    # o "Yeah, we've got a lot of the strength potions sold so I'm just grateful [e] is here."
    o "是啊，我们已经卖掉很多力量药水了，所以我很庆幸[e]在这里帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_09c40593:

    # e "And I'm happy that you didn't mind it taking some extra long time."
    e "而且你们不介意我花了那么久，我也很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d32d1b18:

    # "You slurp up the stew from your spoon, and you can feel the warmth of the variety of ingredients nourishing your whole body."
    "你从勺子里啜饮炖菜，温热的食材顺着身体流下，滋养着你的每一寸血肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b28b9ca9:

    # "Meanwhile Sebas takes a bite out of the meaty pie. He never hesitates to show his messy side as oil and meat drips from his maw."
    "与此同时，塞巴斯咬了一口肉馅饼。他从不介意展现自己狼吞虎咽的一面，油脂和肉汁不断从嘴边滴落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f5177e50:

    # s "Mhmm... yes."
    s "嗯……好吃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7618b353:

    # "He wipes away the mess with his palm, the lion notices you staring at him and grins foolishly at you."
    "他用手掌擦掉嘴边的狼藉。狮子注意到你在盯着他，便冲你傻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca17821d:

    # o "Well, I know it's just Haskell, he's mostly the one that takes his time, letting things go on their full course and all."
    o "嗯，我知道，说到底那就是哈斯克尔。他做事总是慢悠悠的，非要让每件事按自己的节奏走完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_977ef296:

    # o "He has been like this since I first met him, just habits of an old dragon."
    o "我第一次见到他时他就是这样了，只是老龙的习惯而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfc3cca9:

    # "Sebas burps as Ole continues talking."
    "奥利继续说着，塞巴斯打了个嗝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_da20e945:

    # e "Yeah, and sometimes I just have tea with him in the forest."
    e "是啊，我有时会和他在森林里喝茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1554f512:

    # o "Hmm... You know, Haskell picked up on tea making only after I met him."
    o "我认识他以后，他才开始学着泡茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c7bc4f23:

    # o "He has a vast amount of knowledge on potion-making, but he grew bored of it at some point."
    o "他对炼制药水有着渊博的知识，但后来不知什么时候开始厌倦了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d2e89d3a:

    # o "I never talked to him about the potions anyway, the quality dropped pretty drastically since I asked you to bring them over."
    o "反正我也没再和他谈过药水的事。自从我让你送药水过去，品质就明显下降了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f217dcc9:

    # s "Ha- sch-we'll. I 'e-tsh he's b-ushy making ano-tshker round of tea for hims-schelf."
    s "哈——我、我敢打赌，他正忙着给自己泡下、一壶茶呢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_23ac7fee:

    # o "The potions are still as good as ever, but he doesn't sound too pleased when I come over to his hut."
    o "药水还是一如既往地好，不过我去他小屋时，他听起来可不太高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_54d346c1:

    # s "Ye-r, he deed ent even off-shr me that herbal t-ehe was-sh mak-ching, wha'a a shel-bish jer-ksh."
    s "对、他甚至都没让我尝尝他泡的草药茶，真是个自私的混蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3f7741bc:

    # s "N-ot st-hat I 'refsh-er te-a over my 'rec-shious be'er, h-heh."
    s "不、不、不是说我更喜欢茶胜过我珍贵的啤酒，嘿嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_602dd357:

    # "The lion talks with full mouth as he continues chewing through the meat, he doesn't even bother to enunciate his word clearly."
    "狮子继续嚼着肉，嘴里含满食物还在说话，连句子都懒得吐清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bf1397d1:

    # "He also mutters something else, but it was too indistinguishable from the sputtering sound of the pie."
    "他还嘟囔了几句别的，可声音混在肉馅饼的吧唧声里，根本听不清。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_acb8ad3e:

    # "Ole gives Sebas a side eye, the messy lion looks away, before swallowing the content silently."
    "奥利斜了塞巴斯一眼。那头吃得满脸狼藉的狮子移开视线，默默把嘴里的东西咽了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_014d1738:

    # e "Perhaps he just likes making tea for himself."
    e "也许他只是喜欢给自己泡茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_21d3b1b4:

    # o "Well, the dragon did promise us he'd help with the shop when the shop first opened."
    o "那条龙当初确实答应过我们，说店铺刚开张时会帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_64b43af2:

    # o "But I can't blame him for losing his passion..."
    o "不过，我也不能怪他后来失去了热情……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e2a6e272:

    # "A new idea comes across your mind, and that it might actually help both Ole and Haskell."
    "一个念头闪过你的脑海，也许真能同时帮到奥利和哈斯克尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1bfef146:

    # e "You know what? I think there's a way that both of you'd be satisfied..."
    e "我想到一个办法，应该能让你们两个都满意……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4accbf46:

    # e "How about, ask Haskell to sell his tea in your shop?"
    e "让哈斯克尔把茶拿到你们店里卖，怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4f68d8a3:

    # s "Oh? That's a good idea! We can make him sell his tea leaves and herbs, else those teas are gonna expire very quickly."
    s "哦？好主意！可以让他卖茶叶和草药，不然那些茶很快就要过期了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_be551bc2:

    # o "You're right, just the plants would suffice."
    o "你说得对，只卖那些植物就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5f6bd161:

    # o "It's not going to sell that much like potions, but I bet some people in the town are going to like it a lot."
    o "销量可能比不上药水，但我敢说镇上肯定有人会很喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e4baf75d:

    # e "I assure you, his tea is really great!"
    e "我保证，他泡的茶真的很棒！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e67aa920:

    # s "I don't doubt that, roomie. We'll have to take some notes, perhaps we should talk to the sleazy old dragon later."
    s "我完全相信你，室友。看来我们得记下来，之后去和那条邋遢的老龙谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f9e1607e:

    # "Sebas takes a mouthful of the beer, leaving remnants of white foams on his snout."
    "塞巴斯喝了一大口啤酒，鼻吻上沾了一圈白色泡沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_97897f02:

    # o "Alright, so... anything else?"
    o "好吧，那么……最近还有别的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f24f830b:

    # "You take a sip out of the Ale you ordered, the bitter and barley scent of the drink entices your snout, but the bitterness is too strong as you choke a bit."
    "你抿了一口点的麦芽酒。苦涩和大麦的香气钻进鼻腔，可味道太冲，你被呛得咳了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_945e6138:

    # "The lion and the lizard stare at you with concern before you gobble down the rest of the drink."
    "狮子和蜥蜴担心地盯着你，直到你把剩下的酒一口气咽了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9f2eb790:

    # "Surprisingly, there's an aftertaste of the mellow and fruity sweetness emanating from within your throat, it was quite a refreshing drink."
    "出乎意料的是，醇厚、果香四溢的甜味在喉咙里回荡；这酒还真是清爽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_00fe2196:

    # "You know you collected rosemary and barleys for the Ale, but you still wonder what other ingredients were put in there..."
    "你知道凯恩酿麦芽酒时用过你收集的迷迭香和大麦，可你还是好奇里面究竟加了什么别的材料……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0eec26aa:

    # s "Haha [e], I told you the ale here is really good! And I heard you collected the ingredients for Cane, so it's extra good!"
    s "哈哈，[e]！我就说这里的麦芽酒很棒吧！而且我听说那些材料还是你替凯恩收集的，所以味道就更好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_76db36cd:

    # o "Oh? Really. Sad I didn't get to taste [e]'s Ale."
    o "哦？是吗？可惜我没尝过[e]收集材料酿出来的麦芽酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a517443d:

    # s "Well O, the Ale is right in front of you."
    s "喏，麦芽酒就在你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfd10b34:

    # "The lizard quickly shakes his head."
    "蜥蜴连忙摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4a29487d:

    # o "No, no. I told you I don't drink."
    o "不、不，我告诉过你，我不喝酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_34a36fc3:

    # "You take a cup of beer from Sebas' pile. And begin gulping them down, a few drops of the beer spills right on your chest."
    "你从塞巴斯那堆啤酒里拿起一杯，开始大口灌下去；几滴酒水顺着杯沿洒到了胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_32f524c2:

    # s "Hey, take it easy, I- I don't even drink that fast."
    s "嘿，慢点。我、我都没喝那么快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_69a115fa:

    # o "Well, I'm sure [e] is going to be a little more careful with his cup than you do with half a dozen cups of beer here."
    o "我敢肯定，[e]喝一杯时会比你喝下半打啤酒更加小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5de6c720:

    # "You put down the empty cup, licking off the white foam around your lips."
    "你放下空杯，舔掉唇边的白色泡沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_907235ef:

    # e "What were you guys talking about...?"
    e "你们在说什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_92dc00c9:

    # o "Nothing at all."
    o "没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8c58229d:

    # "You take a huge bite out of the bread in front of you, it was surprisingly soft and emitting a light scent of sourdough."
    "你狠狠咬了一口面前的面包。它柔软得出人意料，还散发着淡淡的酸面香气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a8b54b5:

    # e "O-oh, this is pretty good."
    e "哦——哦，这味道真不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6a42fddc:

    # s "Take it slowly [e]. Cane adds so much sourdough from this bread you might as well get drunk from it."
    s "慢点吃，[e]。凯恩在面包里加了那么多酸面酵头，你没准会吃醉的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d5ffda26:

    # o "Well maybe that's why they're so good."
    o "也许这就是它们这么好吃的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1f321c6b:

    # "Ole taps the side of his head in front of Sebas with a slight chuckle."
    "奥利轻笑着，在塞巴斯面前敲了敲自己的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bcf662f1:

    # s "Ha, well, [e]. Anything else going on with you?"
    s "哈，[e]，你最近还有别的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6bf7acdd:

    # "Sebas doesn't hesitate to guzzle down another cup of beer, beer leaking from his mouth right down to his lower jaw."
    "塞巴斯毫不犹豫地又灌下一杯啤酒，酒水从嘴角一路流到下颌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_62723546:

    # "Some of it drizzles on his loincloth, but he doesn't even seem to notice."
    "有些酒水洒在他的兜裆布上，可他似乎完全没有察觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8193e1c3:

    # s "A-ah... so-o good."
    s "啊——啊……好、好喝……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31f6d6c2:

    # s "Damn, it's really fun to hang out with you, [e]. Despite the bad stuff, at least we get to know what's going on with you more!"
    s "和你一起玩真有意思，[e]！虽然最近也有不少糟心事，但至少我们更了解你了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fa2493c1:

    # o "Well, [e], whenever you're free, you can definitely hang out with us!"
    o "[e]，你什么时候有空都可以来和我们一起玩！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_55971e7b:

    # e "Thank you, you both are really flattering sometimes."
    e "谢谢，你们有时候真的把我夸得不好意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c928cd03:

    # s "I feel we're slowly becoming like a family. I remembered when I first met Ole, he was shy as hell! He was sitting in the forest alone there."
    s "我还记得第一次见到奥利时，他害羞得要命！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_99cc5dc5:

    # o "That... that was so long ago, Seb."
    o "那都是很久以前的事了，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_91ec9748:

    # s "Anyway, Ole here doesn't really like me talking about ancient histories."
    s "总之，奥利不喜欢我讲这些陈年往事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7235e8d8:

    # o "And neither do you too."
    o "你也一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e9bf51d8:

    # s "Uhm, anyway, we both settled in Lusterfield after his thing, and the thing is, we've been living together for like a decade, I see him just like a family."
    s "总之，后来我们都在乐斯民菲尔德安顿下来。说起来，我们已经一起住了十年，我早就把他当成家人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_60d8a7c4:

    # s "Sure, we took in roomies from time to time, but if you can settle here for the years to come, we'd just be like... family."
    s "当然，我们也会偶尔接纳别的室友。不过如果你愿意在这里住上几年，我们就会像……一家人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b4c2a050:

    # "Sebas screams in excitement, you wonder if he's drunk or if he means what he said, but his usual bright grin convinces you it's the latter."
    "塞巴斯兴奋地喊了起来。你不确定他是喝醉了，还是确实这么想；但他一贯灿烂的笑容让你相信是后者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f5f146c5:

    # e "I would like to live here for a long time too, Seb."
    e "我也想在这里住很久，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4ee1cd36:

    # s "Yeah! Stay for as looooooong as you wis-."
    s "好啊！想待多久都——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e83453c6:

    # "Sebas lets out a huge burp."
    "塞巴斯打了个震天响的嗝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1a956796:

    # "You chuckle slightly towards the embarrassed lion, as Ole takes another huge chunk out of his bread, finishing off the basket with a few bites."
    "你对尴尬的狮子轻轻一笑。奥利又从面包篮里掰下一大块，几口便把篮子吃空了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2332f108:

    # "The table is almost cleared all the way, only a few cup of beer left standing, and a stuffed roommate."
    "桌面几乎已经清空，只剩几杯啤酒，以及一个吃得肚子滚圆的室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca8c72de:

    # o "Looks like we're finished."
    o "看来我们吃完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5e249759:

    # s "We did, now it's time for Skittles, come on, [e]."
    s "吃完了，现在该玩滚瓶游戏了。来吧，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a6959cc0:

    # "Sebas says with his glistening eyes, you have seen it played a couple times from when you work in the Tavern, but you still don't know how it works."
    "塞巴斯两眼发亮地说。你在酒馆工作时见过别人玩过几次，可你还是不知道这游戏具体怎么玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2c6fe809:

    # o "Right, let's go then."
    o "好，我们走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7868f6ee:

    # "You follow the two towards a long lane in between tables of talking patrons, the floor seems to be varnished with shiny wax."
    "你跟着两人穿过交谈的客人，在桌子之间走向一条长长的通道；地板似乎打过蜡，闪闪发亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a719eab1:

    # s "Don't you walk on the lane buddy, you're gonna slip and snap your back like a twig in winter."
    s "别走到通道上，伙计。你会滑倒，脊背会像冬天的树枝一样啪地折断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b3c71459:

    # s "Should be good for some games... [e], have you played it before?"
    s "[e]，你以前玩过吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5be0435d:

    # e "I've peeked at some patrons playing the game before, but I haven't tried it myself..."
    e "我以前偷看过几位客人玩，但自己还没试过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7e227ca1:

    # s "Well, you're missing a lot of fun in your work, aren't you. We just put bottles on the floor, and guess what. You have got to roll the disks towards the bull's eye, not the real one."
    s "我们只要把瓶子摆在地上。然后你猜怎么着？你得把圆盘朝靶心掷过去——当然不是真正的牛眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_04c1ac6f:

    # o "You don't roll the disk, Seb. You'd just throw it there."
    o "不是把圆盘滚出去，塞巴斯。你只要把它掷过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7bd532aa:

    # s "I know. I know. I'm explaining it to [e]. Mister advisor lizard. Plus, rolling it sounds like a better game."
    s "我知道，我知道！我是在给[e]解释，蜥蜴顾问先生。而且滚出去听起来明明更像一场好游戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b41469c6:

    # o "That's the rule in the Nocturnal Trun-"
    o "夜夜椿的规矩是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_02ceae5f:

    # s "Anyway, you just score more points the closer you get to the center."
    s "总之，圆盘离中心越近，分数就越高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5ee55d1c:

    # "Sebas pauses, you notice that he raises his head slightly, and you can feel a shadow looms over you."
    "塞巴斯停了下来。你注意到他微微抬起头，一片阴影笼罩了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_91e600dc:

    # "The lion and the lizard do not look exactly surprised, or scared. So you turn around, and you are greeted by a leather glove right in front of your face."
    "狮子和蜥蜴看起来既不惊讶，也不害怕。你转过身，迎面看到一只皮手套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bea82f78:

    # l "Did someone say throwing disks?"
    l "有人说要掷圆盘吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5900b8f6:

    # s "Nobody said that, you can go now."
    s "没人这么说。你可以走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5c2e3c26:

    # e "Good evening, Lothar, good to see you in the Tavern. You wanna join us?"
    e "晚上好，洛萨尔。很高兴在酒馆见到你。你要加入我们吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f55f4763:

    # s "Hey-"
    s "嘿——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cf610db7:

    # l "Well, I'll have to say, apart from being the hero of Lusterfield. I am also a master of tavern games."
    l "我得说，除了是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄，我还是酒馆游戏的大师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a54cc08:

    # l "S-so, how can you throw disks without the hero's demonstration!"
    l "没有英雄亲自示范，你们怎么能掷圆盘呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_afd579d2:

    # s "The disks rented from Cane are only enough for three of us."
    s "从凯恩那里租来的圆盘只够我们三个人用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_36b5b3ad:

    # o "And we can get a few more from Cane, it's very cheap-"
    o "我们可以再从凯恩那里拿几个，很便宜——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_853fc61d:

    # s "Ole! The fuck are you talking about. We have no more disks."
    s "奥利！你他妈在说什么？我们没有多余的圆盘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7383db3c:

    # l "It's quite unfortunate that our little lion here has no dicks."
    l "真不幸，我们这头小狮子好像没有鸡巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2210cb89:

    # s "You deaf or somethi-"
    s "你聋了还是怎——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cca3b408:

    # l "It does show how he's afraid of losing to the hero of the village in a tavern game."
    l "这倒是说明，他害怕在酒馆游戏里输给村里的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0beca0a9:

    # s "Say that again Lothar and I will break your dick after that last time we met."
    s "你再说一遍，洛萨尔。上次见面之后，我就一直想打断你的鸡巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_93e5e115:

    # l "You think I have forgotten the last time you went for the kick? Ha, that's right, you didn't even manage to do that."
    l "你以为我忘了你上次踢过来吗？哈哈，正是——你连踢中都没做到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2a86b4c3:

    # s "I'm not playing your stupid game, Lothar."
    s "我才不玩你那破游戏，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1729c931:

    # "Ole glances at you, pointing at the lion and the wolf as he furrows his brows, and you both let out an awkward chuckle."
    "奥利看向你，指了指狮子和狼，同时皱起眉头。你们两个尴尬地笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0be971fe:

    # l "You already know who's going to win, Ha, ask my disciple, he knows who's a better skilled player."
    l "你们早就知道谁会赢了。哈，问问我的门徒——他知道谁的技术更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c1f73d0b:

    # s "I already know he's going to root for me, isn't it right, [e]?"
    s "我就知道他会支持我，对吧，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a56e4394:

    # "Both of them suddenly look towards you, you look left and right, can't even believe you have to make the decision again..."
    "两人突然都看向你。你左右张望，简直不敢相信自己又得做决定……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_da69e409:

    # e "U-uhmm...." nointeract
    e "呃——呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7423e89c:

    # e "I'd say... Lothar? He has... good aiming, afterall... I mean maybe."
    e "我觉得……洛萨尔？他的准头……挺好的吧。大概。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31773f76:

    # l "Ha, see, my disciple knows who's the best."
    l "哈，看吧，我的门徒知道谁最厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d59b127a:

    # s "Well- let's see then, don't you lose this smug ass face when I beat you right here."
    s "那就走着瞧吧。等我在这里赢了你，可别摆出这副得意的蠢脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_641aad9c:

    # "Sebas leaves as he walks to Cane and returns with some disks on his hand."
    "塞巴斯走到凯恩那边，拿着几个圆盘回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_94de00ed:

    # s "Alright then."
    s "好，那就这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e1e1213f:

    # "He tosses the disks towards Lothar with full force, luckily Lothar catches them right before they smash into his face."
    "他用尽全力把圆盘朝洛萨尔扔去；幸好洛萨尔及时接住，否则它们就要砸到他的脸了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca6ed08a:

    # "Still surprised, you and Ole each take some disks from Sebas' pile."
    "你和奥利仍有些惊讶，各自从塞巴斯那堆圆盘里拿了几个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_19100b1d:

    # o "Looks like everything's all set up here. Any questions?"
    o "看来一切都准备好了。还有问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_81e158e8:

    # e "Perhaps Sebas. H-he... is tough? I-I'm not sure."
    e "呃……有一个问题。塞巴斯真的很强吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7703985f:

    # l "My disciple, how does toughness even remotely play a role on one's bowlin-"
    l "我的门徒，硬实力和投掷保龄——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ab4e63a8:

    # s "You've heard [e]. Now get the fuuu-ck off before embarrassing yourself."
    s "你听到了，[e]。现在快滚，别继续丢人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_78d52e56:

    # l "Uuuuugh-... Watch out for your balls, lion. I'll be sure to kick them off the next time I see you."
    l "小心你的蛋蛋，狮子。下次见到你，我一定把它们踢飞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a2d9eb5:

    # "Lothar doesn't look pissed as you would imagine, instead he looks... defeated. His eyes unfocused."
    "洛萨尔看起来并没有你想象中那么生气，反倒像是……彻底泄了气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_affd37a6:

    # "A scaled hand latches on his shoulder, it's Ole."
    "一只覆着鳞片的手搭上他的肩膀——是奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_071b8a71:

    # o "Stay here, Lothar. I'll get you your disk."
    o "待在这儿，洛萨尔。我去给你拿圆盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_32233a39:

    # l "W-well. At least someone knows to respect their hero."
    l "至少还有人知道该尊重自己的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7ad3dd54:

    # o "More people makes for more fun."
    o "人多一点才更有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_93bdcb28:

    # "As Ole walks towards the counter, Lothar stands in a weird pose between you and Sebas."
    "奥利走向柜台时，洛萨尔以一种奇怪的姿势站在你和塞巴斯之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_94f33275:

    # "Sebas looks away, and Lothar just stares at you silently. You are not even sure how you got into this position of choosing in between these two."
    "塞巴斯移开视线，洛萨尔则默默盯着你。你甚至不知道自己是怎么被夹在他们中间的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfebc4df:

    # "But you are constantly dragged into it. Deep down you want them to hang around nicely, at least not arguing and getting mad at each other all the time."
    "可你总是会被卷进去。你打心底希望他们能好好相处，至少别总是争吵、彼此生气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ebe08bff:

    # "You thought comes to a pause as Ole arrives with a few different coloured disks. He hands some to the flustered wolf before taking a few for himself."
    "你的思绪被奥利带着几只不同颜色的圆盘回来打断。他先递给那头局促的狼几个，再拿了几个给自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a4dc32e:

    # o "Any questions...?"
    o "还有问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8cb648fa:

    # s "Well, there's one right there."
    s "嗯，有一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cdfe7c8d:

    # "He points towards the wolf."
    "他指向那头狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3ac6429a:

    # l "Cry more, lion. You're gonna prepare for when you lose against the hero."
    l "继续哭吧，狮子。准备好输给英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f9d1612d:

    # "You awkwardly stand in between the arguing pair, as Ole hands you and Sebas each three disks."
    "你尴尬地站在这对争吵不休的人中间，奥利给你和塞巴斯各发了三个圆盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f4e43177:

    # e "Uh... one question... how do I get a good score?"
    e "呃……我有一个问题……怎样才能拿高分？"

