    "看来塞巴斯暂时不会回答他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3c3869c0:

    # l "Yes we all know that, hmm... Give me your pen, lizard."
    l "蜥蜴，把你的笔给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_589b751f:

