    l "复仇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_22d875df:

    # "Lothar takes the pen from Ole's hand, and he sits on top of Sebas' chest, getting incredibly close to Sebas face."
    "洛萨尔从奥利手里拿过笔，坐到塞巴斯胸口上，脸几乎贴到了塞巴斯面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cb164bd2:

    # "He's not being subtle, neither is he afraid of Sebas waking up, Lothar begins to scribble, staining Sebas' orange fur with black ink."
    "他一点也不遮掩，也不怕惊醒塞巴斯。洛萨尔开始涂画，把黑墨染上塞巴斯橙色的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_09c75d17:

    # l "This is good, look."
    l "看，这画得不错吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b64cb21c:

    # "Watching from behind Lothar, you can see a... cock-shaped doodle being drawn dangerously close to the lion's mouth."
    "从洛萨尔身后看去，你能看到一幅阴茎形状的涂鸦，正危险地画在狮子嘴边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_794da077:

    # "Looking from afar, Ole seems to be laughing along with you and Ole as he stares at Lothar's scribblings."
    "从远处看，奥利似乎也和你一起笑，正盯着洛萨尔的涂鸦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f216c6f4:

    # "And Lothar draws a knot at the base of the shaft."
    "洛萨尔还在阴茎根部画了一个结。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_48ca783a:

    # l "That's my cock in your face, stupid lion."
    l "那是我的鸡巴，正在你脸上，蠢狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9d50ba3c:

    # "You can see Sebas feeling something itchy on his face, his tongue sticks out and licks around the... cock-shaped doodle."
    "你看到塞巴斯似乎觉得脸上发痒。他伸出舌头，舔了舔那幅……阴茎形涂鸦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_04ac6c56:

    # l "Ha, he likes it, how does it taste, S-Seb."
    l "哈，他喜欢这个。味道怎么样，塞、塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_45659dcd:

    # "Lothar stands back up, returning Ole his pen. He looks at both of you, unaware that you both are staring at the slight bulge in his crotch."
    "洛萨尔站起身，把笔还给奥利。他看着你们两个，没注意到你们正盯着他胯间微微隆起的轮廓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_20cf17cc:

    # o "Uhm... Alright. We should take Sebas home, Tavern people are watching us."
    o "呃……好吧。我们该把塞巴斯带回家了，酒馆里的人都在看我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_23f58107:

    # l "Alright, but don't you clean that masterpiece off, it's too funny."
    l "好吧，但别把这幅杰作擦掉，太好笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a4d3a316:

    # s "m-mpph..."
    s "唔、唔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fc590117:

    # "Sebas turns and tugs on Lothar's leg, drooling on his leather shoes."
    "塞巴斯翻过身，拽住洛萨尔的腿，口水流到了他的皮鞋上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_934e1724:

    # l "Ugh, you really need to bring him home now. Why was he drinking so much beer if he can't even handle it."
    l "唉，他现在就得回家了。他明明喝不了这么多啤酒，干吗还要喝？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_43528d6f:

    # "Lothar turns his attention to you."
    "洛萨尔把注意力转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2d87b042:

    # l "Regardless, I'll stay in the Tavern for a while."
    l "不管怎么说，我还要在酒馆待一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_95b4b8f4:

    # e "Your cheeks are still red, Lothar."
    e "你的脸还是红的，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ddab4664:

    # l "Disciple, do I look like I'm gonna collapse at any moment?"
    l "门徒，我看起来像是随时会倒下吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_13be631e:

    # o "No, but you seem like you need to rest."
    o "不会，但你看起来确实需要休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fe390d70:

    # "Lothar chides, and he points his finger towards your direction."
    "洛萨尔啧了一声，指向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_904e3637:

    # l "Lizard can bring the lion back, you want to stay here for a while?" nointeract
    l "让蜥蜴把狮子带回去。你想在这里待一会儿吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3b4410f8:

    # e "I can stay for a while."
    e "我可以待一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a23c26a2:

    # o "Hmm... I'll take Seb home by myself then."
    o "嗯……那我自己带塞巴斯回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e2d8abfa:

    # o "And you two, don't stay up for too long."
    o "你们两个也别熬得太晚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1be2aaff:

    # "You and Ole nod towards each other, and Ole begins tugging at Sebas."
    "你和奥利互相点了点头，奥利开始拽着塞巴斯往外走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1431c8b4:

    # "Lothar leads you to the counter in front of the tavern keeper."
    "洛萨尔带你来到酒馆老板面前的柜台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2ebbdd22:

    # c "Aye-, back from tha- little disk game, eh?"
    c "哟，从那场小飞盘游戏回来了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c3bb79f4:

    # e "Yeah, Ole's taking Seb back home. He's quite drunk."
    e "对。奥利要带塞巴斯回家，他喝醉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_348142a4:

    # c "Bummer, he could-a stay here for a while. What about ya two? Drank a lot?"
    c "他本来可以在这儿待一会儿。你们两个呢？喝了很多吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b8dc9e5c:

    # l "Not as much as that stupid lion did."
    l "没那头蠢狮子喝得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_acbbb770:

    # c "Good. Then, enjoy the rest o- yer night. I gotta run errands for these hungry patrons."
    c "那就好。好好享受剩下的夜晚吧，我得去照顾这些饿肚子的客人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7976d7a7:

    # "Cane quickly leaves you two alone with a few extra cup of beer."
    "凯恩很快离开，只留下你们两个和几杯剩下的啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_259f3a9f:

    # l "Mmmph... What do you think?"
    l "嗯……你觉得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_888eb8a6:

    # e "Oh?"
    e "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a0107d6:

    # l "Why did you choose to stay here."
    l "你为什么选择留下？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f2409aac:

    # e "I just thought you wanted someone to hang out with."
    e "我只是觉得你想找个人一起消遣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_17475449:

    # l "I have Amble and Jog. They just ditched me today to patrol the farm, as they said."
    l "我有安布和乔格。只不过他们今天说要去农场巡逻，把我丢下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_410cdcaf:

    # "Lothar takes a gulp of the beer."
    "洛萨尔喝了一大口啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e3255443:

    # l "But fair enough, your hero will accept your reasoning."
    l "不过公平地说，你的英雄接受这个理由了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_621e532c:

    # "The wolf chuckles loudly, is he laughing at his own talk of heroism?"
    "狼大声笑了起来。难道他是在嘲笑自己那套英雄主义的说辞？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0ad0c196:

    # "Regardless, Lothar begins to talk with you again, telling you what he had done today or yesterday. It quickly spirals into a constant conversation."
    "不管怎样，洛萨尔又和你聊了起来，告诉你今天或昨天发生的事。话题很快变成了没完没了的闲谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_acd041da:

    # "Often you two pause for a few seconds before responding to each other. But unlike every other time, Lothar never sounds overly confident, or self-assured."
    "你们常常会停上几秒，才回应对方。但和以往不同，洛萨尔这次听起来既不狂妄，也不自负。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_22600c37:

    # "Instead, he's almost too natural, his voice a little deeper than the usual hero and disciple speech."
    "相反，他自然得过了头，声音也比平时扮演英雄和导师时低沉一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8e0ce29f:

    # "You feel you're no longer intimidated by his aura of dominance, you feel much safer, talking with him inside of this crowded tavern."
    "你发现自己不再被他强势的气场吓到。在这间拥挤的酒馆里和他聊天，你反而觉得格外安心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0063f949:

    # "Sometimes he laughs with you for all the misfortune you've been through since you wake up in this world."
    "有时，他会和你一起笑，笑你来到这个世界后经历的种种不幸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_067c9e6d:

    # "Sometimes you chuckles at how he and Jog messes with Amble without him ever noticing."
    "有时，你会笑他和乔格趁安布毫无察觉时捉弄他的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0f4a76f9:

    # "And it was... magical how that feels to have your mentor drinking beer alongside you, peaceful all around."
    "而你的导师能在一片宁静中陪你喝啤酒，这种感觉……简直奇妙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_05fb091f:

    # "Most importantly, you get to know who Lothar is. Despite thousands of exaggerations thrown at your face each sentence, there's some form of truth buried inside."
    "最重要的是，你开始真正了解洛萨尔这个人。尽管他每句话里都夹着夸张，里面仍埋着某种真实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_69212834:

    # "You wish to talk with Lothar for the entire night, but at some point, you feel your eyelids droop. You lean on the counter and lie your head on your arms."
    "你想和洛萨尔聊上一整晚，可不知不觉眼皮开始发沉。你靠在柜台上，把头枕在手臂上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a5d7011c:

    # "You two continue to talk for some time before you completely fall asleep."
    "你们又聊了一会儿，直到你彻底睡着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4f6c8900:

    # "The next thing you know, it's already morning. You're inside your room, sleeping on your own bed."
    "再睁眼时，天已经亮了。你正睡在自己的床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8382d080:

    # "Did he carry you back onto your bed like that time you lost to him...? You're not too certain."
    "难道他像上次你输给他时那样，把你抱回了床上？你也说不准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca02055e:

    # "It doesn't seem like Lothar is anywhere close to you..."
    "洛萨尔似乎并不在你身边……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_25df6518:

    # "You went to bed again for a while before a scream interrupt your sleep."
    "你又睡了一会儿，一声尖叫打断了你的睡眠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_41863b22:

    # e "I should help Ole bring him home. And I'm tired and all."
    e "我该帮奥利把他带回家，而且我也累了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_53c734cf:

    # l "Well then, see you later, disciple."
    l "那就回头见，门徒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6c439456:

    # l "I have to say it again, but don't you two wipe that dick off his face."
