translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_8d1c303b:

    # e "Uhhmmm.... no...?"
    e "呃呃呃呃……没有……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_7f269832:

    # o "I guess so."
    o "想必也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_cb215c0b:

    # o "Alright, then. I'll give you my recipe for ointment. Helps with health, and your magic, and if you are horny, lust."
    o "没事。这是我答应给你的药膏配方，通常它可以回复你的体力、魔力，还可以清除你的性欲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_d31652d0:

    # o "It'll cleanse you of your negative effects if you use it during a combat."
    o "在战斗时使用还能清除一切负面效果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_a68a1e17:

    # e "I see. Thank you so much, Ole."
    e "我明白了。非常感谢你,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_bc6cac7c:

    # o "No problem."
    o "不客气，小兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_c5b743b6:

    # e "...I think I took a few... of them."
    e "……我现在就有几瓶……力量药水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_2f03c742:

    # o "Then... get Haskell to make more of them, you know."
    o "那……去问哈斯克尔再拿多些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_e461cbc3:

    # o "I want the number to be exact. Hmm..."
    o "记得总共 30 瓶。嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ointment_Finish_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_daeb3047:

    # e "Ole! I'm back from all three training you gave me!"
    e "奥利！三项训练我都完成了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_208e5430:

    # o "Hmm... I've heard so! Congratulation, [e]. You are now the courier of the lusterfield!"
    o "嗯……我已经听说了。[e]，恭喜你成为乐斯民菲尔德村的差客！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_c81b1808:

    # e "Thank you Ole. Your training is really useful. I think I can handle a few adventures right now!"
    e "谢谢奥利,你的训练很有用,我现在能应付一些冒险!"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_3c2f0ade:

    # o "Ha. Tell that to Seb, Lothar and Rahim. They're pretty helpful teachers, aren't they?"
    o "告诉塞布、洛萨尔和雷希姆,他们很有帮助,不是吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_b7dae17b:

    # e "Yes, they are!"
    e "我也非常感谢他们！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_2f031d0c:

    # o "Now our goods are in your hand, you better be really careful out there, for your own safety."
    o "今后我们的货物可全靠你运送，你在外要加倍注意安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_0701ac3f:

    # e "Haha, I will certainly do!"
    e "哼哼，那是自然！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_a1889f96:

    # o "Great! Now I'll give you a badge of honor. Courier of Lusterfield."
    o "太好了,现在我给你一张荣誉徽章 乐斯民菲尔德的骑士。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_d68218ee:

    # "Ole searches around his pocket, and hands you a grey badge, it has the shape of your head, and you can see the word 'Courier' written in the middle of it."
    "奥利掏掏口袋，将一枚灰色的徽章递给了你。你仔细观察着徽章，它的外形酷似你的正脸，中间题笔“差客”二字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_0cfb9682:

    # e "Woah is that my face on the badge?"
    e "哇，徽章画的是我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_671750a5:

    # o "Yeah, I thought I should make it represent you in someway. It should be enough to let people know you are the courier of Lusterfield."
    o "足够让人们知道你是乐斯民菲尔德的信使了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_5869fd5c:

    # e "Thanks, Ole. I won't disappoint you."
    e "谢谢你，奥利。我不会让你失望的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_f3baee88:

    # o "I know you won't."
    o "我知道你不会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_ab8a084c:

    # o "Check out the board to start your job. If you have any questions, the Postmaster is there."
    o "去看看公告板，就能开始工作了。有任何问题都可以找邮政局长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_d2c206b2:

    # o "You can come up to me as well, for any other questions."
    o "其他问题也可以来问我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_e206f31b:

    # e "Of course!"
    e "没问题！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_48284250:

    # o "Hmm, are you sure? Cause I don't think you finished all three of them."
    o "呃，你确定？我知道你没有完成所有训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_7c1a48c4:

    # e "Ahh... You are right."
    e "啊……你说的没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_23fcb143:

    # o "Then what are you waiting for, I've got to get ready for your badge in the mean time."
    o "那你还等什么呢，你的差客徽章都快做好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Finish_e2808404:

    # e "Yes! Ole. I'll be back soon."
    e "是！我尽快完成训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_0cb532a7:

    # e "Hey, Ole. How did you and Sebas built this shop?"
    e "嘿,奥利,你和塞巴斯是怎么建造这间店的?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_cd8d8401:

    # o "Hmm... should I tell you this? I don't know if Seb mentioned it to you yet."
    o "嗯……不知该说不该说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_562fdc83:

    # e "Mention what?"
    e "提过什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_410ae5cb:

    # o "His Uncle. This shop was built by him actually. We're just working."
    o "他的叔叔。这家当铺起初是他叔叔开的，我们只是普通员工。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_7e92edeb:

    # e "Wait... didn't Seb say he owns this place?"
    e "诶……阿塞不是说当铺是他的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_2b11de51:

    # o "Technically yes, his uncle gave it to him, some kind of consolidation gift."
    o "准确来说是的，他叔叔转让给了他，类似于一种商业上的合并赠与。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_9dd6561f:

    # e "Hmm... for what?"
    e "唔……为什么呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_7360a1d8:

    # o "It would be unwise for me to continue further. I've already spoken too much. Just know that Seb and me took over this place. End of story."
    o "我已经透露太多了，再说下去不合适。总之塞巴斯和我接管了君临典当，就是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_5faa112e:

    # e "But now I'm a little curious."
    e "但我有点小好奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_6520c353:

    # o "You'll know if you're here long enough. I'm just an outsider to this family matter."
    o "如果你和阿塞相处得够久自然会知道。这是塞巴斯的家事，而我只是个外人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Kingspawn_398d784d:

    # e "Alright, thanks Ole."
    e "谢谢奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_7f4577d7:

    # e "Ole. Did you mention about the postal training yesterday?"
    e "奥利，我记得你昨天好像说有个差客培训我得去？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_771f7415:

    # o "Yes. so this training I designed it just for you. There's three things you need to learn before your little adventure."
    o "是的。这次培训专为你量身定制，涵盖了你外出探险前所需掌握的三种基本能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_5c96ca2c:

    # o "First thing first, I talked to Lothar about you. I think he can give you some basic idea about tackling on a battle."
    o "首先,我和洛萨尔谈过你 我想他可以给你一些基本的想法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_06092a45:

    # o "Second, Sebas can bring you around the corners of the village, he used to travel a lot so just ask him anything about delivering your items."
    o "其次，塞巴斯会带你到乐村附近转一转熟悉环境，他曾经游历过不少地方，有关物资获取、运送的疑问你都可以问他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_7ac2cc18:

    # o "Third one is just Rahim talking about your equipment, item and making your own clothes."
    o "第三,只是雷希姆在谈论你的设备, 物品和自己做衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_e58826b7:

    # e "Are you going to teach me anything particular?"
    e "你呢？你会教我什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_e1fa8197:

    # o "Nope, I'm gonna stay and watch over the shop. When you finish all three trainings just come back to me and I'll give you a badge of certificate."
    o "我得留下来看店。如果你完成了这三项训练，记得来告诉我，我会给你颁发差客资质徽章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_ab8f28e6:

    # e "This is so elaborate, I thought couriers just take and deliver stuff."
    e "差客的工作不就是帮人跑腿，多简单，没必要这么讲究吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_e6f1fc98:

    # o "You see, there was another courier from the town, we were pretty friendly. Just like you, he told me that he just takes and delivers stuff. "
    o "听我说，我们这以前有个从镇上来的差客。他就像你一样，说自己只是帮人跑腿，简简单单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_6926132c:

    # o "Two weeks later, he died to the monsters on the way to Lusterfield."
    o "两周后,他在去乐斯民菲尔德的路上 死在怪物身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_2ffbd802:

    # e "Really? How did you know..."
    e "真的假的？你怎么知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_781e6083:

    # o "Well no one has seen him again. We assumed he was unfortunately eaten by the monster. The moral of the story is, always be prepared for any kind of threat."
    o "因为没有人再看见过他，所以我们只能推测他被怪兽吃掉了。总之，要从他的经历吸取教训，多防一步少出事故。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_458a6978:

    # o "Things doesn't always happen like how you imagined. So just take the training seriously, I don't want to lose you to the wild just like the last courier."
    o "事情不总会朝你预想的方向发展。我希望你能认真对待这次培训，不要重蹈上一任差客的覆辙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_4c86e27f:

    # o "Alright, enough serious talk. I wrote all the details of the training in your journal, remember to check it out if you forget about anything."
    o "嗯，严肃的话点到即止。我已经把相关详细内容写到你笔记本上了，这样你就不怕忘记要找谁训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_286af918:

    # e "I will, Ole."
    e "我会的,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Postal_Training_b729b5c2:

    # msg "Your Journal has been updated."
    msg "备忘录已更新"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_69aa160d:

    # e "Hey, Ole! How are the people in Lusterfield doing?"
    e "奥利,乐斯民菲尔德的人怎么样了?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_888a705c:

    # o "Good! It's a beautiful day today isn't it. Everyone's enjoying their life right now."
    o "大家都过得很好！今天也是风和日丽的一天，人人都在享受自己的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_b8eb9b77:

    # o "You might wanna get some training, if you still remember."
    o "对了，还记得之前说的训练吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_d6a721f9:

    # o "After that, you can go check out the courier board for some odd jobs. Haimo can help you with that."
    o "之后，你可以去看看差客公告板，接一些杂活。海莫能帮你处理这些事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_64a0a113:

    # o "If you need some other informal training, Lothar is also here, I'm sure you can always learn some more from him."
    o "如果你需要其他的非正式训练, 洛萨尔也在这里, 我相信你可以从他那里学到更多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_98da93a6:

    # o "And we have Rahim, of course, I think he's making you a leather armor for travel purposes, remember to go visit him before you set out on your little adventure."
    o "我们有雷希姆,当然,我想他正在给你做皮革盔甲 用于旅行目的, 记得去拜访他,然后你开始你的小冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_6dfb661e:

    # o "Maybe when you fancy yourself a drink, you can always get one from Cane's place. It's where Seb usually visit at weekend."
    o "也许当你想喝点酒的时候 你总是可以从凯恩家买到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_8cdefce8:

    # e "Oh... Does Sebas drink a lot?"
    e "噢……他会喝很多吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_09deeb20:

    # o "Usually, he is the flirty type there. Don't take the lion too serious when he's drunk though."
    o "通常会，而且他喝醉之后会变得特别风流。所以他在酒馆做的傻事说的胡话，希望你别太放心上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_52fd18b4:

    # o "To be fair, our villagers have a tendency to get themselves drunk all the time."
    o "实话实说，我们这的村民一整天的，总爱喝个烂醉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_ae143b4e:

    # e "Do they like the alcohol a lot?"
    e "怎么大家对酒这么上瘾？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_4ecf0254:

    # o "I don't know, not like I've tried that stuff..."
    o "谁知道呢，我还没喝过酒……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_02158783:

    # o "The thing is, if you do visit Cane's place, be careful when you owe them money for a beer. You don't want to know what may happen there."
    o "问题是,如果你真的去凯恩家, 当你欠他们啤酒的钱的时候要小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_bdb05bc5:

    # e "What may happen there?"
    e "会怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_e710f7ed:

    # o "I don't know... you have to be careful even in the village. Not a lot of villagers are kind like us."
    o "我也不清楚……但不是每个村民都像我们这么好说话，你进酒馆最好多留个心眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_People_535d9ef0:

    # e "Ok. I'll be on the look out, thanks Ole."
    e "好，我会多加注意的。谢谢你奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_8d3ae7eb:

    # e "Hey, Ole."
    e "嘿,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_9c2edee2:

    # o "What's going on, [e]?"
    o "怎么了，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_77b81c63:

    # e "Do I really need to go to Lothar for training?"
    e "我真的需要去洛萨尔训练吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_3bce4d29:

    # o "You are still bothered by that? Oh... I'm sorry I didn't give you a heads up. He hasn't acted this way before."
    o "之前那件事，你还很在意吧？噢……抱歉没能事先提醒你。他以前从来不会这样的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_24d1cd83:

    # e "But... What's his deal with people, is he always like that?"
    e "可是为什么……他一直都是这种恶狠狠的态度？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_b36bbcc5:

    # o "Deep down inside, Lothar is a good person. He just has some kind of grudge against newcomers."
    o "内心深处,洛萨尔是个好人 他只是对新来者有某种怨恨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_5c9313d2:

    # o "I don't want to dig up ancient history, but once he gets along with you, he'll be fine to handle."
    o "我不想翻旧账，但只要你和他熟络了，他还是很好相处的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_be9455a5:

    # e "He seemed like a different person when you talked to him. Are you two friends?"
    e "洛萨尔那时候一碰见你，就跟变了个人似的。你们是朋友吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_7f786e40:

    # o "Kind of. It really depends."
    o "大概吧。得看情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_621d7da3:

    # e "Depend on what?"
    e "看什么情况？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_c2e1fa70:

    # o "If I can control his temper a little bit. Usually he is fine, like a normal wolf."
    o "得看我能不能控制住他的脾气，稍微。平常他就是一头安安分分的狼，并不暴躁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_610699e4:

    # o "So, just come to me if he does anything bad. Ok? I'll take care of him. Plus, if you two get along you can learn a few tricks and tips about fighting."
    o "如果你们能交上朋友，洛萨尔的确有本事教你更多战斗技巧和策略。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_149ec21c:

    # e "Alright Ole, I'll trust you."
    e "好的，我相信你，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_5e33dede:

    # o "Thanks, kiddo."
    o "谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_e3545a54:

    # e "How are you doing, Ole."
    e "你好吗,奥利?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_6e84c8b1:

    # o "Doing Fantastic. I'm cleaning up the Cabinets right now."
    o "打扫货柜，保持好心情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_f9202c57:

    # e "Anything interesting going on in the shop?"
    e "最近当铺有什么有趣的事情吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_70640206:

    # o "You want something interesting? I can tell you something interesting."
    o "有趣的事情？我恰好知道一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_938a2da1:

    # o "We just got a new tenent here and this new tenent is going to pay their part of the rent, every month."
    o "前不久，我们店里来了一位新租客，我们每个月都可以赚他的租金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_75ab91e4:

    # e "W-wait..."
    e "啊这……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_518368f5:

    # o "Ha. Just kidding kiddo. You don't need to pay any rent. We bought the place, mostly from Seb's side."
    o "哈，逗你玩的。你不用付租金，我们买下了当铺，当然阿塞出的大头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_00f81bfd:

    # o "Honestly though, traffic is not in our favour here today. Most of our customers are local regulars."
    o "说到钱，现在交通不畅，我们大多数顾客都是本地的常客，搞得当铺的账面不太好看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_3b940b67:

    # e "Is it always like this?"
    e "以前不是这样的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_370c6867:

    # o "No. Not really, we used to have travellers abroad the continent visit us to sell their valuables."
    o "当然不是，以前经常有来自莫肯大陆之外的人到我们当铺出售宝物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_925f6d91:

    # e "What happened? Why are they not coming here now?"
    e "怎么他们不来了？发生了什么变故？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_0618f3f5:

    # o "Well [e], people are scared of the monsters. They've been roaming on the path a lot lately."
    o "是啊，[e]，野外怪物肆虐吓跑了不少商队。最近大路小路都有不少怪物出没。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_f161d13e:

    # e "I can help with clearing up the path."
    e "我可以帮忙除掉他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_f10698bf:

    # o "Yeah kiddo. Meanwhile let me clean this scrub off the cabinet."
    o "谢谢你小兄弟。正谓一屋不扫何以扫天下，我继续打扫了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_d3bf9e72:

    # e "Hey, Ole. What are you doing?"
    e "嘿,奥利,你在干嘛?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_70019732:

    # o "Eating some bread."
    o "吃面包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_148ce62a:

    # e "Are you not drinking with the others? I thought lizards are pretty alcohol resistant."
    e "你不和谁喝上几杯？蜥蜴族的酒量都很大吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_4dbb003f:

    # o "I'm not drinking kiddo, especially not here."
    o "我可不喝酒，小兄弟，更不用说还是在这。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_74c25de0:

    # e "Why not? Sebas is pretty drunk now."
    e "为什么？你看塞巴斯都欢天喜地醉熏熏的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_f5a56461:

    # o "Someone's gotta be sober, and be the responsible one for the lion."
    o "总得有人保持清醒照顾这头狮子，不然没人抬他回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_60490422:

    # o "Else no one's taking him home, kiddo."
    o "没人带他回家，孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_455ed7d7:

    # e "Ole, you might want to relax sometimes, you know."
    e "奥利，偶尔放松一下没事儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_013218d3:

    # o "I'm relaxed. Don't worry."
    o "我现在就蛮放松的。不用担心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Himself_d92a2fb3:

    # e "Alright, I'll see you later."
    e "那就好，待会见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Dialogue_End_88c159ac:

    # o "Alright kid, have a good day."
    o "好，祝你一切顺利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_b86dc71c:

    # r "You, better cover yourself up."
    r "你——怎么不穿裤子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_eeb4ded0:

    # e "Hmm."
    e "我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_372058de:

    # r "Is this one of your tribe's weird tradition?"
    r "这是你部落的奇怪传统吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_482c616b:

    # r "I don't mean to offend but having your dicks out... in the cold wouldn't make sense... right?" nointeract
    r "我无意冒犯，但让自己传宗接代的宝贝受冻……实在不合常理……不是吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_345bed1e:

    # e "Yes, it is. I'm just so sorry I forgot to... put on something."
    e "对不起，我从小大大都跟着族人裸习惯了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_bc00a127:

    # r "Look, I'll respect your tradition, whatever it is."
    r "没事，不管怎样，我尊重你的部落传统。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_8adbd44e:

    # r "Just don't get a random boner when we talk..."
    r "只要你别在我们说话的时候勃起了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_e1065ae8:

    # e "Uhh- I'll try...{size=15} if only you aren't looking that hot... {/size}"
    e "嗯，我试试…… {size=15}，如果你看起来不那么性感……{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_19fcb7b1:

    # r "What?"
    r "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_1a400f0b:

    # e "Nothing."
    e "没、没。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_e0f72de2:

    # e "No, I just like to... let it out sometimes."
    e "没有，我只是……个人喜欢这样裸着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_ef8678a0:

    # r "Disgusting."
    r "不三不四。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_58f148ab:

    # e "Uhh- I didn't know you don't lik-..."
    e "呃，我以为你会喜——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_52783f5f:

    # r "Sorry, but I don't want you to swing your dick around my shop."
    r "别怪我不讲情面，我实在忍不了有人直奔我家耍流氓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_14a73e88:

    # r "Put on whatever you wish, at least cover it up. Then we'll talk."
    r "你爱穿什么就穿什么，但必须能遮住那里。在此之前，一切免谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_8217d26a:

    # r "You are naked again?"
    r "你怎么还裸着下身？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_a084cd8a:

    # e "I forgot to put them on, Rahim."
    e "我忘了穿上,雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_20ec10e3:

    # r "No leave it be... I'll have to get used to that..."
    r "算了，就这样吧……反正我早晚得习惯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_1e71ff53:

    # r "But I'll have to remind you again, don't get a boner while we talk. Understand?"
    r "但别忘了，不准勃起。明白吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_23f282f1:

    # e "Uhh, alright."
    e "呃，明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_403332f6:

    # r "You better cover yourself up."
    r "你要是识相就穿上打底的裤子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_faa7d97b:

    # e "Hmm..."
    e "可是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_35fbbd56:

    # r "I feel ashamed for you, [e]. Just put on your clothes. I'm not telling you again."
    r "[e]，我为你感到羞耻。穿好衣服再进来，我不想重复第二遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_bd4531fa:

    # e "I'm sorry about that, Rahim."
    e "我很抱歉,雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_b9b755e5_1:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_222d4f50:

    # r "Oh? That tunic looks good on you, [e]."
    r "哦，你穿那件外衣看起来不错，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_21f4e536:

    # e "Yeah, it is. After all it's made by the best tailor in the world..."
    e "是的，毕竟它是由世界上最好的裁缝做的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_6b86d57b:

    # "You catch a small grin from the old bull, but he quickly hides it."
    "你从老公牛身上得到一个小笑容 但他很快就藏起来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_1c86f3fc:

    # e "Rahim, should we go to the Mayor's house now?"
    e "雷希姆,我们现在去市长家吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_f4da4931:

    # r "Yes. Now go."
    r "是的。现在去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_e43364e3:

    # r "You are [e]. Correct?"
    r "[e]，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_4137825e:

    # e "Yes. Nice to meet you, Rahim."
    e "是的。很高兴见到你,雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_982e3ddf:

    # r "Ok."
    r "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_4d565392:

    # r "How goes it, [e]."
    r "最近过得怎么样，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_b3dcb561:

    # e "I'm well, thanks Rahim."
    e "我很好,谢谢雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Normal_Talk_46758535:

    # r "So, what are you up to, boy." nointeract
    r "这回有什么事？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Normal_Talk_495fbfe0:

    # e "Alright, I think we're ready for the vote now."
    e "好了，我想我们准备好投票了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_6d945238:

    # r "You want to know about...?" nointeract
    r "你想知道什么……？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_a7079f96:

    # e "Hello, Rahim."
    e "你好,雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_389fd835:

    # "Rahim is still threading his needles, until he's distracted by your voice."
    "雷希姆还在缝针 直到你的声音让他分心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_cc41dfbc:

    # "He doesn't even move his head, just staring at your general direction as he tries again with a new needle."
    "缝衣针穿过布料带出毛线。他的视线顺着升高，恰好瞟到你，而后又落了下去，准备穿另一针。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_596406e0:

    # r "Oh, right. I just finished your leather outfit. It's right there."
    r "噢，对。你的装备刚刚做好，就在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_f5605e3d:

    # "The tailor raises his head to point at the cabinets, where you see a piece of leather armor tidily placed inside a wooden box."
    "雷希姆抬头用眼神指示你看向橱柜，一件皮甲规整地叠放在中间的小木箱中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_396aaabe:

    # e "Thank you so much, Rahim. Is it the one made after you measured my waist?"
    e "非常感谢 雷希姆 是你量我的腰后做的吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_ef3da110:

    # e "I don't know what to say, thank you for being so kind to me."
    e "我都不知道该说什么了。谢谢你对我这么好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_959c5f97:

    # "You reach over and take the armor, trying to check the size."
    "你取出皮甲，贴在身前比较。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_30ad8122:

    # e "Oh, I think it fits me perfectly, and the leather is very light-weight too."
    e "噢，我觉得应该很合身，而且这种皮革一点都不重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_91425277:

    # "Rahim lowers his head, eyes focused on the piece of garment on his table."
    "雷希姆低头 眼睛盯着桌子上的衣物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_a2e55ebf:

    # e "Ah, should I try it out now? This will come in handy when I go on adventures. How did you get all these quality fabrics."
    e "啊，我要现在试一试吗？出门探险的时候肯定很有用，这么好的用料从哪来的呀？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_1dbba092:

    # e "Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_6b233620:

    # r "No, I'm working right now, you can take the box back to the shop. And the door is right there."
    r "不用，我要干活。你可以回典当再试穿，出门直走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_ad058579:

    # "His response comes to a shock for you, paired with the stern face he gives, it feels like he didn't even want you here."
    "这个回应完全出乎意料，搭配他冷峻的面容，像是自己碍着他了似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_b7f7cc00:

    # "You freeze for a moment, holding the box with the leather armor in it. As if you're waiting for some kind of follow up."
    "你抱着小木箱愣在原地，仿佛希望对方会再说些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_8c2590b1:

    # "The tailor is still staring at his work, pausing for a few seconds, he furrows his brows before looking up again."
    "牛裁缝盯着手中的布料顿了几秒钟，再次抬起头，皱眉看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_dd4775af:

    # r "Welcome to Lusterfield, [e]."
    r "欢迎来到乐斯民菲尔德,[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_5ec8f54f:

    # e "Hey, I get it. Thank you for the armor again. I- I'll go now."
    e "好、好的，麻烦您给我做了这件皮甲。我——我马上走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_b8536fa8:

    # "You pat on Rahim's shoulder, which caused him to shudder a bit. Rahim stares at you blankly until you finally leave him alone."
    "你拍着雷希姆的肩膀,让他有点颤抖。雷希姆一直盯着你,直到你终于离开他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Leather_Armor_d1f01bcf:

    # e "Bye, Rahim!"
    e "再见,雷希姆!"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_c51008b6:

    # e "I was wondering if you had any more commissions for me to do? I learned a lot last time, and I'd love to try again."
    e "上次我学到了很多，我很想再试一次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_ad1c0c07:

    # "Rahim looks up from his sewing, and looks at you with what seems to be bemused exasperation."
    "雷希姆仰望着缝纫, 看着你, 看着你似乎 令人痛心的愤怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_dbae1bc5:

    # r "Excited, aren't you."
    r "兴奋，是不是？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_81f332fb:

    # e "Yeah! I hear awesome stories, get to learn tailoring, and earn money. What's there not to like?"
    e "我听到很棒的故事 学会裁缝 赚钱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_ce89727e:

    # "The bull heaves a sigh, grumbling about unexpected work and having to find the materials."
    "牛群叹气 抱怨出乎意料的工作 不得不找到材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_d56ecf9b:

    # "Despite that, the bull's permanent scowl is missing from his face. He still looks grumpy, of course, but he seems to be in a good mood."
    "当然，他看起来还是很暴躁，但他似乎心情很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_3d457e35:

    # r "I do have a commission ready for you, [e]."
    r "我为你准备了一个佣金 [e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_23f37d91:

    # r "It's also, luckily for the both of us, not a hat."
    r "幸运的是，这对我们两个来说 也不是帽子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_fa2f1b40:

    # "There being no hats seems to be a genuine relief for the bull. The process was annoying, certainly, but it's surprising that they cause him this much trouble."
    "没有任何帽子似乎真正地缓解了牛的情绪。这个过程当然很烦人，但令人惊讶的是，他们给他带来了这么多麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_79a9feb1:

    # e "So, I'll be learning something new?"
    e "那么，我会学习一些新东西吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_eb42fce2:

    # "Rahim gives you a curt nod before taking out several bolts of colorful cloth."
    "雷希姆给你一个弯曲点头,然后取出几根多彩布的螺栓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_48ed5ed2:

    # r "Yes. You'll be making a scarf this time."
    r "是的 这次你要做围巾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_5a38ed67:

    # "You look at him quizzically."
    "你从测验的角度看他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_cd2ec19f:

    # e "Isn't that sort of easier than a hat?"
    e "这不比帽子容易吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_e2206c4c:

    # "You get a nod, and a look of annoyance."
    "你得到点头，和看起来烦恼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_bb1a9c1f:

    # r "I was trying to go easy on you."
    r "我试图让你轻松一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_a5dec8c3:

    # r "Despite that, this isn't going to be a walk in the park for you."
    r "尽管如此，这不会是散步 在公园为你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_0262d3f2:

    # r "Scarves need to be lightweight but durable - soft, but pliable. To make things harder for you, the patterning on this scarf is difficult, alternating blue, gold and red in irregular rings."
    r "刀疤需要轻轻但耐用 — — 软，但易食用。要让事情变得更难，这条围巾上的布局很难，在非正常环状的蓝色、黄金和红色之间交替。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_bfe2f26b:

    # e "Ah. And here I was celebrating."
    e "啊。我在这里庆祝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_98c816ea:

    # r "Never celebrate if you're helping me. You know who taught me, and I haven't learned a teaching method other than his."
    r "你知道谁教我的，除了他，我还没有学到其他教学方法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_56656e59:

    # "Raising an eyebrow at him only earns an eyebrow raise in response."
    "对他眉毛大只会引起眉毛大起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_0afb118b:

    # e "I don't see any wolves around here."
    e "这里没有狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_277ce017:

    # "You say this, entirely joking."
    "你说这个，完全是开玩笑的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_0e956ef6:

    # "Rahim snorts lightly, closing his eyes in a mockery of lacking patience."
    "雷希姆轻轻地打呼噜,闭上眼睛嘲笑他缺乏耐心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_5cb2e20b:

    # r "No, I suppose you don't."
    r "不，我想你没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_261baf0f:

    # r "If you want, I can provide them?"
    r "如果你想，我可以提供吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_c7b4d906:

    # "That's the first joke you've ever seen Rahim cra-"
    "这是你第一次看到拉辛的笑话……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_ed42017b:

    # "Oh. He's serious. That light in his eyes is serious."
    "他是认真的 他眼中的光线很严重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_2fc36f0f:

    # e "No, I think I'll pass on that, thank you Rahim! I am reasonably challenged by this and appreciate the commission! I'll be going now!"
    e "不,我想我会转达的,谢谢你,雷希姆!"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_163aa3b9:

    # "Despite your best effort to slip out before Rahim managed to track down a feral wolf, you stop when a loud voice yells your name."
    "尽管你在雷希姆找到狼之前 尽力溜出去 但当大喊大叫时 你就会停下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_3d58e845:

    # "Guiltily, you turn around to a now {i}genuinely{/i} unhappy bull."
    "愤怒的是，你转过身去 转过身去，现在{i}g 真正{/i}不快乐的公牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_c579bfd6:

    # r "If you're going to take a commission from me, you're going to do it right."
    r "如果你要从我这里拿佣金 你会做得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_8f0dfdd8:

    # r "You don't even have the list of materials, or the materials I was going to generously provide you with myself."
    r "你甚至连材料清单都没有 也没有我打算慷慨地 为你提供的材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_24cb31ff:

    # e "M-my apologies, Rahim. I didn't mean to dash out like that."
    e "对不起,雷希姆,我不是故意冲出去的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_540178a6:

    # "Rahim sighs yet again, a pained expression on his face."
    "雷希姆又叹了口气 他脸上的表情令人痛心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_b9907288:

    # r "I understand. You understand I'm not going to throw you to an actual wolf, yes?"
    r "我明白，你明白我不会把你扔到狼身上的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_2b1131e8:

    # "A sense of relief floods your body."
    "一种救济感 淹没你的身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_96e6bfdd:

    # e "R-really?"
    e "真、真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_02146332:

    # "The peeved look on Rahim's face is all you needed as an answer."
    "你只需要雷希姆脸上的细微表情 作为答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_5150d635:

    # r "Yes. Throwing you at a wolf would do nothing for you as a tailor - neither would it help my shop."
    r "是的 把你扔在狼身上 对你做裁缝也没用 也帮不了我的店。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_beab006f:

    # "Those are some of the worst reasons you could ask for, as none of them involve your safety, but it is certainly better than the alternative."
    "这些是你可以要求的最糟糕的原因之一，因为其中没有一个涉及你的安全，但肯定比其他选择更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_e4a08178:

    # e "What about if I require wolf fur?"
    e "如果我需要狼毛怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_fb4e7776:

    # r "Then I'll probably buy it for you. You could make these bolts of cloth."
    r "那我可能会买给你 你可以做这些布的螺栓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_92d2074b:

    # "Rahim drops the bolts of cloth he took out into your hands as he speaks."
    "雷希姆在说话的时候 掉了他拿给你的布的螺栓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_fba4a75a:

    # r "But I'm not going to make you do that. It'd be a waste of my time and yours."
    r "但我不会逼你这么做的 这会浪费我的时间和你的时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_7fb54799:

    # "Chastened by Rahim's harsh rebuke, you dip your head in acknowledgement and apology."
    "被雷希姆的严厉责备所折磨 你低头承认和道歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_795e0333:

    # e "You're right. I'm sorry about that, Rahim."
    e "你说得对 我很抱歉 雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_4e9cab5d:

    # "Again, Rahim sighs deeply. While he doesn't look grumpy, you can't tell if that's better or not - the complex mix of amusement and frustration isn't something you can easily categorize or understand."
    "再说一遍,雷希姆 深深的叹息。虽然他看起来不气愤,但你无法判断这是否更好。 娱乐和沮丧的复杂组合是不能轻易分类或理解的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_7e9e0ea1:

    # "Undeniably bad was the disappointment you saw flicker across his face when you told him you were genuinely worried about the wolf."
    "不可否认的糟糕是，当你告诉他你真正担心狼的时候，你看见他脸上闪闪发光的失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_87670113:

    # r "It's alright. You took me seriously when I was making a bad joke."
    r "没关系，你认真对待我 当我做一个坏笑话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_5b364512:

    # r "Just... go finish the commission. I'll figure out a story I can tell you when you come back."
    r "完成佣金 我会想出一个故事 当你回来时我可以告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_206b5229:

    # "You clearly don't understand this man. He was joking before? His face was dead serious."
    "你显然不明白这个人 他以前在开玩笑吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_7e28e31b:

    # "Then again, it always is."
    "再者，它总是如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_a5caf3e5:

    # e "Can I make a request about the story?"
    e "我能请求你告诉我这个故事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_7ed8ec50:

    # "Rahim opens his mouth to make an irritated comment, but closes it and considers what to say more carefully."
    "雷希姆张开嘴发表令人恼火的评论,。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_3ac3a3c0:

    # r "You can make it. I cannot promise I will deliver."
    r "你能做到的 我不能保证我会兑现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_2c68410b:

    # "You gulp, and nod."
    "你口出声来点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_c1217428:

    # e "I want to hear about what group of people taught you the most about sewing after you started adventuring. Who they were, their culture... all of it."
    e "我想听听，在你开始冒险后，哪个群体最了解缝纫。他们是谁，他们的文化，所有的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_568e476f:

    # "Of all the things you expected that to bring out of Rahim, pain was not one of them."
    "你所期望的雷希姆 带来的一切事物中, 痛苦不是其中之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_1e844e30:

    # "Despite that, Rahim looks as gutted as a man just told his pet had died."
    "尽管如此,雷希姆看起来就像一个男人 刚刚告诉他的宠物死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_13fed9d8:

    # r "That... It's a good question. I'll have to think about it."
    r "问得好，我得考虑一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_7874d879:

    # r "Farewell."
    r "永别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_11e6261b:

    # "He's schooled his face back into neutrality and returned to sewing at this point. Despite that, you know that both of you know what you saw."
    "他把脸修整成中立，现在又重新缝纫。尽管如此，你知道你们都知道自己所看到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_3ac29ae7:

    # e "Yes, I'll... I'll be back when I finish the scarf."
    e "是的，我，我吃完围巾就回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_86af871c:

    # e "Thank you for giving me the commission."
    e "谢谢你给我这个佣金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_b27fcc59:

    # "Rahim doesn't react to your words."
    "雷希姆对你的话没有反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_bfeda9a1:

    # e "I hope things are going well, Rahim."
    e "我希望一切顺利 雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_eb98bf66:

    # "The bulky bull grunts at you noncommittally."
    "大公牛对你发牢骚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_09e62486:

    # e "I was wondering if you had another commission for me?"
    e "我想知道你是否还有另一个佣金给我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_766774c4:

    # "This time, the bull looks up at you."
    "这次，公牛抬头看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_df55ce6b:

    # r "I have another hat for you to make."
    r "我还有另一顶帽子要给你做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_e6c65813:

    # "After last time, you understand why the man hates hats."
    "上次之后 你明白为什么男人讨厌帽子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_2553650d:

    # e "Would you happen to have any other commission I could work on?"
    e "你还有别的佣金吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_2dd00ae2:

    # "Rahim gives you a level glare."
    "雷希姆给了你一个水平的光亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_a4de76e6:

    # "You refuse to quail under his gaze, looking back at him with what you hope is confidence."
    "你拒绝在他眼皮底下吃子 以你希望的就是自信回望他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_211c085a:

    # r "Fine. I have a scarf that you can work on."
    r "好吧，我有一个围巾 你可以工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_002c20d5:

    # "Rahim passes you a list of ingredients you'll need."
    "雷希姆给你一份你需要的成分清单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_084e70f4:

    # e "Sounds good. I'll come back once it's ready."
    e "听起来不错 准备好了我会回来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_03_687c1f58:

    # "Done with the conversation, Rahim focuses on his work once more."
    "雷希姆又专注于工作,。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c047809b:

    # e "I'm pretty happy with how the scarf turned out."
    e "我对这条围巾的成品挺满意的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_20c22a10:

    # e "I wasn't happy with it at first, but a few finishing touches helped patch things up."
    e "一开始我不太满意，但补上几处收尾后，效果就好多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_0eebe24b:

    # "Rahim looks up from his project in pleasant surprise."
    "雷希姆惊喜地从手头的活计中抬起头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_787363f7:

    # "He drops his project completely for now, getting up to take the scarf from your hands."
    "他暂时放下手头的活，起身从你手里接过围巾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_89d977ec:

    # r "Let's see how it went."
    r "让我看看做得怎么样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8a8f56b3:

    # "Rahim first gives the scarf a light look-over for anything out of the ordinary."
    "雷希姆先粗略检查围巾，看看有没有什么不对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4bf2414c:

    # r "At first glance, it seems quite well made, if even more patterned than the original commission requested."
    r "乍一看，做工相当不错；花纹甚至比原订单要求的还多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_66764627:

    # "You scratch the back fo your head, beneath your horns, embarrassed."
    "你尴尬地挠了挠头，手指落在角下方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6bc8d043:

    # e "Those were the finishing touches."
    e "那些就是我最后加的细节。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_d6cbc6b6:

    # e "I didn't like the original design that much, so I got a bit carried away adding small improvements here and there."
    e "我不太喜欢原来的设计，所以一不小心就越做越起劲，到处添了些小改动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_33d69971:

    # e "Before I knew it, I had touched up the entire scarf."
    e "等我回过神来，整条围巾都已经被我重新修饰过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e9b3ed21:

    # "Rahim snorts in amusement."
    "雷希姆忍俊不禁地哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_0418501a:

    # r "You're supposed to do what the commissioner asks and nothing more or less. Personal projects and original designs are where you get to explore."
    r "你该做的是客户要求的东西，不多不少。个人项目和原创设计，才是你发挥和探索的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c359918e:

    # r "I'd chew you out for it if you didn't do such a damn good job of it."
    r "要不是你做得确实好得离谱，我早就把你骂一顿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a5fc2b24:

    # "Rahim's scowl is once again absent from his face. In its place is a very small smile."
    "雷希姆脸上的阴沉又一次消失了，取而代之的是一丝极淡的笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5935e35b:

    # r "Don't let your head get too big, but I can tell you've been listening to my lessons. Your work lacks many of its prior faults."
    r "别太得意，不过我看得出来你一直在听我的课。你的作品已经少了许多以前的毛病。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ec73797b:

    # e "I've improved?"
    e "我进步了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f5ca7235:

    # "Rahim gives you a sidelong glance, mildly irritated and amused."
    "雷希姆侧过眼看你，既有些恼火，又忍不住觉得好笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9f986fa1:

    # r "I'd recommend you don't fish for compliments with me. You already know the answer from what I've told you."
    r "我劝你别想从我这里套夸奖。就我之前说过的话，你已经知道答案了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_300ac853:

    # "He's right. You still wanted to hear him say it though."
    "他说得没错。可你还是想亲耳听他承认。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_58b33c95:

    # "Rahim sees your disappointment - not difficult considering the poor job you did of hiding it. He looks a bit guilty after that."
    "雷希姆看出你的失落——毕竟你掩饰得实在不怎么样。见状，他似乎有些内疚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_051066c1:

    # r "It's good to have someone else with an interest in tailoring. Up until now your work was uninspired, if high quality, but the scarf shows actual passion."
    r "有另一个人也对裁缝感兴趣，总归是件好事。到目前为止，你的作品虽然质量不错，却缺少灵气；但这条围巾里有真正的热情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_565be95f:

    # "...He really sucks at giving compliments. You clear your throat to try and take some of the awkwardness out of the air."
    "……他实在不擅长夸人。你清了清嗓子，试图驱散空气中的尴尬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_887b1c2c:

    # e "You're right. I noticed the time go by when I did the other projects, but with the scarf, it felt like I sat down to work on it, and suddenly had the completed scarf in my hands."
    e "你说得对。我做其他活时，能感觉到时间流逝；可做这条围巾时，仿佛才刚坐下，转眼间成品就已经在我手里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9cde316a:

    # "Rahim lets out an approving grunt."
    "雷希姆满意地哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a86b1f26:

    # r "I do not notice time pass while I am working either."
    r "我工作时也不会注意时间流逝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_538e1cd7:

    # r "It is as much of a boon as it is a bane."
    r "这既是好处，也是坏处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_dfc43281:

    # "You raise an eyebrow at that."
    "你对此挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ac66cd73:

    # e "What downsides does it have?"
    e "那会带来什么坏处？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8538a068:

    # r "It can be hard to remember to go check up on people or eat. There have been especially interesting projects that have lead me to work for three days without sleeping."
    r "有时很难记得去看看别人，或者记得吃饭。有些项目实在太吸引人，我曾经连续工作三天没合眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_0a0f30be:

    # r "I hadn't noticed the changing of the days in the moment, but lit and unlit my candle by instinct so I could keep working."
    r "当时我没有察觉日子正在更替，只是凭本能点燃、熄灭蜡烛，好继续工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_30265bfe:

    # "A shiver goes through your body. Hopefully you never quite reach that level of passion."
    "你不禁打了个寒颤。希望自己永远不会陷入那种程度的狂热。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8bcd21ed:

    # e "You only realized when you finished?"
    e "你是在做完之后才意识到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_14d66ed1:

    # "Rahim snorts dismissively."
    "雷希姆不以为然地哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6bad7d37:

    # r "No, I noticed when I woke up 12 hours later, having collapsed over my work."
    r "不。我是醒来十二小时后才注意到的——那时我已经伏在工作台上睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_2dea5083:

    # "It sounds dangerous for a person like this to live on his own. Does nobody take care of him?"
    "让这种人独自生活，听起来还真危险。没人照顾他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5deb0471:

    # e "You know, if you ever start an especially big project or something, you can tell me, and I'll bring you food and make sure you sleep, Rahim."
    e "你知道，如果你哪天开始做特别大的项目之类的，可以告诉我。我会给你送饭，确保你睡觉，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_b92428dd:

    # "Rahim blinks at you in surprise. You cringe, expecting him to chew you out for what you said."
    "雷希姆惊讶地眨了眨眼。你不由缩了缩脖子，以为他会因为你的话把你骂一顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_2917b322:

    # "Instead, his expression softens."
    "可他的神情反而柔和下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_67e55ea8:

    # r "I haven't had anybody offer something like that in..."
    r "我已经很多年没听过有人这样提议了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_dafcc160:

    # "He clears his throat slightly."
    "他轻轻清了清嗓子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_463899b6:

    # r "...years."
    r "……很多年。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_32a3caae:

    # "The bulky bull looks you over, as he would one of his tailoring pieces. Despite his eyes seeing only skin, fur, and cloth, it feels like he's peering into your soul."
    "这头魁梧的公牛打量着你，就像在检查一件裁缝作品。尽管他的目光只能看见皮肤、毛发和布料，你却感觉自己仿佛被他看透了灵魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_aafe5085:

    # e "Well, it sounds dangerous. If I can't convince you to take care of yourself, I can at least try and help."
    e "听起来确实很危险。既然我劝不动你照顾自己，至少还能尽力帮帮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5b8b46c8:

    # e "I know you'd do the same for me"
    e "我知道，如果换成你，你也会为我做同样的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4c9c056b:

    # "If reluctantly."
    "如果你不情愿，那就另说了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5bf98223:

    # r "I know you well enough to know that you will visit me regularly to make sure I'm eating and sleeping if I say no."
    r "我了解你，知道只要我拒绝，你就会定期过来看我，确认我有吃饭、有睡觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_7e82d7dd:

    # r "So I'll say yes."
    r "所以，我答应了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_dbee71fe:

    # "Not quite the answer you wanted, but good enough for now."
    "虽然不是你想要的答案，但暂时也够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ffeebf4a:

    # e "Alright, my cooking services are only 100 gold a meal-"
    e "好吧，我的厨艺服务每顿只收一百金币——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_3a6bc443:

    # "Rahim narrows his eyes."
    "雷希姆眯起眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_df17da61:

    # r "I can still take back what I said, you know."
    r "我随时可以收回刚才的话，你知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_0c89d68a:

    # "The intensity of his gaze makes you break a sweat."
    "他目光的压迫感让你冒出了汗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_544928cf:

    # e "I was just kidding, please have mercy, Rahim."
    e "我只是在开玩笑，请手下留情，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1e574865:

    # e "You know I wouldn't make you pay for helping you out."
    e "你知道，我不会因为帮你而收你的钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_38b832c5:

    # "Rahim snorts skeptically."
    "雷希姆怀疑地哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_536c07ce:

    # r "So you don't want the gold from making the scarf?"
    r "所以你不想拿做围巾的钱了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f1e97100:

    # "Your eyes widen in shock, before returning to normal as you realize he's joking."
    "你震惊地瞪大双眼，意识到他在开玩笑后才恢复正常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9fe77b71:

    # "Going by when he assigned you the commission, Rahim's style of joking is to say something brutal, and be even more deadpan than usual."
    "按他接下这个委托时的表现来看，雷希姆的玩笑方式就是故意说些狠话，同时比平时更加面无表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e0e578f6:

    # "You should probably start a guide to how to interact with him properly - he's frustratingly difficult to understand sometimes."
    "你大概该写一份“如何正确和他相处”的指南——他有时实在难懂得令人抓狂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_15dc84fe:

    # e "You know that's not what I meant. But I'll give you the scarf for free if I have to - I don't do this for the money alone."
    e "你知道我不是那个意思。但如果非要这样，我可以免费把围巾给你——我做这件事也不只是为了钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_3753cbcf:

    # "Rahim looks pleasantly surprised by your reaction to his joke. Well, as 'pleasant' or 'happy' as the grumpy bull's scowl can look."
    "雷希姆似乎对你回应他玩笑的方式感到意外。嗯，考虑到这头暴躁公牛的臭脸，这大概已经算“愉快”或“高兴”了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f7d5892b:

    # r "There's no need. You'll get your gold, as well as your story."
    r "没必要。你会拿到应得的金币，也会听到你的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5248d43f:

    # r "I give credit where it's due."
    r "该给的功劳，我不会吝啬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_73965f8e:

    # "The bulky bull snorts, and his tail flicks to the side rapidly as he finishes his thoughts on the matter."
    "魁梧的公牛哼了一声；说完这些，他的尾巴迅速甩向一侧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e045947c:

    # r "As a citizen of Lusterfield, you knew this already, but."
    r "作为乐斯民菲尔德的居民，你本来就知道这一点，不过——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_658b7ecf:

    # "You meet Rahim's eyes, and find yourself trapped there by the determination they are filled with."
    "你迎上雷希姆的目光，却被其中的坚定牢牢吸住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_452c4e7c:

    # r "I'll come to your assistance if ever you need me."
    r "如果你有需要，我会来帮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_bb230b10:

    # "A nervous gulp later, and you find yourself nodding."
    "你紧张地咽了口唾沫，随后点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_98efa8d1:

    # "A lot happened after your offer, and you don't quite know how Rahim feels about it all. All you can do is hope that he appreciated it."
    "你的提议之后发生了不少事，但你不太清楚雷希姆究竟作何感想。你只能希望，他确实把这份心意放在了心上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_cf5430db:

    # e "That sounds like an awful experience."
    e "这听起来真糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ddc41762:

    # "Rahim shrugs his shoulders at that."
    "雷希姆对此耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6406476a:

    # r "It's the cost of passion."
    r "这是追求热爱的代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_96a0ccbc:

    # r "I can and do pay it every single day of my life."
    r "我这一生每天都在付出，也甘愿付出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_09c65ae8:

    # "You grimace subconsciously."
    "你下意识地皱起了眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_692df60a:

    # e "Is passion really worth risking life and limb over?"
    e "追求热爱，真的值得拿命去冒险吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_34da1199:

    # "The bull just looks at you with his typical scowl highlighting his features."
    "公牛只是看着你，惯常的阴沉神情让五官显得更加严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_bf9b0b78:

    # r "I'm not exactly risking all that anymore."
    r "我现在已经不算在冒这种险了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_3ab7bcb9:

    # r "If anything, I wish I had risked more. A life without passion is one not worth living."
    r "真要说的话，我倒希望当初冒险更多些。没有热爱的生活，不值得活着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_df23fe2a:

    # "There is no doubt in his voice. You hope never to be his enemy. You get the feeling he'd die sooner than let you get away scot-free."
    "他的语气毫不犹豫。你希望自己永远不要成为他的敌人——感觉他宁可死，也不会让你逍遥法外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_cc0d4b05:

    # e "So the scarf has no issues that stand out to you?"
    e "所以，你看不出这条围巾有什么明显的问题？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5db66979:

    # "Rahim blinks, suddenly realizing he's been distracted from something tailoring related."
    "雷希姆眨了眨眼，突然意识到自己被裁缝之外的事分散了注意力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_85034ba5:

    # r "Oh, at surface level it certainly seems so."
    r "哦，表面上确实如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a06c1ef5:

    # "Surface level isn't good enough for you at this point, and neither is it for Rahim, apparently. The bull brings the scarf back under his attentive gaze."
    "但仅看表面，对现在的你来说不够；显然对雷希姆也一样。公牛重新把围巾放回专注的审视之下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9900f590:

    # "His expression doesn't shift the entire time he looks at it."
    "他从头到尾端详着围巾，脸上的表情始终没有变化。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_03a905a4:

    # "The longer he spends, checking different angles and prodding seams, the more anxious you get."
    "他检查不同角度、拨弄接缝的时间越长，你就越焦虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_16d5fd00:

    # "Did you make a mistake with the weft? Maybe one of the adornments is lopsided?"
    "织法是不是出了问题？也许某处装饰歪了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_2778fc20:

    # "After what feels like an eternity, the bull looks up at you."
    "感觉过了漫长的一生后，公牛终于抬头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_aa04dd06:

    # r "The actual quality of your tailoring is quite high."
    r "你的裁缝手艺本身相当不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_fb0e2566:

    # r "Any improvements at this stage will be difficult to achieve, and are ones you most likely already identified."
    r "现在再想改进会很难，而且大多数问题你很可能已经自己发现了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_0c00c3c4:

    # r "In case you haven't, the main thing you have to worry about is planning ahead as you work. I see spots where you had to change the distance between each stitch to account for an unexpected lack of space."
    r "如果你还没发现，最需要注意的是在动手前做好规划。我看得出有些地方，你因为突然发现空间不够，只好调整针脚之间的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_57b8beab:

    # r "Despite this being nearly irrelevant to the commissions I've given you before, the main thing you have left to improve upon is design."
    r "虽然这点与我之前交给你的委托几乎无关，但你接下来最需要提升的是设计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a9abecdc:

    # "You tilt your head, questioning, and a bit hurt."
    "你歪了歪头，既疑惑又有些受伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_13c12dc9:

    # e "I thought the design was good?"
    e "我以为设计得不错？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a89652f2:

    # "Rahim grimaces slightly."
    "雷希姆微微皱眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_37edb346:

    # r "I said it was passionate. It is flawed to say the least."
    r "我说的是有热情。严格来说，它至少存在缺陷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_bbcee9b7:

    # r "It is good for a first attempt."
    r "作为第一次尝试，已经不错了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9c4704ae:

    # "He's being gentle about it, but it still hurts like a knife to the guts."
    "他已经说得很委婉，可这话还是像刀子一样扎进你的肚子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_d3582e44:

    # e "I understand. What is it that most needs working on?"
    e "我明白了。最需要改进的是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9d46f063:

    # r "Color theory."
    r "色彩理论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8acf4c41:

    # "Rahim points at a patch of bright blue, a snowflake you patterned in against a blood red background."
    "雷希姆指向一块亮蓝色的图案——那是一片雪花，你把它绣在血红色的背景上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e77274c3:

    # r "Discarding the issue of a snowflake being an odd choice for for the Summer, you generally want to have contrasting or similar colors together."
    r "先不说夏天绣雪花本身有些奇怪；通常来说，你应该把对比色或相近色搭配在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_89e36e6c:

    # r "Without something to balance or add further contrast, these two are just in between contrast and similarity."
    r "没有其他颜色来平衡或进一步形成对比，这两种颜色就落在了既不对比、也不相近的尴尬位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_30b7b782:

    # r "It looks bad."
    r "很难看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_278a5186:

    # "Ouch. This wasn't what you expected to hear when you came here."
    "哎。你来这里时可没想到会听到这种评价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8b174edc:

    # r "I tell you this not to be cruel, but to see you improve."
    r "我告诉你这些不是为了刻薄，而是想看你进步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9bad81b5:

    # r "You've consistently listened to my instructions, I think you'd prefer honesty over mercy."
    r "你一直都认真听我的指导。我想，比起姑息，你更希望我坦诚相告。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_2e0e08fb:

    # "He could still be nicer about it."
    "他其实可以说得更委婉一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_600501ae:

    # e "Y-yeah. I understand."
    e "好、好吧。我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4f6b4fd5:

    # e "Different is good, so is similar. Anything in between is bad unless it has something to balance."
    e "不同很好，相似也很好。介于两者之间的搭配，除非有东西加以平衡，否则就是糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6cfdae0d:

    # "Rahim gives you a nod."
    "雷希姆朝你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9a599947:

    # r "Precisely."
    r "正是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a63e7391:

    # e "Where did you learn design from anyway? Rayleigh?"
    e "你到底是从哪里学会设计的？雷利吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_d280173e:

    # r "It feels a bit like you're trying to escape further criticism, but I was just about done."
    r "感觉你有点想借机逃避更多批评，不过我也差不多说完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1e15a7c5:

    # r "I'll tell you the story - it is the same one you were looking for earlier, the group that taught me the most."
    r "我会告诉你这个故事——就是你之前想问的、对我影响最大的那个团体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1c49b6cd:

    # "Rahim gestures for you to sit down, giving you a good angle to watch him sew as he tells you the story. He hasn't started, but he's preparing the materials."
    "雷希姆示意你坐下，好让你能从合适的角度看着他一边缝纫一边讲故事。他还没开始，只是在准备材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_363eecf1:

    # r "You already know the group that taught me, but they wouldn't come to mind when one thinks of good tailoring."
    r "你已经知道教过我的那个团体了，但一般人想到优秀的裁缝时，不会想到他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1f366da4:

    # r "At least, anymore."
    r "至少现在不会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9336cff4:

    # "Rahim picks up his needle and thread, and begins to weave the story."
    "雷希姆拿起针线，开始编织这个故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_d4c07533:

    # r "When I first came to Lusterfield, I did so as an adventurer."
    r "我初到乐斯民菲尔德时，是以冒险者的身份来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_dc32e58a:

    # r "I fully intended to stay here only a few days, helping a few folks here and there, learning a little, and continuing my travels."
    r "我原本只打算在这里待几天，帮帮这个、帮帮那个，学点东西，然后继续旅行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c74fe2cb:

    # "The bull heaves a sigh, his hand tentatively weaving the cloth, struggling to externalize something stored deep in himself, complicating it by thinking about, rather than experiencing it."
    "公牛长叹一声，手上试探着穿针引线，努力把深藏心底的东西说出来；可他总是在思考那段经历，而不是重新经历它，反而让事情更复杂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_b2af65fd:

    # "It's like you can see his mind clicking pieces together, putting himself in the shoes of a self long past."
    "你仿佛能看见他的思绪将一块块碎片拼在一起，把自己代入很久以前的那个自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ebc25443:

    # r "It was only when I met the goat tribe that my journey was halted."
    r "直到我遇见山羊部落，旅程才停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a75cc98f:

    # r "Never before had I seen cloth so beautifully textured, so vividly colored."
    r "我从没见过质地如此漂亮、色彩如此鲜艳的布料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_883336f9:

    # "He looks at you and snorts dismissively."
    "他看了你一眼，不以为然地哼了声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a3ebb08d:

    # r "Don't even bother thinking about what they wear now. Only echoes of past glory remain in that place."
    r "现在穿的东西就别想了。那里只剩昔日荣光的回声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_7d089062:

    # e "What they wear isn't exactly... complex, but the colors are still vivid, I'd say?"
    e "他们现在穿的东西算不上……复杂，但颜色依然鲜艳，我觉得是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_adbb57f5:

    # "Rahim gives a grudging nod."
    "雷希姆不情愿地点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_fd51b62e:

    # r "They have access to the same materials, and remember how to use them."
    r "他们能弄到同样的材料，也记得该怎么使用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6e3712ce:

    # r "Blue, at least. I haven't seen them recently enough to know if they've kept the other colors."
    r "至少蓝色是这样。我最近没见过他们，无法确定其他颜色还在不在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8a2d70b0:

    # e "But, I wouldn't think of you as all that old...? How fast did all of this disappear?"
    e "不过，我不觉得你有那么老……这一切消失得有多快？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c16c3bc6:

    # "The bull grimaces."
    "公牛皱起了眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a64eaa3b:

    # r "A matter of years, though her techniques are still around. I {i}do{/i} still remember them, even if they don't."
    r "已经过去好几年了，虽然她的技艺还流传着。我{i}确实{/i}还记得它们，即使他们自己已经忘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_b60ddc27:

    # "The two of you are briefly quiet as you process what he said, and he reaches for a new color to sew with."
    "你们短暂地安静下来，消化着他的话；他伸手拿起另一种颜色的线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e5639544:

    # e "Who was the, umm, the woman in the goat tribe you learned from?"
    e "那个……你在山羊部落学手艺的女人是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f407744a:

    # "Rahim blinks twice, as if suddenly remembering something."
    "雷希姆眨了两下眼，仿佛突然想起了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6cf4d79b:

    # r "I forgot you weren't here for that, sorry."
    r "我忘了你当时还不在这里，对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_619766ef:

    # r "The goats' greatest - and only - tailor was a grizzled old water buffalo by the time I met her."
    r "我认识她时，山羊族最伟大——也是唯一的——裁缝，已经是一头饱经风霜的老水牛了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e06ae716:

    # e "A mentor to you?"
    e "她是你的导师？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_7917a9c5:

    # "Rahim's face is in an expression you've seen only a few times before, a melancholy reserved mainly for when he spoke of his daughter."
    "雷希姆脸上浮现出一种你只见过几次的神情——一种他谈起女儿时才会流露的忧郁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_adbc66a7:

    # r "As much as a master can be a mentor to an experienced tailor. I haven't met a better tailor to this day, and I don't think I ever will."
    r "算是吧，就像大师能成为一位资深裁缝的导师那样。直到今天，我还没遇到比她更好的裁缝，也不认为自己以后会遇到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_cc90bc41:

    # "You chuckle lightly, trying to break the heavy mood."
    "你轻轻笑了笑，试图冲淡沉重的气氛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_7b1b73e1:

    # e "You never know, someday I may become that good!"
    e "谁知道呢，说不定有一天我也能达到那个水平！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_45f00e0f:

    # "Rahim raises his eyebrows at that, amused. Despite that, there is a piece of him that seems to take you seriously."
    "雷希姆听后扬起眉毛，脸上带着笑意。尽管如此，你感觉他似乎有一部分确实把你的话当真了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4649ba35:

    # r "If you are serious about tailoring, aim for it. I am close to her level, but I have a ways to go yet. You'll have nothing but respect from me if you manage it."
    r "如果你真心想做裁缝，那就朝那个目标努力。我离她的水平已经很近，但还有一段路要走。要是你真能做到，我会由衷敬重你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f8582497:

    # "You feel a sudden urge to start tailoring just from hearing that."
    "光是听到这话，你就突然产生了开始学裁缝的冲动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_997ee96f:

    # e "So, she was amazing, and incredibly old. I can't meet her, I at least want to know who she was."
    e "所以，她既厉害又非常年长。我见不到她，至少也想知道她是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_97023691:

    # "Rahim slaps you upside the head, careful not to stab himself on your horns, or hit you too hard."
    "雷希姆拍了拍你的脑袋，特意避开你的角，也没有用太大力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_7e0ac03e:

    # r "I should kick you out for impatience or impertinence."
    r "我本该因为你的急躁或无礼把你赶出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_552be3d6:

    # "Your head doesn't quite hurt, but you're just irritated enough to snap back."
    "你的头倒是不怎么疼，但这句话还是让你恼火得足以回嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_01a930e5:

    # e "And why don't you?"
    e "那你为什么不呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_34902ee2:

    # r "I don't mind it."
    r "我不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8118dfb0:

    # "Just as you open your mouth to speak, Rahim finishes his sentence."
    "你刚张嘴想说话，雷希姆就把话说完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_2477ff59:

    # r "Within reason of course. I still expect you to treat me with the respect I deserve."
    r "当然是有限度的。不过，我仍然要求你给予我应有的尊重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e0603dbf:

    # "You squirm a bit in your seat."
    "你在座位上扭了扭身子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_89b52820:

    # e "And me? Do I get any respect in return?"
    e "那我呢？我也能得到一点尊重吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_3155f868:

    # "Rahim lets out a dark chuckle, a joke at both of your expenses."
    "雷希姆发出一声阴沉的轻笑，拿你们两人开了个玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_d0c47848:

    # r "You deserve a little. I give you it as you continue to earn it."
    r "你配得上一点。只要你继续证明自己，我就会继续给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_645bf517:

    # "You grumble a bit under your breath, unsatisfied with that answer."
    "你在嘴边嘟囔了几句，对这个答案并不满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_84024f78:

    # r "What was that?"
    r "刚才说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1a400f0b:

    # e "Nothing."
    e "没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_3c8bfc2b:

    # "He gives you a look that tells you exactly how much he believes that."
    "他看了你一眼，那眼神清楚地告诉你他有多不相信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1839cd61:

    # r "Sure."
    r "是吗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_eba0cb6d:

    # r "If you think I'm demanding, you should have met Larra."
    r "如果你觉得我要求高，那你真该见见拉拉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1229400d:

    # r "She only used my name after a month of teaching me. Up until then I was just 'that one', or 'the bull over there.'"
    r "她教了我一个月，才肯叫我的名字。那之前，我只是\"那个家伙\"，或者\"那边那头公牛\"。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6d559ace:

    # "A shiver goes down your spine. You don't want to think about learning from someone like that."
    "你背脊发凉。你可不想拜这种人为师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_108fd841:

    # "It took you long enough to be able to talk to Rahim without being insulted... too much."
    "你花了好一阵子，才终于能和雷希姆说上话，而且不用挨太多骂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_de433c23:

    # e "That sounds. Unpleasant?"
    e "听起来……不太愉快？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6866622f:

    # "You quickly correct yourself, not meaning to be so rude."
    "你赶紧改口，并不是有意要这么无礼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e69f9cbd:

    # e "Not to speak ill of the dead, of course."
    e "当然，我不是要说死者的坏话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_640f180f:

    # "To your surprise, Rahim only snorts in amusement."
    "出乎你意料的是，雷希姆只是轻轻哼了一声，像是在觉得好笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_bf3efc43:

    # r "Oh, I wouldn't worry about it, I think she'd take it as a compliment if anything."
    r "哦，不用担心。我想她要是听见，反倒会把这当成夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_bf77c8d0:

    # r "She had two pleasures in life: Tailoring, and making people uncomfortable. She excelled in both."
    r "她一生只有两种乐趣：裁缝，以及让别人浑身不自在。这两件事她都做得出色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_eb7a56a9:

    # "You have to bite your tongue to prevent yourself from asking if she taught him both or just tailoring."
    "你只好咬住舌头，免得问出她教给他的究竟是这两样，还是只有裁缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8b204d55:

    # e "And she's the one you learned the most from?"
    e "她就是你学到最多东西的人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_27f58336:

    # "Rahim nods, the piece now identifiable as a sock in his hands nearly finished."
    "雷希姆点点头；他手里的东西已经能辨认出是只袜子，几乎完工了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_424ea57d:

    # r "She was stingy with compliments, but not with lessons."
    r "她吝于夸奖，却从不吝于授课。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_d1d83a35:

    # r "It was her that taught me how to actually {i}design{/i} what I tailored. She's the one that made me look at tailoring as an art form, and not just a profession."
    r "是她教会我真正去{i}设计{/i}自己要做的衣服。也是她让我把裁缝看成一种艺术，而不只是一门营生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8fe80c88:

    # "It takes a bit for you to phrase the question this raises - Rahim has been quite understanding so far, but you have a feeling you're on thin ice."
    "这个问题并不好问出口——雷希姆目前一直很通情达理，但你觉得自己已经如履薄冰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e2b1cbd6:

    # e "But none of the goats picked up her lessons because...?"
    e "可是，山羊们都没学到她的手艺，因为……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f3d10d29:

    # "You don't say any of the reasons you thought of. None of them are particularly favorable."
    "你没有把想到的那些理由说出来。那些理由没一个好听的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_fd447d0d:

    # "Rahim just rolls his eyes as he sews."
    "雷希姆一边缝，一边只是翻了个白眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_bad4ebce:

    # r "Same reason people didn't pick up mine."
    r "人们不愿意学我的，也是同一个原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_42254219:

    # "He pauses briefly to correct himself."
    "他停了一下，像是想纠正自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1ecf03f5:

    # r "Probably."
    r "大概吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ec4607f5:

    # r "Nobody there or here was interested in tailoring, except for myself and her. Her personality didn't help matters either."
    r "那里也好，这里也好，除了我和她，没有人对裁缝感兴趣。她的性格当然也没帮上什么忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_db3c1a49:

    # "There's a pause. You very intentionally stay silent."
    "空气安静了一瞬。你刻意保持沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_69f033d6:

    # r "Neither does mine, I suppose."
    r "我想，我的性格也没帮上什么忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_2ca74a91:

    # e "I won't say you're wrong, but from what you're saying, Larra seemed like somebody worthy of admiration and love."
    e "我不能说你错了，但照你说的，拉拉听起来像是个值得敬仰、也值得去爱的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_935721f2:

    # e "I'd say the same of you."
    e "我也会这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_99b19981:

    # "Rahim freezes in his tailoring. You're pretty sure he's stopped breathing. It takes only a few moments for him to recover, but the bull's expression remains strained."
    "雷希姆手上的活突然停了。你几乎确定他屏住了呼吸。过了片刻，他才缓过来，但脸上的表情仍然绷得很紧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_0ae6e693:

    # r "I had my chance at that."
    r "我也曾有机会拥有那些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_25e70510:

    # r "That you believe I do may be because you weren't here to see what I lost."
    r "你会这样认为，或许只是因为你没在这里亲眼看过我失去的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_957833f8:

    # e "I can't tell you if that's true or not for sure - I wasn't there, and I will never have been there. We'll never know."
    e "我没法确定地告诉你那是不是真的——我当时不在场，也永远不可能在场。我们永远不会知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_28879e2d:

    # "You take a deep breath before you continue. It is a difficult sentence, and one that cannot be botched."
    "你深吸一口气，才继续说下去。这句话很难说出口，不能说错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_90a8ffd0:

    # e "But the bull I've met since coming here."
    e "但我来到这里后认识的这头公牛……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_464a10b0:

    # "Taking a risk, you reach out and tap his chest gently."
    "你冒了个险，伸手轻轻点了点他的胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f374519b:

    # e "He deserves it. If not from everyone, then from me at least."
    e "他值得。就算不是人人都这么认为，至少我认为他值得。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_b3b55575:

    # "Said bull turns to you, looking completely bewildered."
    "公牛转过身来，满脸困惑地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_fd9125cd:

    # r "Where is this coming from? I'm a good tailor, and maybe even a good teacher, but I'm otherwise just a grouchy old bull."
    r "我是一名好裁缝，也许还算个好老师；但除此之外，我只是头脾气暴躁的老公牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_663531e4:

    # "It's your turn to look at him confused."
    "这回轮到你困惑地看着他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_192c051b:

    # e "Those are fairly admirable things? Except for the bad temper, which I don't really mind."
    e "这两样都挺值得钦佩的吧？至于坏脾气……我其实不怎么介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4706dca9:

    # "Rahim's face goes from confusion to outright suspicion."
    "雷希姆的神情从困惑变成了彻底的怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f5e0490d:

    # e "...that much. It can be a bit rough to deal with, but I've learned it's just part of who you are."
    e "……至少没那么介意。虽然有时有点难应付，但我已经明白，那只是你性格的一部分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4dd53d0c:

    # r "That's still not exactly admirable, but I'll concede the point considering I admire Larra to this day."
    r "这算不上多么值得钦佩，但考虑到我至今仍然敬仰拉拉，我就承认这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_59ee6baf:

    # r "Even if she was, as the old chieftain phrased it 'a crotchety old bitch.'"
    r "即使她正如老酋长所说，是个\"爱发牢骚的老婊子\"。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_71c468f4:

    # "That's good enough for you. The man really needs to learn how to accept a compliment."
    "这对你来说已经够了。这个人真该学学怎么接受夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f30d701b:

    # r "I appreciate the sentiment. Even if we disagree, it's... nice to know someone like you thinks that of me."
    r "我很欣赏你的心意。即便我们意见不同，知道有人像你这样看待我……也挺好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a8ebd8aa:

    # "You can't help but smile. Even if he didn't mean to, that was the best compliment he'd given tonight."
    "你忍不住笑了。哪怕他并非有意，这也是他今晚给出的最好一句夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_bb161db7:

    # r "Don't think I'm going to go any easier on you just because you said a couple of nice words, though."
    r "不过别以为就凭你说了几句好话，我就会对你手下留情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_8751f1b5:

    # "Alas, he couldn't let you get away without at least a drop of negativity."
    "唉，他终究还是得带上一点消极的话才肯放你走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e47f52e5:

    # "Even so, you can't seem to help but like him."
    "即便如此，你还是忍不住喜欢他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_d33e924a:

    # e "Yes, it definitely doesn't help, but I'm used to it."
    e "是啊，这确实没什么帮助，但我已经习惯了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_31c0529b:

    # "The bull raises an eyebrow at that."
    "公牛挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9391a22e:

    # e "Just like you got used to Larra's bad temper, I've gotten used to yours."
    e "就像你已经习惯了拉拉的坏脾气，我也习惯了你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a8555b3a:

    # "All you get is a light shrug - limited in scope to not interrupt his sewing."
    "他只是轻轻耸了耸肩——动作幅度很小，不至于打断手上的缝纫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_9f1c3a61:

    # r "Fair enough. But just like her, I'm probably going to wind up dying only having taught one person."
    r "说得也是。不过，我可能也会和她一样，直到只教会一个人就死去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_e219d4cb:

    # e "I think you might be getting ahead of yourself there, but it's definitely a possibility."
    e "我觉得你可能想得太早了，不过确实有这种可能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_09c8a131:

    # "A sardonic smile splays across your lips."
    "你唇边绽开一抹讥诮的笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a1014eb1:

    # e "It seems only us adventurers have the patience for each other."
    e "看来只有我们这些冒险家，才有耐心应付彼此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c0de847e:

    # "Rahim snorts lightly."
    "雷希姆轻轻哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a25ea4e3:

    # r "Larra wasn't an adventurer, but yes. It is an interesting chain of inheritance."
    r "拉拉不是冒险家，不过你说得对。这条传承链倒是很有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4a2d4aa5:

    # "The conversation sort of falls flat after that."
    "之后谈话有些冷场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_409552d9:

    # "Rahim sews, nearly having completed his project, while you sit there silently, twiddling your thumbs."
    "雷希姆缝着手里的活，几乎就要完工；你则安静地坐在一旁，百无聊赖地捻着拇指。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_99245f31:

    # "Unable to think of anything else to ask, you finally broach that most uncomfortable of questions."
    "想不出还有什么可问的，你终于问出了那个最令人不自在的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_33b8b339:

    # e "So, what happened to her?"
    e "那么，她后来怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c5b73aae:

    # "The bull flinches, accidentally piercing himself with the needle. The cut is small enough not to need medical attention, but you can tell it hurts."
    "公牛微微一颤，针尖意外刺进了自己。伤口小到不需要医治，但你看得出很疼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_a090ec2c:

    # "He continues as if nothing happened."
    "他若无其事地继续缝着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_19904e4f:

    # r "She was on the cart the day the war started."
    r "战争开始那天，她就在那辆车上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_94004a03:

    # "Oh."
    "不妙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_3ef2b2a2:

    # "This time, silence really {i}does{/i} fall, and you wouldn't be the one to break it even if you had to spend the next three hours here."
    "这一次，沉默真的{i}降临{/i}了；就算接下来得在这里待上三个小时，你也不会主动打破它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5a3991e0:

    # "Luckily, Rahim breaks the silence after only five minutes, his sock laying finished in his hands."
    "幸好，才过了五分钟，雷希姆就打破了沉默；他手里那只袜子已经织好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_18fca02b:

    # "He does not look as satisfied as you thought he would."
    "他看起来并没有你想象中那么满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_276ab81d:

    # r "I believe it would be best if you went home for now."
    r "我觉得你现在最好先回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6d686a78:

    # "A pang of discomfort surges through you as you hear just how tired he sounds."
    "听出他声音里有多疲惫，你心里一阵不适。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_af0963c7:

    # r "As far as I'm concerned, our deal is still on, and I didn't give you much of a story this time around."
    r "在我看来，我们的交易还算数；只是这次我没给你讲多少故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_845ebb8b:

    # "He slides a small pile of gold your way."
    "他把一小堆金币朝你推过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_417f045e:

    # r "I tried to compensate a bit with the reward. Hopefully it should be more than equal to its worth in stories."
    r "我想用报酬稍微补偿一下。希望它至少抵得上你本该听到的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6dfd40c2:

    # r "I truly do not understand why you wish to hear them."
    r "我实在不明白，你为什么非要听这些故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ab3b1629:

    # "You open your mouth to say something, but realize that now isn't the time. He can't hear you - his eyes are looking at something that isn't there."
    "你张口想说些什么，却意识到现在不是时候。他根本听不见你——他的目光落在某个并不存在的东西上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c898abd1:

    # "Quietly, you pick up the 100 Gold Coins and store them in your pouch."
    "你默默拿起那一百枚金币，收进钱袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f7952ad1:

    # "There is nothing you can say to the man that lost his mentor and friend, daughter, and wife to a war he is still trapped in."
    "对于一个在战争中失去导师兼朋友、女儿和妻子，而至今仍被困在那场战争里的人，你什么也说不出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1f51abcf:

    # "All you can do is mumble a brief 'Thank you.' and head out."
    "你只能低声说一句简短的\"谢谢\"，然后离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_2dc0d1a5:

    # e "I finished the scarf."
    e "我把围巾做完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_f1192fed:

    # "You present your work to the bull, who gives it a cursory glance before accepting it."
    "你把作品递给公牛。他草草看了一眼，便收下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_46c4ac30:

    # r "It's of acceptable quality."
    r "质量还算过得去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ac6b880b:

    # r "Here, your reward."
    r "给，你的报酬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_7ad6877f:

    # "Rahim pours 100 Gold into your hands."
    "雷希姆把一百枚金币倒进你手里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_ea798f2c:

    # e "Thank you. It's much appreciated."
    e "谢谢，真是帮大忙了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_35a45a95:

    # "The bull grunts at that, turning to some unidentifiable clothing he's working on."
    "公牛对你的道谢只哼了一声，转身继续处理手上那件无法辨认的衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_66a49605:

    # r "You'll get compensated for as much as your work is worth. Nothing to thank me for."
    r "你的工作值多少报酬，你就会拿到多少。没什么好谢的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_88ac6ec2:

    # "You're about to accept that and leave, but pause as you step out."
    "你正要接受这笔钱离开，却在迈出门时停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6bdc3f48:

    # e "What about your profit margin?"
    e "那你的利润呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_48f2dc99:

    # "Rahim gives you a skeptical look."
    "雷希姆怀疑地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6e78b4d9:

    # r "Mine to worry about. Don't worry, it's more than made, if it even matters."
    r "这是我该操心的事。别担心，赚回来的钱远不止这些——如果这还重要的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_40e70611:

    # "He doesn't seem very happy that you're digging into this. You should probably leave."
    "他似乎不太高兴你追问这件事。你最好还是走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_5cc21f69:

    # e "Alright, well. Farewell, Rahim."
    e "好吧，那就这样。再见，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_99cbf97f:

    # "Rahim gives you a terse nod, and nothing more."
    "雷希姆简短地点了点头，除此之外什么也没说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_74a98378:

    # e "Rahim, I finished the Scarf!"
    e "雷希姆，我把围巾做完了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_039c3f3b:

    # "Rahim says nothing. He just looks straight into your eyes from his seat, and stares at you."
    "雷希姆什么也没说。他只是坐在那里直直看进你的眼睛，盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_1dbba092:

    # e "Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_83b1b38c:

    # "Rahim's glare only grows harsher in response to your attempt to call out to him."
    "你试图叫他时，雷希姆的目光反而更加严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_6e275b70:

    # e "I guess I should come back when it's all properly done?"
    e "我想，我还是等一切彻底做好后再回来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_c91ad6c3:

    # r "Yes. Do not try to lie to me again. It reflects poorly upon my decision to trust you."
    r "是的。别再试图骗我。这只会让当初选择信任你的我显得很糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_4b8229d1:

    # "Rahim continues to stare into your soul."
    "雷希姆继续凝视着你的灵魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_03_de2a3c2f:

    # "You take this as a sign that you should leave now."
    "你把这当成了现在该离开的信号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_fda9931d:

    # e "I think I'm ready to take on another commission, Rahim!"
    e "我想我已经准备好接下另一个委托了，雷希姆！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_e6be7679:

    # "Rahim snorts."
    "雷希姆哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_f5b87fa5:

    # r "Good. I've got a project set aside for you, since you mentioned having interest in doing this again."
    r "很好。你之前说还想再做一次，所以我已经给你留了个项目。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_9a42ae63:

    # "He reaches behind him and grabs a couple bolts of cloth, as well as a loop of thin metal wire."
    "他伸手到身后，拿出几卷布料，还有一个细金属丝圈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_8b162545:

    # r "You'll need that enthusiasm for this one - you're making my least favorite, hats."
    r "这次你得用上那股干劲——要做的是我最讨厌的东西：帽子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_fef9af56:

    # "You look at him slightly confused."
    "你有些困惑地看着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_9fc48241:

    # e "Your least favorite thing is... hats?"
    e "你最讨厌的东西是……帽子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_a1c9a7e5:

    # "Rahim nods, dead serious."
    "雷希姆一本正经地点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_bfdab8d2:

    # r "Yes. They're the farthest thing away from normal clothing as I can get, and I have to buy a specific size of metal loop with each commission..."
    r "没错。它们是我能做的东西里最不像普通衣服的，而且每份委托都得买特定尺寸的金属圈……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_af67c55a:

    # r "It's a huge hassle."
    r "麻烦得要命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_754601d5:

    # "And he's making you do it."
    "他偏偏还要让你做这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_f80b72f2:

    # r "I see that look on your face."
    r "我看见你脸上的表情了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_1cf21873:

    # r "I did give you the worst thing in here to do, but I did also do the most annoying part for you already."
    r "我确实把这里最糟糕的活交给了你，不过最麻烦的部分我已经替你做完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_9f3a87b9:

    # "He hands the materials your way."
    "他把材料递给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_05a4ee60:

    # r "This isn't everything you need, by the way. Just the hardest stuff. Here's the list of everything else you'll need."
    r "顺带一提，这些不是你需要的全部材料，只是最难准备的部分。这是其余材料的清单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_6f5a86b2:

    # "You sigh, looking down the list of ingredients... yarn, feather, wire... These are all a bit out of the way."
    "你叹了口气，低头看向材料清单……毛线、羽毛、金属丝……这些东西都不太好找。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_dde0384f:

    # e "Alright, I guess I should get to it."
    e "好吧，我还是开始干活吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_ef85d42e:

    # r "That's the spirit."
    r "这才像话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_4507425e:

    # r "Tell me when you're done so I can inspect your work and give you your payment."
    r "做完后告诉我，我好检查你的作品，给你结算报酬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_0dc19029:

    # "You nod, and head out."
    "你点点头，走了出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_a46ef5ae:

    # e "Can I do another commission?"
    e "我可以再接一个委托吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_f9266441:

    # r "...sure."
    r "……可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_9a42ae63_1:

    # "He reaches behind him and grabs a couple bolts of cloth, as well as a loop of thin metal wire."
    "他伸手到身后，拿出几卷布料，还有一个细金属丝圈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_b1723bd3:

    # r "Here. I was recently asked to make a hat."
    r "给。我最近接到一份做帽子的委托。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_7491f58c:

    # r "I do not like making hats."
    r "我不喜欢做帽子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_b68ee87d:

    # r "It's not a high profile commission, so I don't have to worry about your quality."
    r "这不是什么重要的委托，所以不用担心你的质量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_1638018e:

    # e "...My work isn't that bad."
    e "……我的手艺没那么差。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_57304232:

    # "Rahim nods."
    "雷希姆点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_9dcd81a7:

    # r "It's not. But it also isn't good enough for anything beyond functionality."
    r "不差。不过除了实用性，也没好到能做别的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_af59c98e:

    # "Ouch. that hurt to hear."
    "嘶，这话听着真扎心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_3d18113f:

    # r "You'll need to grab metal hoop, some yarn, and feather in addition to the materials I'm giving you."
    r "除了我给你的材料，你还得自己找金属圈、毛线和羽毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_717a4209:

    # r "I'll pay you when you finish."
    r "你做完后我再付钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_a66012a7:

    # "You nod, grabbing the materials Rahim hands your way."
    "你点点头，接过雷希姆递来的材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_2bc82606:

    # e "Okay. I'll come back when I'm done."
    e "好吧，做完我就回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_02_7e32be50:

    # "You get a grunt in return. The conversation is over, it seems."
    "他只回了你一声哼。看来谈话到此为止。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_4cf790a4:

    # e "Rahim, I finished the hat!"
    e "雷希姆，我把平顶软帽做完了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_039c3f3b:

    # "Rahim says nothing. He just looks straight into your eyes from his seat, and stares at you."
    "雷希姆什么也没说。他只是坐在那里直直看进你的眼睛，盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_1dbba092:

    # e "Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_83b1b38c:

    # "Rahim's glare only grows harsher in response to your attempt to call out to him."
    "你试图叫他时，雷希姆的目光反而更加严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_6e275b70:

    # e "I guess I should come back when it's all properly done?"
    e "我想，我还是等一切彻底做好后再回来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_c91ad6c3:

    # r "Yes. Do not try to lie to me again. It reflects poorly upon my decision to trust you."
    r "是的。别再试图骗我。这只会让当初选择信任你的我显得很糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_4b8229d1:

    # "Rahim continues to stare into your soul."
    "雷希姆继续凝视着你的灵魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_de2a3c2f:

    # "You take this as a sign that you should leave now."
    "你把这当成了现在该离开的信号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_122a5edc:

    # e "I finished."
    e "我完成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_a0cd44d4:

    # "You hand the hat over to Rahim."
    "你把平顶软帽递给雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_7e1c3ef5:

    # r "Mm. About as good as I expected."
    r "嗯。和我预想的差不多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_f134c764:

    # r "Here. Your commission."
    r "给，你的委托费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_9fb079aa:

    # "Rahim pours 50 gold into your hands."
    "雷希姆把五十枚金币倒进你手里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_918e8085:

    # r "I'll have more work for you later."
    r "我以后还有活给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_d4b2322b:

    # e "Sounds good to me."
    e "听起来不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_2f89398d:

    # r "Mm."
    r "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_b2a5ad0d:

    # "Silence stretches out between the two of you."
    "沉默在你们之间蔓延开来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_c4c5c024:

    # e "Alright. I'll see you later then, I guess."
    e "好吧，那……回头见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_c9f4e14d:

    # "All you get is another grunt."
    "你得到的只有又一声哼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_86edec98:

    # e "Alright, Rahim. I think I'm just about done."
    e "好了，雷希姆。我想我差不多做完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_b186e105:

    # "Rahim looks at you appraisingly."
    "雷希姆打量着你，像是在评估你的作品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_3f49c645:

    # r "Faster than I expected. Give me a moment to look over it."
    r "比我预想的快。给我一点时间检查。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_39713714:

    # "You put the hat in Rahim's hands, who promptly takes it under his lamp for closer inspection."
    "你把软帽交到雷希姆手里，他立刻把它放到灯下仔细检查。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_7b524317:

    # "He turns it this way and that, flipping it repeatedly."
    "他把软帽转来转去，不断翻看各个角度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_63c53e07:

    # r "Okay, you have some extra pieces of material hidden in a couple of spots here. It's a clever solution to an avoidable problem you faced."
    r "嗯，你在几个地方藏了些多余的材料。这是个聪明的办法，用来解决一个本可避免的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_30fcce7e:

    # "Ah. He noticed how you sort of had to trim and tuck some of the cloth and interfacing you made within the folds."
    "啊。他发现你不得不把做好的布料和衬布稍微修剪，再塞进折叠处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_4d3ae806:

    # r "This was almost certainly caused by you failing to align the pattern pieces with the fold when you first started cutting."
    r "这几乎可以肯定是因为你开始裁剪时，没有把裁片和布料折边对齐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_20757017:

    # r "The solution almost makes it seem like you just added some extra interfacing on the edges, but the unevenness of it gives it away."
    r "这样处理后，看起来几乎像是你只在边缘加了些衬布；但不均匀的边缘暴露了真相。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_c90743f6:

    # "That... yeah. He's absolutely right on the sequence of events. He's also right about what he's clearly implying you need to do next time."
    "呃……没错。他完全说中了事情的经过，也说中了他明显在暗示你下次该怎么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_5a949255:

    # r "Of course, this is still higher quality than the person needed - it is far above the craft of an amateur, but far below that of a professional."
    r "当然，这成品仍然比委托人要求的质量高——远在业余手艺之上，却远不及专业水平。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_57ef58b1:

    # "Rahim mutters to himself."
    "雷希姆低声自言自语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_36a792f0:

    # r "...well, any professional worthy of the title."
    r "……至少比不上任何配得上‘专业’这个称号的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_677a3c42:

    # r "You know what to do for next time, yes?"
    r "你知道下次该怎么做了吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_801c8232:

    # r "Good. As long as you learn from your mistakes."
    r "很好。只要你能从错误中吸取教训。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_849fdd40:

    # e "I do my best to."
    e "我会尽力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_51e6ce4a:

    # "A shadow of a grin flickers across Rahim's face."
    "雷希姆脸上掠过一丝笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_ed23cad1:

    # r "A rarity for this town."
    r "这在镇上可不常见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_d0f8c3dc:

    # "He reaches into his belt for your payment."
    "他伸手探入腰带，取出给你的报酬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_4d4187e9:

    # r "Here, for a job well done."
    r "给，干得不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_b22bcfc4:

    # "You receive 50 gold from Rahim."
    "你从雷希姆那里收到五十枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_1052c1c5:

    # e "Thank you, Rahim. It sort of feels like a lot of money to give me for that, but I appreciate it all the same."
    e "谢谢你，雷希姆。给我这么多钱，好像有点多了，但我还是很感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_e6be7679:

    # "Rahim snorts."
    "雷希姆哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_c853a8a9:

    # r "You gathered materials, made it into cloth, and then made the hat. That is worth a lot of money."
    r "你收集材料，把它们织成布，又做成了软帽。这些工作值不少钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_fb4a719c:

    # "He seems to be in a good mood, so I might as well go for a joke."
    "他心情似乎不错，你不妨趁机开个玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_cf7714d4:

    # e "So it wasn't due to the high quality of the craft?"
    e "所以不是因为手艺质量高？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_cc998627:

    # "Rahim laughs, before slapping you on the back."
    "雷希姆笑了起来，然后拍了拍你的后背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_bd5958a4:

    # r "No, [e]. It is pretty good, but not good enough to warrant a price increase."
    r "不，[e]。确实做得不错，但还没好到可以涨价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_3404c853:

    # r "I believe I owe you a story however."
    r "不过，我想我还欠你一个故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_08c92104:

    # e "You do. I was wondering how you even got to start adventuring in the first place?"
    e "你确实欠我一个。我一直想知道，你当初是怎么开始冒险的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_d9da4905:

    # "Rahim looks mildly entertained."
    "雷希姆看起来颇感有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_f9bef42c:

    # r "You had asked for something else the other day."
    r "你前几天问的是另一件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_66a06377:

    # e "Oh. I did?"
    e "哦，我问过吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_b72406c7:

    # r "Yes, but I'll just tell you about how I started, instead."
    r "问过。不过，我还是跟你说说我是怎么开始的吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_f0e6a362:

    # "Once again, Rahim picks a project to work on while he talks to you."
    "雷希姆又挑了件活，一边和你说话一边做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_2c56bd68:

    # "This time it seems to be a half finished scarf?"
    "这次好像是条做到一半的围巾？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_6ee66d5d:

    # r "I grew up in a small town. Smaller than this one."
    r "我在一个小镇长大。比这里还小。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_2cdd87f1:

    # r "My father was the town's tailor - that is to say, as with most tailors in places that small, he was a farmer that knew how to sew moderately well."
    r "我父亲是镇上的裁缝——也就是说，在那种小地方，他和大多数裁缝一样，其实是个略懂缝纫的农民。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_2c27ea5e:

    # e "I assume you learned how to sew from him?"
    e "我猜，你是跟他学会缝纫的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_394aa05a:

    # "A small snort from Rahim."
    "雷希姆轻轻哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_3d8a7f55:

    # r "Something like that. I learned how to repair clothes while I lived with him."
    r "差不多吧。我和他住在一起时，学会了修补衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_f287aa29:

    # r "All of my actual skill as a tailor was gained on my adventures."
    r "我真正的裁缝本领，都是在冒险中学到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_49946ba5:

    # "You nod, remembering that he said something similar last time."
    "你点点头，想起他上次也说过类似的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_1dd18157:

    # e "Yes. Learning as you traveled was what you decided on."
    e "对。你选择的就是边走边学。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_a9c7c7a8:

    # r "Well, back then, I was only 14. I didn't know what my goals were."
    r "那时候我才十四岁，根本不知道自己想要什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_8a29d618:

    # r "There wasn't much to be done about that, because there was nothing for me to look at or aspire to - I was completely isolated in that rinkydink place."
    r "我也没什么办法改变这一点，因为身边没有任何东西值得我观察或憧憬——我完全与世隔绝在那个破落的小地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_ea19a89c:

    # r "That was, until Rayleigh stopped by."
    r "直到雷利路过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_831cb8b9:

    # r "He was an old man, gruff, calloused, and cynical to his core. Much like me today, I suppose."
    r "他是个粗鲁、满手老茧、骨子里透着愤世嫉俗的老人。想来，我现在也差不多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_76bb0f6e:

    # r "He needed a bodyguard - someone young that could protect him from the monsters that roamed the roads."
    r "他需要一名护卫——一个年轻人，能够保护他不受路上游荡的怪物袭击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_c8573086:

    # r "We had nobody like that in town. Right as he was about to give up, I asked if I could join him."
    r "镇上没有这样的人。就在他准备放弃时，我问他能不能让我加入。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_c665cc43:

    # r "One of my greatest regrets is that I never told my father I was going to do that... I hated the man, but no father deserves that."
    r "我最大的遗憾之一，就是没告诉父亲我要走……我恨那个男人，但父亲不该连告别都没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_1fd2e60b:

    # r "...well, at least, he didn't. He was bad, but not truly evil"
    r "……至少，他不该遭到那样的对待。他很糟，但还算不上真正的恶人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_70c2b7b9:

    # r "Regardless, he accepted, saying that he could at least train me into something half-decent due to my young age."
    r "不管怎样，他答应了，说我年纪还小，至少能把我训练成个像样的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_cfd653f2:

    # e "And that's how you started?"
    e "你就是这样开始的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_3b2dfd32:

    # r "Yes, that's how I started. I wasn't truly an adventurer of course, but I had essentially started an apprenticeship."
    r "对，我就是这样开始的。当然，那时我还不算真正的冒险家，但实际上已经开始当学徒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_42262e13:

    # r "I later learned that the old bastard was an ex-adventurer, one that made his money killing and cleaning monsters, taking all of their valuable parts, and making them into things."
    r "后来我才知道，那个老混蛋以前也是冒险家：靠猎杀、处理怪物赚钱，取走它们身上有价值的部位，再把那些东西做成各种物件。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_69afc02e:

    # r "He tried to teach me leatherworking, bonecraft, alchemy... but the only thing that really stuck was tailoring."
    r "他试着教我皮革工艺、骨工艺和炼金术……但真正留下来的只有裁缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_4b8d0113:

    # e "He sounds like a pretty good teacher, but... You sound like you don't remember him fondly?"
    e "听起来他是个相当不错的老师，不过……听你这口气，好像并不怀念他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_5c531953:

    # "Rahim snorts, waving his hand at you."
    "雷希姆哼了一声，朝你挥了挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_5ef30bb6:

    # r "Oh, I remember him fondly enough, considering what he did to me."
    r "哦，考虑到他对我做过什么，我倒也还算怀念他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_62d09e07:

    # r "The man taught me to fight by throwing me at monsters and yelling what I should do."
    r "那人教我打架的方式，就是把我扔到怪物面前，然后大喊我该做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_6f1105e4:

    # r "Do you know how injured I got when he threw me at a full grown wolf with nothing but a dagger the first day?"
    r "你知道第一天他只给我一把匕首，就把我扔到一头成年狼面前时，我伤得有多重吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_3fd25678:

    # "Rahim grimaces slightly, if more out of habit than anything, reaching for a small scar on the back of his shoulder."
    "雷希姆微微皱起眉头，更多是出于习惯。他伸手摸向肩胛骨后方一道小小的疤痕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_2a60c9f0:

    # r "But, I do owe him everything."
    r "不过，我确实把一切都归功于他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_3f8c1db2:

    # r "Without him, I would not have become an adventurer, or a tailor."
    r "没有他，我不会成为冒险家，也不会成为裁缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_d37b400b:

    # r "I would have died in that small town, killed by boredom or something."
    r "我会死在那个小镇上，可能是无聊死的，或者以别的方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_f482b743:

    # e "So all the pain and suffering was worth it?"
    e "所以，那些痛苦和磨难都值得？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_2bed1132:

    # "Rahim goes silent for a bit."
    "雷希姆沉默了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_a3fe7f31:

    # r "For me, yes."
    r "对我来说，值得。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_bca45dfa:

    # r "I was a weak and stupid bull back then. I would be disgusted by myself if I stayed like that for my whole life."
    r "那时我是一头又弱又蠢的公牛。要是我一辈子都那样，我会厌恶自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_5b6e5bb5:

    # e "And me? I'm just starting out, like you... do you think I'm quite that bad?"
    e "那我呢？我才刚起步，和你当年一样……你觉得我也有那么糟吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_5cfd9ee0:

    # "Rahim fixes you with a level glare."
    "雷希姆用平静而锐利的目光盯住你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_a5974dba:

    # r "Sounds like you're fishing for compliments."
    r "听起来你又在套我的夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_cb5cfe69:

    # r "No, you're not that stupid, or weak, but you definitely have your shortcomings."
    r "不，你没那么蠢，也没那么弱，但缺点当然少不了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_351a78a6:

    # r "If you learn, you may grow. The ability to change is all one needs in life."
    r "只要你愿意学习，就能不断成长。人活一世，有能力改变自己就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_e667a3a9:

    # "Rahim's voice betrayed no deep love or care, but... it seems he respects you more than most, if only by a bit."
    "他的声音里没有多少深厚的喜爱或关心，不过……看得出来，他对你的尊重比对大多数人多，哪怕只多一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_672e64c0:

    # "Definitely an improvement over when you first came here."
    "这总比你刚来时好多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_e2f9e609:

    # "You sit in silence as Rahim continues sewing."
    "你一言不发地坐着，雷希姆继续缝着手里的活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_5e2f957c:

    # e "Is that the story?"
    e "这就是故事的全部？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_480f16a9:

    # r "Unless you have any pressing questions, yes."
    r "除非你还有什么非问不可的问题，否则就是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_825f1310:

    # e "Alright, well. Thank you."
    e "好吧，谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_bb1f18da:

    # "You get up to go, heading for the door. As you put your hand on the doorknob, you hear Rahim speak up."
    "你起身往门口走。手刚搭上门把手，就听见雷希姆开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_cb3f4376:

    # r "I may have been a bit rough with you before. Speaking about Rayleigh makes me a bit irritated."
    r "我之前对你可能是严厉了些。提到雷利，总会让我有点烦躁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_092a38cb:

    # "You hear the bull sigh in slight annoyance. When you turn your head, he is looking you in the eyes."
    "你听见公牛略带烦躁地叹了口气。回头时，他正看着你的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_5d18d5c9:

    # r "I think you are doing well [e]. I believe you have a bright future ahead of you, if you continue on this path."
    r "我觉得你做得不错，[e]。只要继续走下去，我相信你的前路会很光明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_b6a207d5:

    # "Just as suddenly as that came out, Rahim has turned back to sewing."
    "话音刚落，雷希姆就转回去继续缝纫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_2092f90d:

    # "What a weird guy."
    "真是个怪人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_06084505:

    # e "...Thanks, Rahim."
    e "……谢谢你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_13cc70a5:

    # "All you get in response is a grunt."
    "你得到的回答只是一声哼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_02_ddf74e74:

    # "With nothing else to say or do, you walk out of the door, and into the streets of Lusterfield."
    "没什么可说、也没什么可做的了，你走出门，来到乐斯民菲尔德的街道上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_36648b62:

    # e "Rahim, I got the mums for you."
    e "雷希姆，我把菊花带来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_fb80da26:

    # "For a moment, you swear you could see a smile on Rahim's face."
    "有那么一瞬间，你发誓自己看见了雷希姆脸上的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_99bd4d8f:

    # "But it disappears quickly."
    "但笑意很快就消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_98355ecf:

    # "Rahim takes the flowers from you."
    "雷希姆从你手里接过花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_affc52c4:

    # r "Thanks."
    r "谢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_97fc134c:

    # "He grunts as he passes you 75 gold."
    "他把75枚金币递给你，低低地哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_06d40729:

    # "He looks at the flowers and his expression dims."
    "他看向那些花，神色黯淡下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_9b95a411:

    # e "Is there anything wrong, Rahim?"
    e "怎么了，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_39fe80c5:

    # "Rahim looks at you with temporary blankness."
    "雷希姆的目光有片刻失焦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_87460fa3:

    # "Then, he snaps back to attention."
    "随后，他回过神来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_4959ac1a:

    # r "No. It's the flowers..."
    r "不，是这些花……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_a5014ba1:

    # e "Did I get the wrong ones? I'm sorry."
    e "我拿错了吗？对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_ee92f869:

    # r "No. They're my daughter's favorite flowers."
    r "不。这是我女儿最喜欢的花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_6da134d3:

    # r "Today is her death anniversary."
    r "今天是她的忌日。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_b481cc8e:

    # "Rahim's tough shell breaks a little."
    "雷希姆坚硬的外壳裂开了一道缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_1a2f681d:

    # r "That's why I sent you to get these."
    r "所以我才让你去取这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_6f54ccdd:

    # r "I'll bring them to her later. She'll love these."
    r "我晚些时候会把它们带给她。她一定会喜欢的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_cdbff688:

    # e "I'm sorry."
    e "抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_4489ad32:

    # r "Why should you be?"
    r "你为什么要道歉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_fe6e9d1c:

    # "Rahim's grip on the flowers tightened."
    "雷希姆攥紧了花茎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_dcaa5e6a:

    # r "You're not the reason why she's not with us anymore."
    r "她已经不在我们身边，并不是你的错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_7de53890:

    # "Rage radiates off Rahim."
    "怒意从雷希姆身上迸发出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_a202f14b:

    # "He's about to break the chrysanthemums you've picked."
    "他几乎要把你采来的菊花捏碎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_83bd329d:

    # "Looking at the mums, Rahim slowly calms down."
    "看着手里的菊花，雷希姆渐渐平静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_eabe296c:

    # r "I'm not sure how are you getting on with the goats but remember this."
    r "我不知道你和山羊相处得怎么样，但记住这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_35ee51db:

    # r "They've slaughtered some of us mercilessly."
    r "他们无情地屠杀了我们的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_e4634e29:

    # "You get closer to Rahim and put your hand on his palm, and he looks away."
    "你走近雷希姆，把手放在他的掌心上；他却移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_e5a9282e:

    # "You decide to stay silent for the moment."
    "你决定暂时保持沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_29bb1e42:

    # "For a few minutes, both of you didn't move. Only a brief whistling of the wind can be heard through the shop."
    "几分钟里，你们谁也没有动。店里只能听见风短暂的呜咽声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_d3962269:

    # "You stares at Rahim, he is still holding onto the chrysanthemums tightly, and holding back the tear from his eyes."
    "你注视着雷希姆。他仍紧紧攥着菊花，强忍着眼泪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_8d94f27a:

    # "Rahim sniffs and looks back at you."
    "雷希姆吸了吸鼻子，回头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_3ca02f1b:

    # r "I can't move on."
    r "我没法释怀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_abf8003d:

    # "The bull flings your hand away, and resume to his work with the clothes."
    "这头公牛甩开你的手，重新埋头处理衣物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_17e41370:

    # "You stares at the working bull. He is already back at focusing on the thin threads."
    "你看着正在工作的公牛。他已经重新专注于那些细线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_9a0fff0f:

    # "And the chrysanthemums were left on the table."
    "菊花被留在了桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_7057d5df:

    # "His response left you disappointed... but when you stare at his eyes. You noticed that something has changed."
    "他的反应让你失望……可当你盯着他的眼睛时，却发现有些东西变了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_4431e162:

    # "Maybe it's the anger inside him, maybe it's the grieve and regret."
    "也许是他心中的怒火，也许是悲伤与悔恨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Finish_10a8fe8e:

    # "You can't decide if it's for the better or worse, but there's a sliver of hope you still hold onto for him."
    "你无法判断这究竟是好是坏，但你仍抓住了那一线希望，希望他有一天能走出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_05b47ee5:

    # e "Hey, Rahim, is there anything you need?"
    e "嘿，雷希姆，有什么需要我帮忙的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_d95be2f8:

    # r "I hear that you're getting chummy with the goats."
    r "我听说你跟山羊混得挺熟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_e3ad01fd:

    # "Rahim levels you with a disapproving gaze."
    "雷希姆不赞成地打量着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_d92536ca:

    # "You feel cowed."
    "你被他看得有些发怵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_d899524e:

    # e "Erm... Not technically... It's more like they tolerate my presence as a courier."
    e "呃……严格来说不算……更像是它们容忍我这个快递员待在附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_c72361db:

    # "Rahim nods pensively. After some time, he continues."
    "雷希姆若有所思地点点头。过了一会儿，他才继续说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_01a4897e:

    # r "Lusterfield was once close to the goats too... And see where it got us."
    r "乐斯民菲尔德以前也和山羊们走得很近……看看这给我们带来了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_67b55f38:

    # "There is a hint of melancholy and sadness in Rahim's voice."
    "雷希姆的声音里带着一丝忧郁与悲伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_2b8ba18a:

    # "You do not know how to respond. Thankfully, Rahim picks up the thread of conversation."
    "你不知道该如何回应。好在雷希姆接着把话题说了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_6215179c:

    # r "Look behind your back when you're around them."
    r "和它们待在一起时，记得多留意身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_cdf44713:

    # e "I don't think they..."
    e "我不觉得它们……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_71365e1b:

    # r "You were not here."
    r "你当时又不在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_ea847213:

    # "Rahim huffs."
    "雷希姆哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_80398a9b:

    # r "That's beside the point. Sorry for being emotional. I need something from you."
    r "这不是重点。抱歉，我有些失态。我需要你帮我办件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_7be17a49:

    # "You're glad for the topic change. You had a feeling Rahim was close to exploding earlier."
    "你庆幸话题换了。刚才你总觉得雷希姆差点就要爆发了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_73a84d3c:

    # e "What do you need, Rahim?"
    e "你需要我做什么，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_62fdea28:

    # r "I need you to go to the outpost near the goat tribe to collect 4 bunches of chrysanthemum for me."
    r "我要你去山羊部落附近的前哨，替我采四束菊花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_d14f4c16:

    # "You are confused."
    "你有点不明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_b04176e4:

    # e "Chrysanthemum? Why?"
    e "菊花？为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_ed339701:

    # e "Sounds like I've heard it somewhere..."
    e "听起来我好像在哪儿听过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_a786fcb9:

    # r "I need it for a garment."
    r "我做一件衣服要用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_37987627:

    # "Rahim grunts but you have a feeling there's more to this."
    "雷希姆哼了一声，但你觉得事情没这么简单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_c17b6df7:

    # e "But aren't there flowers around Lusterfield?"
    e "可乐斯民菲尔德周围不是也有花吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_ac5119fb:

    # r "This one only grows near the goats."
    r "这种花只长在山羊附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_dd526913:

    # r "I'm not sending any other Lusterfolks to go there lest I put them in danger. So you're the perfect candidate."
    r "我不能派其他乐斯民菲尔德人去，免得把他们置于危险之中。所以你正合适。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_4cb5765c:

    # e "Okay..."
    e "好的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Flower_Quest_Begin_102a403a:

    # r "If you run into any goats, just tell them you're foraging. Now, get going."
    r "要是遇到山羊，就告诉它们你是在采集食物。现在，出发吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_d86303de:

    # e "Hey, Rahim... Would you want to talk more about... the letter?"
    e "嘿,雷希姆,你想多谈谈那封信吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_3529882b:

    # r "I'm busy."
    r "我在忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_54370264:

    # e "Uh... How about... Goat Tribe in general?"
    e "呃……那我可以问问山羊部落……是块什么地方呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_608cae93:

    # r "Look, boy. You need to stop snooping in other people's business-"
    r "听着 孩子 你不能再偷窥别人的生意了"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_a4cd3272:

    # r "I said no. Then it's a no. Got me?"
    r "我说不，就是不。懂了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_fa16d833:

    # e "Ok, Rahim. You don't need to be... this grumpy."
    e "好了 雷希姆 你不必这么暴躁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_5608cfc4:

    # r "You want to get into my nerves or what?"
    r "你是故意来气我还是怎的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_989e289d:

    # r "...Just leave the village be, life is simpler this way."
    r "……就让一切保持原样，让日子保持简单不好吗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_fd375905:

    # e "...A-alright, I guess... I'm sorry to bother you, Rahim."
    e "抱歉打扰你 雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_30b685c9:

    # r "You just don't understand... You all..."
    r "你只是什么都不懂……你们都是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_580dca45:

    # r "Cherish the peace you have now."
    r "现在的和平来之不易，好好珍惜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Opinion_Goat_Tribe_aa0c7cb0:

    # e "I understand."
    e "我会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_4931f5c5:

    # e "So, Rahim...?"
    e "那么，雷希姆……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_8c837d57:

    # r "Yes, [e]?"
    r "是的，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_5f640d5b:

    # e "I know you are always busy, so... I was wondering if you had anything I could help with?"
    e "我知道你总是很忙，所以……我想问问有没有什么我能帮上忙的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_a13324a4:

    # e "I don't know... making some orders for you or something?"
    e "比如……替你做些订单之类的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_1249fc01:

    # "Rahim snorts, a gruff sound somewhere between derision and appreciation."
    "雷希姆嗤笑了一声，声音介于嘲弄与欣赏之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_662f28fd:

    # r "I appreciate the thought, [e], but as if I could trust you with making the clothes my business produces."
    r "你的心意我领了，[e]，但你觉得我会把店里的衣服交给你来做吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_ab2f05c7:

    # r "People see me as the best tailor for miles and miles around, and they expect that quality when they order from me."
    r "大家都把我当成方圆数里最好的裁缝，向我下单时自然期待同样的品质。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_f8849295:

    # e "...Well, I still want to help. Maybe I can't deal with the high profile clients, but..."
    e "……不过我还是想帮忙。也许那些重要的客户我应付不来，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_d2b283d4:

    # e "Maybe some of the more mundane orders?"
    e "有没有更普通一点的订单？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_6b62432b:

    # "Rahim takes a moment to think about your proposition."
    "雷希姆花了一会儿思考你的提议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_00878a65:

    # r "I've seen you make a few things in here before."
    r "我见过你在这里做过几样东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_f5ccee21:

    # r "They were of acceptable quality, so I will let you complete some of my orders."
    r "质量还算过得去，所以我可以让你接手几件订单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_b275d515:

    # "Rahim suddenly looks at you with cutting intensity, as if staring into your soul."
    "雷希姆突然目光锐利地看着你，仿佛要看穿你的灵魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_04669fb6:

    # r "If I see you try anything funny, however, you will not be welcome back in this shop."
    r "不过要是让我发现你耍什么花招，你以后就别想再进这家店。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_4da23814:

    # e "Hehe, well... I want to think you can trust me not to betray you like that."
    e "我希望你能相信我不会那样背叛你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_8e02631b:

    # "Rahim sighs."
    "雷希姆叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_3e20c604:

    # r "Maybe, but it was worth saying anyways."
    r "也许吧，不过这话还是得先说在前头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_f0afbd2b:

    # e "I understand. Courier, adventurer, or tailor, you have to be careful about who you trust."
    e "我明白。无论是信使、冒险家还是裁缝，你都得小心该信任谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_693258c8:

    # "The bull looks at you flatly."
    "公牛平淡地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_f250ba86:

    # r "Trust may not be as critical as back when I was out adventuring, where trusting the wrong person could end with you bleeding out in the middle of the woods with no coin purse..."
    r "这当然比不上我四处冒险时那么要紧；那时候信错了人，可能就会倒在林子中央，身上没有钱袋……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_e6d654b3:

    # "You are suddenly aware of how tightly Rahim is gripping the scissors in his hands."
    "你突然注意到雷希姆手里的剪刀被他攥得有多紧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_8a16d1b4:

    # r "It is still important here."
    r "但在这里，同样重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_7333c788:

    # "You gulp. There has to be some way to change the subject away from the possibility of you betraying him."
    "你咽了口唾沫。得想办法把话题从你可能背叛他的事上岔开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_04a516e8:

    # e "I remember you told me a bit about having traveled."
    e "我记得你以前提过自己四处旅行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_ae10b27e:

    # e "Could you tell me a bit about your adventures?"
    e "能不能给我讲讲你的冒险？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_18304dc8:

    # "Rahim's ear flicks, seemingly flummoxed by your question."
    "雷希姆的耳朵抽动了一下，似乎被你的问题问得不知所措。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_635d28d2:

    # r "...I have not spoken about them in quite some time, but..."
    r "……我已经很久没提起那些事了，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_7f5c168c:

    # r "If you do a good job with the clothing, then perhaps."
    r "如果你把这件衣服做得好，也许可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_1a07eb6c:

    # e "I'm interested in what such a big, strong bull got up to in his youth."
    e "我只是好奇，像你这样高大强壮的公牛年轻时都做过什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_8e4037b5:

    # "Rahim gives you an irritated glare."
    "雷希姆恼火地瞪了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_7f45f885:

    # "It seems he did not like what you were implying there."
    "看来他不喜欢你话里的暗示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_f96feb42:

    # r "I am going to act like I didn't hear that."
    r "我就当没听见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_a61eb6fa:

    # "That's probably for the best."
    "这大概是最好的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_f155289f:

    # r "I need you to make [clothing]."
    r "我要你做[clothing]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_1efbb94f:

    # r "It's a rather simple recipe, requiring only... some yarns, and pelts... and others."
    r "配方并不复杂，只需要……一些毛线、兽皮……以及其他材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_03637ce7:

    # r "If you need to remember what you need at any point, I wrote the task and recipe down for you."
    r "如果你中途忘了需要什么，我已经把任务和配方写下来给你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_5233c6c1:

    # e "Okay. Thank you, Rahim!"
    e "好的。谢谢你，雷希姆！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_a128f7cc:

    # r "No need to thank me. I am just making sure I get what I asked for."
    r "不用谢我。我只是要确保你交付的是我要求的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_d220d4a2:

    # r "I'll make sure you get a cut of the sale should it be of good quality."
    r "如果质量过关，我会给你分成。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_277465d6:

    # e "Sounds good to me. I'll get on it now!"
    e "听起来不错。我这就去做！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_230cafff:

    # r "Good. This isn't an emergency commission, but get it done as soon as you can."
    r "很好。这不是急单，但你尽快完成。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_1e9dce35:

    # r "Speak to me again when you've made the product."
    r "做好之后再来找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Yarn_Quest_01_800bf914:

    # "And with that, Rahim returned to his work, signaling the end of the conversation."
    "说完，雷希姆重新投入工作，表示谈话结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_c3275745:

    # e "Rahim, I finished the [clothing]!"
    e "雷希姆，我完成了[clothing]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_039c3f3b:

    # "Rahim says nothing. He just looks straight into your eyes from his seat, and stares at you."
    "雷希姆什么也没说，只是坐在座位上直直看进你的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_1dbba092:

    # e "Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_83b1b38c:

    # "Rahim's glare only grows harsher in response to your attempt to call out to him."
    "你试着叫他，他的目光却变得更加严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_6e275b70:

    # e "I guess I should come back when it's all properly done?"
    e "看来我应该等它彻底做好了再回来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_c91ad6c3:

    # r "Yes. Do not try to lie to me again. It reflects poorly upon my decision to trust you."
    r "是。别再试图骗我了。这只会让我觉得自己信错了人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_4b8229d1:

    # "Rahim continues to stare into your soul."
    "雷希姆继续凝视着你的灵魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_de2a3c2f:

    # "You take this as a sign that you should leave now."
    "你把这当成了现在该离开的信号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_6d0b80be:

    # e "Hello Rahim! I have finished with the [clothing]!"
    e "你好，雷希姆！[clothing]已经做好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b186e105:

    # "Rahim looks at you appraisingly."
    "雷希姆审视着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e4b9f0a1:

    # r "I saw you working on it here, but it is good to see it finished so soon."
    r "我看见你之前在这里做它，不过这么快就完成，还是让我很满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e465624d:

    # r "Please, hand it here so I may review your work."
    r "拿过来吧，让我检查一下你的手艺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_5f186f7a:

    # "You hand Rahim the [clothing]."
    "你把[clothing]递给雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_fbb75c80:

    # r "Hrmm... This is mostly good, but you left a few loose ends in these two spots."
    r "嗯……大体上不错，但这两个地方留下了几处线头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_bc90054b:

    # "Rahim points at a couple loose seams that you seem not to have noticed."
    "雷希姆指向几处你似乎没有注意到的松散接缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_1c88e7e2:

    # e "I'm so sorry! I can fix it at once if you need!"
    e "真的很抱歉！如果你需要，我马上就能修好！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_900f6b33:

    # "Rahim motions for you to calm down."
    "雷希姆示意你冷静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_102777c0:

    # r "It's okay. This would be difficult for you to fix regardless."
    r "没事。反正这对你来说也很难修好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b99bd058:

    # r "Here, have this, for working diligently."
    r "来，拿着这个，算是你认真工作的报酬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_6da98524:

    # "Rahim reaches into his pouch, and drops 50 gold in your hand."
    "雷希姆把手伸进袋子，往你手里放了50枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_46ed76fd:

    # r "If you wish to stay, I can teach you how to avoid this next time, and tell you that story you asked for." nointeract
    r "如果你愿意留下来，我可以教你下次如何避免这种问题，也可以讲讲你之前问起的那个故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e55965f1:

    # e "I would love to!"
    e "我当然愿意！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_9ad8500f:

    # e "As I said before, I want to hear all about what a-"
    e "就像我之前说的，我想听听像你这样一位——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e4bf9f2f:

    # "Rahim cuts you off with a look."
    "雷希姆看了你一眼，打断了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_638ebee5:

    # "However, you can see he's doing his best to keep a straight face, clearly entertained by your unabashed attempts at flirting with him."
    "不过你看得出来，他正努力绷住脸；你毫不掩饰的调情显然让他觉得有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_4cbafc70:

    # e "W-what I was going to say was, what an exemplary figure like yourself did when he was younger!"
    e "我、我本来想说的是，像你这样出色的人年轻时都做过什么！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_12cf1f4a:

    # "Rahim's look shifts into one of amused skepticism."
    "雷希姆的神情变成了带着几分戏谑的怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_817db696:

    # r "Mm. Well. You will hear all about them in a second."
    r "嗯，好吧。你马上就会听到那些故事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_caaf3fc6:

    # r "First we need to talk about how to avoid making loose ends in clothes you tailor. I expect you to do better next time."
    r "不过首先，我们得谈谈怎样避免在你做的衣服上留下线头。我希望你下次做得更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_64d6dfba:

    # r "To be clear, you did better than I expected. This is fairly passable."
    r "先说清楚，你做得比我预想的好。这件东西算是合格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_86a3dbe6:

    # "He says this not unkindly. Knowing Rahim, this is most likely high praise."
    "他说这话并没有恶意。了解雷希姆的人都知道，这很可能已经是极高的赞扬了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_24cc9853:

    # r "Here, look."
    r "来，看这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b5237610:

    # "Rahim reaches over to the [clothing], smooths it out, and brings the faulty stitches under the brightest spot on his desk."
    "雷希姆伸手拿过[clothing]，把它抚平，又把有问题的针脚移到桌面上最亮的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_4e2eb8a2:

    # r "These might seem like small mistakes, but over time..."
    r "这些看起来也许只是小问题，但时间一长……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_3fc71d11:

    # "He pulls on one of the loose strings, and you see how your work begins to unravel."
    "他拉了拉其中一根松线，你便看见自己的作品开始散开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_a2c4b8f7:

    # r "It compromises the piece's structural integrity."
    r "这会损害这件作品的结构完整性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_a466f874:

    # e "Piece?"
    e "作品？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b4264bbb:

    # r "Yes, piece. Every single item I tailor has its unique requirements and touches, so calling them by their eventual purpose is inaccurate considering their deviations."
    r "对，作品。我的每一件裁缝作品都有独特的要求和细节；考虑到它们各自的差异，直接用最终用途称呼它们并不准确。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e6da8883:

    # "Rahim said this with an entirely straight face, but as he turns back to the [clothing] you see a faint glimmer of pride in his eyes."
    "雷希姆说这话时面无表情，但他转身重新看向[clothing]时，你看见他眼中闪过一丝自豪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_c33bfb7f:

    # r "Regardless, to avoid this, one must make sure to plan out each individual stitch as they go along."
    r "总之，为了避免这种情况，缝到哪里就要提前规划好每一针。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_d3b6e10e:

    # r "Failing to do so may lead to slanted lines, poorly anchored or uneven stitches, or loose ends."
    r "否则就可能出现歪斜的线条、固定不牢或参差不齐的针脚，甚至留下线头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b53f0c26:

    # "It is interesting to watch Rahim as he talks about this."
    "看着雷希姆谈论这些事情很有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_971a6c12:

    # "His normally reserved nature fades like a fall breeze, bringing with it his true personality."
    "他平日里克制的性情像秋风一样淡去，随之显露出真正的他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_dd87d387:

    # "A diligent, passionate, and proud bull, unerringly attentive to what is important to him."
    "一个勤奋、热情而自豪的公牛，始终专注于真正重要的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_df983eca:

    # r "To summarize everything I've said, just remember to cut and knot loose ends, and measure precisely."
    r "总结一下我刚才说的：记得剪掉并打好线结，尺寸也要量准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_3b1ff72e:

    # "Oh god, you stopped paying attention to what he was saying."
    "糟了，你已经完全没在听他讲了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_694ad8db:

    # e "Got it! I'm going to make sure to do that next time I tailor something!"
    e "明白！下次我做衣服时一定会记住！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_34185d01:

    # "Rahim fixes you with a knowing look."
    "雷希姆意味深长地看了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_ea31ca43:

    # r "I know you missed half of that, going by how your eyes glazed over partway through."
    r "看你听到一半就眼神放空了，我知道你其实漏掉了一半。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_016c85b0:

    # e "I'm sorry Ra-"
    e "对不起，雷——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_6646fe11:

    # r "It's okay."
    r "没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_9e957295:

    # "Rahim chuckles a bit and smacks you lightly on the shoulder."
    "雷希姆轻笑了一声，轻轻拍了拍你的肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_a8c0dfb3:

    # r "You'll get the lessons drilled into you the next few times we have this talk."
    r "接下来几次谈话，我会把这些要点反复讲到你记住为止。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_928fff47:

    # "Wait... what?"
    "等等……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_ae3e3dbb:

    # e "N-next time?"
    e "下、下次？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_6a6863a3:

    # r "Oh. Yes. We had not agreed on that. I had just assumed, apologies..."
    r "哦。对，我们并没有约定这件事。我只是自作主张了，抱歉……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_63c1fa00:

    # "Rahim trails off, looking for the right words. He seems a bit embarrassed."
    "雷希姆说到一半停了下来，似乎在寻找合适的措辞。他看起来有些尴尬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_9869af00:

    # r "You were right that it was useful to have a helping hand to reduce my workload a bit."
    r "你说得对，有个人搭把手来减轻我的工作量，确实有用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_0617e560:

    # r "And... I don't mind teaching you. Not like there's anybody else in town who wants to learn."
    r "而且……我不介意教你。镇上可没有别人想学。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_d6dcd309:

    # r "Point is, I will be offering more tasks like this in the future if you are willing to take them."
    r "总之，只要你愿意接，我以后会再给你安排更多这样的任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_cb13d719:

    # "Well, it's good to know that, at least."
    "至少，知道这一点还是不错的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_82e87d57:

    # r "Regardless. I owe you a story, and it's about time I got to it."
    r "不管怎么说，我欠你一个故事，也该讲给你听了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_7e73dc11:

    # "Despite saying this, Rahim has only slightly turned your way, pulling out a new piece to work on."
    "尽管这么说，雷希姆也只是稍微侧过身来，拿出一件新作品继续工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_ebe78754:

    # "It seems like he will work while explaining this to you. Perhaps it helps him think?"
    "看起来他打算一边工作一边给你讲。也许这样更容易思考？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b2080dc6:

    # r "Many years ago, I couldn't tell you precisely how many, one of my adventures took me to the."
    r "很多年前——具体是哪一年我也说不清——我的一次冒险把我带到了首都。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_2beef3e1:

    # "Rahim pauses."
    "雷希姆停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_07368d67:

    # r "You have never been to the capital, correct, [e]?"
    r "你从来没去过首都，对吧，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_8ca7e3f0:

    # "Surprised to be called on, you jump a little bit in your chair."
    "突然被点名，你在椅子上微微一跳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_7e4cd9cc:

    # e "N-no. I've never been! What's it like?"
    e "不、不会。我从来没去过！那里是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e792dc53:

    # "Rahim hums to himself in thought, continuing his tailoring work all the while."
    "雷希姆一边思索，一边继续手头的裁缝活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_ebec3137:

    # r "It's a place of many faces."
    r "那是一个千面之地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_d576f22a:

    # r "Some streets are grand, towering marble structures laced with runework on every side..."
    r "有些街道宏伟壮丽，两侧尽是高耸的大理石建筑，墙面布满符文……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_c524f1d1:

    # r "Others are... squalid. The scent of death and sewage in the air, slimes living just beneath the surface, roaming out and eating what has been left out at night."
    r "另一些则……肮脏不堪。空气中弥漫着死亡和污水的气味，黏液怪生活在地表下，夜里爬出来，吞食留在外面的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_980f0094:

    # "Rahim snorts gently, pulling his needle up through the fabric."
    "雷希姆轻轻嗤了一声，把针从布料中抽出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_2d372ff9:

    # r "Quite."
    r "确实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_63527118:

    # r "Awe-inspiring the capital might be, but it is not kind to all of its people."
    r "首都或许令人惊叹，却并不善待那里的每一个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_492f6e46:

    # r "I hope Lusterfield never becomes like that."
    r "我希望乐斯民菲尔德永远不要变成那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_5316e387:

    # r "It should be a place to welcome anyone with open arms, a warm plate of food, and a bed to sleep in at night."
    r "它应该张开双臂欢迎任何人，给他们一盘热饭，再提供一张夜里睡觉的床。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_2ad3ac28:

    # "Sure, unless they're a goat."
    "当然，如果对方是山羊就另说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_0b514790:

    # "But you leave that one to yourself."
    "不过你没把这句话说出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_a43dcee9:

    # e "I still remember what everyone did for me when I first arrived."
    e "我至今还记得刚来的时候，大家为我做过什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_5f2c5f61:

    # e "...I'm thankful for it to this day."
    e "……直到今天，我仍然心怀感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_232d8c59:

    # "Rahim lets out a satisfied rumble."
    "雷希姆发出一声满足的低沉咕哝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_0ae25b6e:

    # r "And look how you have paid us back for it so far."
    r "看看你到现在为止是怎么回报我们的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_f7053111:

    # r "Regardless, I digress."
    r "不说这个了，我扯远了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_504c13c1:

    # r "My trip to the capital was not one done on purpose."
    r "我去首都并不是有意为之。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_8856242e:

    # r "I spent most of my early adventuring days wandering aimlessly, helping people however I could, wherever I went."
    r "我早年冒险时，大多漫无目的地四处游荡，走到哪里就尽力帮助那里的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_9745a2e6:

    # e "Sounds pretty noble to me."
    e "听起来挺高尚的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e6be7679:

    # "Rahim snorts."
    "雷希姆嗤笑一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_89366e5e:

    # r "Sure. Something like that."
    r "算是吧。差不多就是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_ec048094:

    # r "I think I was more interested in the food it got in my belly at the time."
    r "我想那时候我更在意的是，旅途能给肚子里添什么吃的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_e2e499e4:

    # r "As I was saying. Didn't get there on purpose."
    r "总之，我不是专程去首都的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_ea1accdb:

    # r "I went over as the guard for a caravan I'd found under attack by giant spiders."
    r "我当时替一支商队护卫；我发现他们时，他们正遭到巨型蜘蛛袭击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_73ff0a02:

    # "Rahim flicks one eye your way."
    "雷希姆朝你这边瞥了一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_8af1d106:

    # r "If you ever encounter them, aim for the joint connecting their head and body plates."
    r "如果你遇到它们，瞄准连接头部和躯干甲片的关节。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_4f2f5405:

    # r "I didn't know that at the time, so I stabbed one in the back, and got sprayed with an... unfortunate amount of acid."
    r "那时我不知道，所以一刀捅进了其中一只的背部，结果被喷了一身……多得令人遗憾的酸液。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_ba423bce:

    # r "Needless to say, I needed new clothes by the end of it."
    r "不用说，那之后我需要一套新衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_52a78cfe:

    # "You try imagining a younger Rahim covered in sweat from killing several giant monsters, clothes riddled with holes... things peeking out..."
    "你试着想象年轻时的雷希姆：杀了好几只巨兽后满身是汗，衣服上全是破洞……里面的东西都快露出来了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_66127527:

    # "Your head hits the table somewhat hard as Rahim smacks you upside the head."
    "雷希姆朝你脑袋上拍了一下，你的头重重撞在桌面上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_c39802fb:

    # r "That wasn't why I mentioned that."
    r "我提这件事不是为了那个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_d4b24455:

    # "If you didn't know better, you'd think the big guy was snickering. You're not though. Your head hurts."
    "要不是你的头还在疼，你可能会以为那大家伙在偷笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_052e47e3:

    # r "Point is, I had to get myself some new clothes before I got to the capital, and... all I had was some dyes and spiderwebs left by the giant bastards."
    r "重点是，我得在抵达首都前弄一套新衣服，而手头只剩下那些巨型混账蜘蛛留下的染料和蛛网。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_0b7880a8:

    # e "I take it you already knew how to sew by that point?"
    e "我猜那时候你已经会缝纫了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_d742dbd6:

    # r "Somewhat. I got better later, but by that point I'd learned some of the more important tricks of the trade."
    r "会一点。后来我越做越好，不过那时我已经学会了这门手艺中更重要的一些诀窍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_926b9e1d:

    # r "When I arrived at the capital, I had a full spiderweb-silk suit, dyed black and light green, a pattern stolen from the spiders themselves."
    r "到首都时，我穿着一整套蛛丝衣服，染成黑色和浅绿色，图案还是从蜘蛛本身那里借来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b0c16437:

    # r "All of this to say that I made quite the splash when I got there."
    r "总之，我一到那里就引起了不小的轰动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_dd225d6c:

    # r "People really liked the look, and I started to get commission after commission, until finally, I was given one by the king himself."
    r "人们很喜欢那身打扮，我开始一个接一个地接到委托，最后甚至接到了国王亲自下的单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_dbc5b504:

    # r "It would be many years before I would become his personal tailor, but..."
    r "过了很多年，我才成为他的私人裁缝，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_6c2ec628:

    # r "That success is what gave me the gold to truly go wherever I wanted, and set me on the path of becoming a tailor in addition to an adventurer."
    r "正是那次成功让我赚到了足够的金子，终于可以去任何想去的地方，也让我走上了裁缝兼冒险家的道路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_4fa0d6fa:

    # e "...but you would still go on adventures despite being a tailor?"
    e "……可你成了裁缝之后还会继续冒险？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_f2ce4d1c:

    # "While you were listening, Rahim got most of the way through the clothing he was making."
    "你听着的时候，雷希姆已经把手里的衣服做得差不多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_873191d5:

    # "It is a pale white dress shirt with bright green accents on the shoulders and hems."
    "那是一件浅白色的正装衬衫，肩膀和衣摆处点缀着鲜亮的绿色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_a5d7689d:

    # r "Yes. I originally traveled just to see the world, but..."
    r "是。我最初只是为了看看世界才四处旅行，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_7be506e9:

    # r "After that I began to stay at every place I visited for a short while, and learn from that place's tailor."
    r "后来，我开始在每个到访的地方短暂停留，向当地的裁缝学习。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_5b5ad12a:

    # r "Learning from all of those different people is what really let me blossom into the tailor I am today."
    r "正是从那些形形色色的人身上学到的东西，真正让我成长为今天的裁缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_9fed90a4:

    # r "But those are stories for another time."
    r "不过，这些故事以后再讲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_d680b710:

    # "You cock an eyebrow."
    "你挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_0ae5f4d4:

    # e "I take it next time is the next few times I help you with the clothes?"
    e "我说的下次，是指接下来每次帮你做衣服吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_06c76c27:

    # r "Mm. We made a deal, so if you wish to continue it, I do not mind sharing more."
    r "嗯。我们已经达成约定了；只要你愿意继续，我不介意再多讲一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_7b3ae1e0:

    # r "Not sure if that was what you wanted, but. There's the story."
    r "不知道这是不是你想听的，不过……故事讲完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_32f0b82b:

    # e "...No, that was nice to listen to."
    e "……不，听着很有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_2f89398d:

    # r "Mm."
    r "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_64b7a2d3:

    # r "Well, that's all I have to say for now."
    r "好了，我暂时就说这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_b2cef26e:

    # "He is making it pretty clear that it's time to leave now."
    "他已经把意思表达得很明白了：现在该走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_f65c6df8:

    # e "Well, I'm happy to hear more next time, if you're willing."
    e "如果你愿意，我很乐意下次再听你讲更多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_2f89398d_1:

    # r "Mm."
    r "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_5c916043:

    # r "Next time."
    r "下次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_874cda90:

    # "Taking the hint, you step outside."
    "明白他的意思后，你走出了店门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_4a6e287a:

    # e "I have other things to do. Plus, I am a courier, and not a tailor."
    e "我还有别的事要做。而且，我是信使，不是裁缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_3b035d5a:

    # e "Thank you for the offer, however!"
    e "不过还是谢谢你的好意！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_8badcd86:

    # "Rahim grunts, and shoos you with his hand, already picking over the strands with a needle."
    "雷希姆哼了一声，用手把你赶走；他已经拿起针，重新挑拣起那些线头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_4915c6ed:

    # r "Well, off with you then. If you are busy, you should get to that."
    r "那你就走吧。既然忙，就去忙你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Report_Yarn_Quest_01_2f925843:

    # "There's no reason for you to stick around here, so... you leave."
    "你没理由继续留在这里，所以……你离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_a6c14195:

    # e "Hello, Rahim. I've gotten a letter from Furkan."
    e "你好，雷希姆。我收到弗坎寄来的一封信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_19fcb7b1:

    # r "What?"
    r "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_4c902b16:

    # e "Uhh... A letter from Furkan from the Goat Tribe."
    e "呃……是山羊部落的弗坎寄来的信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_970b96ef:

    # r "Why?"
    r "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_ec3fa201:

    # e "He wanted to propose a Truce. For Lusterfield and the Goat Tribe."
    e "他想提议休战，让乐斯民菲尔德和山羊部落停战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_8d51c077:

    # r "Let me see the letter."
    r "把信给我看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_8615e6a6:

    # "You hand the letter to Rahim, he yanks it away immediately, you have never seen him being this urged. He put on his reading glasses and begin skimming through the letter."
    "你把信递给雷希姆。他一把夺了过去；你从没见过他这么急切。他戴上眼镜，飞快地扫读起信上的内容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_1931fce9:

    # r "'Deer-... Dear Rahim, I am writing this letter to express my sorrow and regret over the past few years. I...'"
    r "‘亲爱的——……亲爱的雷希姆，我写这封信，是想为过去几年的种种表达我的悲痛与悔恨。我……’"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_0b6964bf:

    # r "'...You could never feel how sorry I am for the battle and I wish if time could go back...'"
    r "‘……你永远无法体会，我对那场战斗有多么抱歉。我多希望时间能够倒流……’"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_dfe07764:

    # r "'...A sign of peace, let us negotiate in person, we will negotiate in the old place where my father...'"
    r "‘……这是和平的象征。让我们当面谈谈吧；我们会在我父亲……的旧地方进行谈判……’"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_b618baf3:

    # r "'...Yours...Furkan...'"
    r "‘……你的……弗坎……’"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_dd6e0d2e:

    # "You cannot tell if Rahim is holding back his tear, or anger, or frustration. He simply put the paper back in the envelope as soon as he finishes reading."
    "你说不清雷希姆是在强忍眼泪、怒火，还是沮丧。他读完信后，立刻把纸张塞回信封。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_a4d18fc8:

    # r "Duly Noted."
    r "我知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_418d1d36:

    # e "Hmm... Are you sure... Rahim? I thought he was writing the letter as a sign of peace. I think we shou-"
    e "嗯……你确定吗，雷希姆？我以为他写这封信是为了表示和平。我觉得我们应该——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_3b7a9069:

    # r "I'm sorry but I don't recall needing your opinion. He wrote the letter to me, I'm saying no."
    r "抱歉，但我不记得自己需要你的意见。他是写信给我的，我的回答是不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_668ee95f:

    # e "...Ok. Rahim. Can you at least tell me what's going on."
    e "……好吧，雷希姆。你至少能告诉我发生了什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_50b0d466:

    # r "I'll tell you when the time comes."
    r "时机到了我自然会告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_f7ec1b0d:

    # e "... Alright. I'll let him know."
    e "……好吧。我会告诉他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_bb5a6b61:

    # r "Ahem... I'm sorry about my attitude. There's just a lot of stuff you don't understand yet. I don't want to involve my village in another conflicts."
    r "咳……我的态度不好，抱歉。还有很多事你还不明白。我不想让我的村子再卷入另一场冲突。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_93dc9dfe:

    # e "I understand. Take care, Rahim."
    e "我明白。保重，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Letter_Furkan_6a131a86:

    # r "You are good."
    r "你是个好孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_05d05f0a:

    # e "Rahim, did Ole talk to you about my training?"
    e "雷希姆，奥利跟你谈过我的训练吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_f172ad38:

    # r "Yes...?"
    r "谈过……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_83e7e8da:

    # e "Can I get a training from you?"
    e "我能请你教教我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_a3984083:

    # r "Okay. I'll keep it simple and quick."
    r "好。我尽量讲得简单、快一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_3b59ed57:

    # e "Thanks, Rahim."
    e "谢谢你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_94d8330f:

    # r "You've gone through your bag I presume. You can put on different types of equipment."
    r "我猜你已经查看过自己的背包了。你可以装备不同种类的物品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_8e2ec3ab:

    # r "Your weapon, your outfit. and accessories."
    r "你的武器、服装，还有配饰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_60f105a8:

    # r "To make the item you need, just come here and check out the workstations."
    r "要制作你需要的物品，来这里看看工作台就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_2a562a02:

    # e "Hmm... where is it?"
    e "嗯……在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_c921e12c:

    # r "The sewing machine."
    r "那台缝纫机看到没。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_c9c02c01:

    # e "Ah... I see."
    e "啊……我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_a796ba30:

    # r "You probably already know what crafting is. You need to learn a recipe to make your item."
    r "你应该已经知道什么是制作了。想做出物品，就得先学会相应的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_cca54020:

    # r "Hmm... I've got one."
    r "嗯……我这里正好有一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_98d576be:

    # r "You probably want something to cover your upper part. I can teach you to make tunic."
    r "你大概想找件东西遮住上半身吧。我可以教你做一件长袍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_c104587d:

    # e "Hmm... should I cover my upper part?"
    e "嗯……我需要把上半身遮住吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r "要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_892df308:

    # e "O-ok. What ingredients do I need?"
    e "好、好的。需要哪些材料？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_2b52781e:

    # r "Two pieces of cloth. Look I'll give you these. Your task is very simple, just make the tunic and bring it to me."
    r "两块布。看，我把这两块给你。你的任务很简单：做出长袍，再拿回来给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Training_e40338aa:

    # e "Thanks Rahim. I'll bring it to you very quickly."
    e "谢谢你，雷希姆。我很快就拿回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_3e6a72d7:

    # e "Hello, Rahim! I've finished the tunic!"
    e "你好，雷希姆！我把长袍做好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_c72901fe:

    # r "Let me see."
    r "我看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_d2737031:

    # r "Hmm... looking good. The sewing is slightly amateur but I can see the effort you put in there."
    r "嗯……做得不错。针脚还有点生疏，但我看得出你下了功夫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_f8321530:

    # e "Thank you...?"
    e "谢谢……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_f69c83cc:

    # r "Yeah... Good. Nice. I'll talk to Ole about your performance."
    r "嗯……不错，挺好。我会跟奥利说说你的表现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_bb92cf10:

    # e "That's really nice. Thanks, Rahim."
    e "那太好了。谢谢你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_ab6911cd:

    # r "No problem, you've been pleasant to talk to. Come here often."
    r "不用客气。你聊起来很愉快，以后常来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_b30368a7:

    # e "Of course! Thanks again!"
    e "当然！再次谢谢你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_715dd096:

    # r "You... don't have the tunic."
    r "你……没有长袍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_d7da90a8:

    # e "Wait..."
    e "诶怎么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_9bdb345f:

    # r "Come back and talk to me when it's done. I'm going to do something else."
    r "做好之后再回来找我。我还有别的事要做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_530f3065:

    # e "Ok, I'll be back soon."
    e "好，我很快回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_715dd096_1:

    # r "You... don't have the tunic."
    r "你……没有长袍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_d7da90a8_1:

    # e "Wait..."
    e "诶怎么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_9bdb345f_1:

    # r "Come back and talk to me when it's done. I'm going to do something else."
    r "做好之后再回来找我。我还有别的事要做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Postal_Finish_530f3065_1:

    # e "Ok, I'll be back soon."
    e "好，我很快回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_789effe3:

    # e "Rahim, what do you think about the people here?"
    e "雷希姆，你怎么看这里的人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_4d793199:

    # r "Meaning?"
    r "什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_cb903513:

    # e "Uh... like... what do you know about them?"
    e "呃……我是说……你对他们了解多少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_4ef2e10d:

    # r "Alright, boy. If you wish, I reckon you have met those two in the store."
    r "好吧，小子。你想知道的话，我猜你已经见过店里的那两个人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_58088359:

    # r "They sell my clothes elsewhere, so they're good."
    r "他们帮我把衣服卖到别处去，所以人还不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_d2b329a6:

    # e "Hmm... what do you think of other people?"
    e "嗯……那其他人呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_60c30271:

    # r "You really want to poke around with your nose, [e]. Don't make me scare you, you're gonna hit the wall hard sooner or later."
    r "你还真爱东打听西打听啊，[e]。别逼我吓你——你迟早会狠狠撞上墙的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_539be7f0:

    # r "... that wolf, I don't like him. Lothar. But we talk sometimes."
    r "……那头狼，我不喜欢他。洛萨尔。不过我们偶尔也会聊几句。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_5fd10514:

    # e "Ok..."
    e "好的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_132c5874:

    # r "And just a little advice from an old man, don't ever trust Cane. No matter how good you treat that ruthless rat, he will stab you in the back some day."
    r "再听老人家一句劝：千万别信凯恩。那只无情的老鼠，不管你对他多好，总有一天会从背后捅你一刀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_8fa176d7:

    # "Rahim continues mumbling some unintelligible words about rats for a few minutes, you stand there, looking at him closely until he snaps back to reality."
    "雷希姆又开始喃喃念叨老鼠，足足过了几分钟，嘴里说的尽是些听不清的话。你站在那里仔细看着他，直到他回过神来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Lusterfield_People_24f03cec:

    # r "...That's it."
    r "……就这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_861d769e:

    # e "Hey, Rahim. Lothar told me about the Goat Tribe. What happened there?"
    e "喂，雷希姆。洛萨尔跟我提到山羊部落。那边究竟发生过什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_7321557d:

    # r "Why do you ask?"
    r "你问这个干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_bc2978fb:

    # e "I just wanted to know more about them."
    e "我只是想多了解一点他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_1dc72c2d:

    # r "That arrogant son of a wolf told you about my stuff, didn't he?"
    r "那个傲慢的狼崽子把我的事告诉你了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_75ecd587:

    # e "What? No... He was just talking about how he defeated the Goat Leader."
    e "什么？没有……他只是说了自己怎么打败山羊首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_1706c4b3:

    # r "...If he spills the beans I'm going to sew his mouth shut once and for all. You hear me?"
    r "……他要是敢把我的事抖出去，我就把他的嘴一劳永逸地缝上。听见了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_d3cb1454:

    # e "Yes... I promise he didn't talk about you."
    e "是……我保证，他没提到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_23c68c75:

    # r "Ok. So what else do you want to know."
    r "好。那你还想知道什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_5cbfbff2:

    # e "Lothar didn't explain very well, but why did the goats came to Lusterfield?"
    e "洛萨尔没说清楚，但山羊为什么会来乐斯民菲尔德？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_e178d861:

    # r "We used to be... friendly. with them. We have wagons of wares and goods transported between us."
    r "我们以前……跟他们关系不错。双方之间经常用马车运输货物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_b924522b:

    # r "They had a wagon full of wares and people, gone. In the middle of the forest."
    r "他们有一辆载满货物和人的马车，在森林中央不见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_a09009d5:

    # r "They found the remains of their couriers East to our village, near the pond."
    r "后来，他们在我们村子以东、池塘附近发现了自家信使的遗骸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_5b0ca1f4:

    # r "They thought it was our doing... It was a long story but the war was planned for a while before it finally broke out."
    r "他们以为是我们干的……这事说来话长，但战争早在真正爆发前就酝酿了一阵子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_bf995035:

    # r "Those Goat bastards came and destroyed everything we had, we built. At the end, we won. Kind of. But at what cost."
    r "那群山羊杂种冲过来，毁了我们拥有的一切，也毁了我们亲手建起的一切。最后我们赢了。算是吧。可代价是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_175502b3:

    # "Rahim looks around depressively, his hand reaches forward to the walls. You try to console him but it seems he is busy reminiscing the past."
    "雷希姆神情阴郁地环顾四周，伸手触向墙壁。你试着安慰他，但他似乎正沉浸在对往事的回忆里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_ba2e1954:

    # e "That was horrible. Do you know who actually raided their wagon?"
    e "真可怕。你知道究竟是谁袭击了他们的马车吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_b7c5de00:

    # r "No... We didn't."
    r "不……不是我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_2d5b9008:

    # e "What if they come back again for revenge?"
    e "如果他们又回来报仇呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_dc394e82:

    # r "Then I'll be the first one to kill them all under my blades. I don't care, I just wanted to protect this village."
    r "那我就第一个动手，让他们死在我的刀下。我不在乎，我只想保护这个村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_92599ed3:

    # e "You still have to look out for your safety, Rahim."
    e "你也得顾好自己的安全，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_41e8201e:

    # r "You don't understand. That wolf thinks it's all a game, a fight for glory and a tool to boast about his reputation."
    r "你不明白。那头狼把这一切当成游戏，当成争夺荣耀的战斗，当成吹嘘自己名声的工具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_899aaca0:

    # r "But in the end it's just slaughter. It's them or us. And there will be casualties, always."
    r "可到头来，这只是屠杀。不是他们死，就是我们死。而且总会有人送命，永远如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_163d4104:

    # r "If you really wish to go there, be careful. And if not, don't bring them to our village."
    r "如果你真想去那里，就小心点。要是不想去，就别把他们带到我们村里来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_4e1598a3:

    # e "Rahim..."
    e "雷希姆……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_50b2ca3e:

    # r "Think about the people living here. I respect that you are going to risk your life, but you are NOT bringing them down with you."
    r "想想住在这里的人。我尊重你愿意拿自己的命去冒险，但你绝不能把他们也拖下水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_82f52a1a:

    # "Rahim stares at you fiercely, you have never felt this much of hostility before, you feel like he could grab his scissors and stab you at any moment, but he is just sitting there, staring."
    "雷希姆凶狠地盯着你。你从未感受过这么强烈的敌意，甚至觉得他随时可能抓起剪刀刺向你；可他只是坐在那里，死死盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_4fa17061:

    # r "Ahem- I'm sorry, I was thinking out loud. Just... stay safe."
    r "咳——抱歉，我只是把心里话说出来了。总之……注意安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_9945dc18:

    # "The bull calms down after a while, he looks away in contempt."
    "过了一会儿，这头公牛平静下来，轻蔑地移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_c3799514:

    # "Was that just a fleeting lapse of judgement in his mind? You wanted to know what he was thinking, but he keeps backing up on his words."
    "刚才只是他一时失控吗？你想知道他究竟在想什么，可他又不断收回刚才的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_GoatTribe_c7420349:

    # e "I will... Thank you Rahim."
    e "我会的……谢谢你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_1229a64a:

    # e "How long have you been a tailor for the village?"
    e "你给村里人当裁缝多久了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_3f362ad1:

    # r "A few decades, twenty, thirty. I've lost tracks. There was a time I became a personal tailor for the town's king.. Well I still do, remotely."
    r "几十年吧，二十、三十年？我都记不清了。以前有段时间，我还成了镇上国王的私人裁缝……当然，现在也还在远程替他做事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_888eee7f:

    # r "Time passed so fast, boy. I used to be an ambitious adventurer like you. Going around poking at the other's business."
    r "时间过得真快啊，小子。我以前也像你一样，是个野心勃勃的冒险家。到处打探别人的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_b9ad9793:

    # r "I settled down someday. Never got out of my job, and that's my life. Just a normal old bull in a normal old village."
    r "后来我找了个地方安顿下来。再也没离开这份工作，而这就是我的生活。一个普通村子里的普通老公牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_973f0dbb:

    # r "And it's all downhill from here."
    r "从今往后，就只剩下坡路了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_32280a03:

    # e "Rahim... I'll be there if you need me."
    e "雷希姆……如果你需要我，我会在的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_a7ef48cd:

    # "Rahim ponders, glancing at the floor for a few seconds. He signs and looks around before turning back at you."
    "雷希姆沉思片刻，低头看了几秒地板。他叹了口气，环顾四周，然后转过身看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Tailor_77e56968:

    # r "You are a helpful boy."
    r "你是个很热心的孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Himself_88e9f8ee:

    # e "How is your tailor job here, Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆，你在村里的裁缝工作怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Himself_38e1cddf:

    # r "Hmm...?"
    r "嗯……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Himself_1185eca9:

    # r "Good, I'm sewing together a loincloth for a client."
    r "挺好，我正在给一位客人缝一条缠腰布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Himself_5d95f382:

    # r "And, a whole yard of requests for stitching up loosen seams."
    r "还有一大堆活儿，都是让我把松开的缝线重新缝好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Himself_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Himself_c2f7eeb9:

    # r "Which means I'm working."
    r "也就是说，我在工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Himself_1ab95c4a:

    # e "Alright, Rahim."
    e "好吧，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_ac111090:

    # e "Hey, Rahim... the apron is fixed."
    e "嘿，雷希姆……围裙修好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_fb0c4131:

    # r "You should take it to him if you think it's fine... but I can take a look."
    r "如果你觉得没问题，就把它拿给他吧……不过我也可以先看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_ecfb7992:

    # "Rahim raises the apron to your level, almost imagining your body in the apron. He calculates for a few seconds before looking back at you."
    "雷希姆把围裙举到与你齐平，仿佛在想象你穿上它的样子。他估量了几秒，才重新看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_25d2b41d:

    # r "Looks really good, the material is almost the same."
    r "看起来很好，材料也几乎一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_aae5699f:

    # e "Thanks to your recipe, of course!"
    e "当然是多亏了你的配方！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_b3a5e1fe:

    # r "Hmm... Yeah there's no problem here, just take it to Cane."
    r "嗯……确实没问题，拿去交给凯恩吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_9a679669:

    # e "Alrighty, thank you so much Rahim."
    e "好嘞，真的非常谢谢你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Fixed_d08115e6:

    # r "You're welcome, [e]."
    r "不客气，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_b9e50a2b:

    # e "Rahim, I have a piece of... apparel, that I think you can help..."
    e "雷希姆，我有件……衣服，可能需要你帮忙看看……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_83b93a25:

    # r "What's it?"
    r "是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_037ef800:

    # e "...This one."
    e "……就是这件。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_d7d4a4ed:

    # "Rahim looks through your bag and found the tavern apron, his eyes widen, you would have thought that he's going to rip apart the apron once and for all."
    "雷希姆翻了翻你的包，找出了酒馆围裙。他的眼睛猛地睁大；看那架势，你还以为他要把围裙当场撕得粉碎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_a0e55179:

    # r "Did the bat sent you?"
    r "是那只蝙蝠派你来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_c69cb282:

    # e "No, I asked him to take the apron to you... He ripped a hole in there accidentally."
    e "不是，是我让他把围裙拿给你的……他不小心在上面撕开了个洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_6504d9b5:

    # "You point at the hole on the apron, but Rahim didn't even bother to inspect it. Instead, he stares at you intensely while grasping on the apron."
    "你指了指围裙上的破洞，但雷希姆根本没去检查。他只是死死盯着你，手指紧紧抓住围裙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_7f3341fd:

    # r "Why did you help him?"
    r "你为什么要帮他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_29027c07:

    # e "Look, I was just looking out for you both, he said he's sorry for whatever happened in the past-"
    e "听我说，我只是想照顾你们两个。他说自己为过去发生的事道歉——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_d0f811f4:

    # r "Sorry? Did I mishear? If he said sorry he wouldn't be sending his little precious server here like a coward he is."
    r "道歉？我没听错吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_51ab4cb7:

    # r "If he's sorry then he wouldn't hide in his pathetic tavern for years and years just to avoid seeing me across the road."
    r "他要是真觉得抱歉，就不会为了躲着不见我，在那间可怜的酒馆里一躲就是好几年——明明我们就在马路两边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_f64cde6b:

    # r "It's been 4 years. And I've never heard a sorry from his damn stupid mouth."
    r "已经四年了。我从他那张该死的蠢嘴里，连一句道歉都没听到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_b39b3094:

    # r "He didn't even show up on my daughter's funeral, I don't care if he's guilty or not, is this how a person is supposed to treat his friends?"
    r "他甚至没来参加我女儿的葬礼。我不在乎他到底有没有罪——一个人怎么能这样对待自己的朋友？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_627522de:

    # e "Rahim... I- I thought you assumed he helped with the raid of the goat's wagon..."
    e "雷希姆……我、我以为你认定他帮忙袭击了山羊的马车……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_f79c7584:

    # r "I don't care if he's guilty or not. It's the goats that attacked our village. We had decades of friendship and memory, but right when I needed my friend the most, he disappeared."
    r "不管他有没有罪，我都不在乎。袭击我们村子的明明是山羊。我们有几十年的友谊和共同回忆，可就在我最需要这个朋友的时候，他消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_bf6ed11c:

    # r "Vanished. Out of thin air. What a good friend. This whole time, I felt betrayed, I lost both people that I loved that day."
    r "凭空消失。就这么没了。真是个好朋友啊。这些年来，我一直觉得自己被背叛了——那一天，我失去了两个我深爱的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_d017b74d:

    # e "I'm so sorry to hear... Rahim. I think he'll certainly be happy to reconcile with you, if you wish."
    e "听到这些我很难过……雷希姆。如果你愿意，我想他一定会很乐意和你和好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_3074194c:

    # r "No, it's too late. Now a single sorry isn't going to be enough."
    r "不，太晚了。现在，一句道歉已经不够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_b9b755e5_1:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_fbdc0d06:

    # "Rahim stares at the hole on the apron, mumbling to himself when suddenly he realises something."
    "雷希姆盯着围裙上的破洞，自言自语了几句，突然像是想到了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_752d18aa:

    # r "It's Topu, isn't it?"
    r "是托普，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_e74f101e:

    # e "I'm sorry?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_b5802c37:

    # r "Was his server the one... that took the deal to help with the raid?"
    r "是他的伙计……那个接下这桩交易、帮忙袭击马车的人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_b5dc3770:

    # e "I don't know, but I believe it wasn't Cane."
    e "我不知道，但我相信不是凯恩干的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_982e3ddf:

    # r "Ok."
    r "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_379ab857:

    # "The cold air in this place slowly returns to normal, you glance at Rahim's crossed arms."
    "周围的寒意慢慢散去，你瞥了一眼双臂交叉的雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_c5f57473:

    # "His shoulder is... not as strained as before, even though he still looks intimidating."
    "他的肩膀……不像之前那样紧绷了，尽管看起来依旧吓人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_972a4cbf:

    # r "I'm helping you with the Apron. Just know that I'm not doing this for the bat, I'm doing this for you."
    r "我会帮你处理这件围裙。记住，我不是为了那只蝙蝠才帮忙，是为了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_2355c0a8:

    # e "Thank you... Rahim. I thought you might tear the apron apart..."
    e "谢谢你……雷希姆。我还以为你会把围裙撕成碎片……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_2845df48:

    # r "Ha. Maybe later."
    r "哈。也许以后吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_ce9d6590:

    # r "Here's the recipe. There are two... actually. You might need to find Ole. He has the dye you would be looking for."
    r "这是配方。其实有两个……你可能得去找奥利。他有你需要的染料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_a47ea533:

    # r "For the other materials, you can find them quite easily if you venture outside, step on some grass."
    r "至于其他材料，你出门走一趟，踩几脚草就能很容易找到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_5e871018:

    # r "I suppose the dummy from Lothar has the patches you need."
    r "我猜洛萨尔的训练假人身上有你需要的补丁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_7684015f:

    # r "And Flax, find them near the lagoon."
    r "亚麻的话，去泻湖附近找。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_ebfc7f91:

    # e "What about Cashmere, that sounds like a tree."
    e "那卡什米尔呢？听起来像棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_cd63ffe7:

    # r "Mhmm... No. You need to get them from the goat, either ask them or beat a few of them up."
    r "嗯……不是。你得从山羊身上弄到它——要么向它们要，要么揍几只。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_1aa72b58:

    # r "I've seen some of the hunters around the ancient tree."
    r "我见过一些猎人在古树附近活动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_d6b6319d:

    # r "I don't know where you can find them. But the ancient tree is the best bet."
    r "我不知道你能在哪里找到它们。不过，古树那边最有希望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_3f864565:

    # r "Something tells me they're plotting... another plan of theirs."
    r "不知怎么的，我觉得它们又在策划什么……它们的另一个计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_0e3295ef:

    # e "Thanks a lot for the recipe."
    e "非常感谢你的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_82d397a2:

    # r "No, Thank you for doing all the boring chores, for us folks in the Lusterfield. It's rare to see such an energetic youth for a while."
    r "不，该谢谢你替我们这些乐斯民菲尔德的人做了这么多无聊的杂活。像你这么精力充沛的年轻人，可不常见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_f039ab2d:

    # r "Apart from the lion, of course."
    r "当然，狮子除外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_705ae207:

    # e "You are too humble, Rahim. I'll certainly be keeping this in mind."
    e "你太谦虚了，雷希姆。我一定会记在心里的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Apron_Quest_358d4028:

    # r "Good, see you around, [e]."
    r "很好，回头见，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_0622b34d:

    # e "Hey, Rahim... Everything alright?"
    e "嘿，雷希姆……一切还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_73ae705d:

    # r "No."
    r "不怎么样，勉勉强强算入门水平。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_70f28d08:

    # r "Even though you are not a good tailor, you seem to have a talent in something related to it."
    r "虽然你不是个好裁缝，但你似乎在某种与裁缝相关的事情上很有天分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_9e15db04:

    # e "What do you mean?"
    e "什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_57344205:

    # r "The cutting and form of the clothes you made are imperfect, amateur level at most."
    r "你做的衣服，剪裁和版型都不完美，充其量只能算业余水平。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_3e556763:

    # r "But I have many other customers praising how you wear them."
    r "但我有不少其他客人夸你穿它们的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_f01b6cc8:

    # r "Maybe because your appearance at the tavern has caused quite a buzz."
    r "也许是因为你在酒馆的打扮引起了不小的轰动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_7359fa33:

    # e "Thank you, i guess?"
    e "谢谢，我猜？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_f5e0ba0b:

    # r "That was not a praise."
    r "那不是在夸你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_7634acec:

    # e "O-ok..."
    e "好、好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_12a9f0f5:

    # r "Since you have talent in modelling, I have some professionally-made clothes for you to model."
    r "既然你有当模特的天分，我这里有几套专业制作的衣服，正好给你试穿展示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_d2fa4168:

    # r "I made them just to experiment with the pattern and design, with your size in mind."
    r "我做这些只是为了试验图案和设计，而且是按你的身材做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_b3c97728:

    # e "W-wait... How did you know...?"
    e "等、等等……你怎么知道……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_e684f1b5:

    # r "I measured your waist when you first came, and I know that apron fit you quite nicely."
    r "你第一次来的时候我量过你的腰围，而且我知道那条围裙很合你的身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_7d5c27ee:

    # r "Anyways, usually I would judge the quality of the outfit by myself."
    r "总之，通常我会自己判断服装的质量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_262e6b89:

    # r "But these, they are... not quite what I'd usually create."
    r "但这些……它们不太像我平常会做的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_539a4359:

    # e "That sounds like fun."
    e "听起来挺有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_44b3217a:

    # r "No, this is serious. I'll give you some sets of clothes."
    r "不，这很严肃。我会给你几套衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_fee1eca6:

    # r "And you will wear them and get responses from the townspeople and report back to me."
    r "你要穿上它们，去听听镇民的反应，再回来向我汇报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_abee627b:

    # r "Do not tear or dirty them or you'll have to pay for them."
    r "别把它们撕坏或弄脏，否则你得赔钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_ad96c386:

    # e "Ehm... "
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_54874d98:

    # r "If everything goes well, i might let you keep one of them."
    r "如果一切顺利，我也许会让你留下一套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_d75eed58:

    # r "So, this set is for the adventurers in the village. Put this one and see what the folks have to say about it."
    r "所以，这一套是给村里冒险者的。穿上它，去听听大家怎么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_187281ee:

    # "You excuses yourself to change. The adventurer's armor is very minimal. You blushes."
    "你借口要去换衣服，离开了。冒险者护甲遮挡得极少，你不禁红了脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_b70b6ae9:

    # e "Isn't this a bit too little protection for adventuring?"
    e "拿这点防护去冒险，不是太少了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_Quest_b772bf60:

    # r "The important parts are covered. And that's what matters to you. Now go and get their opinions and come back."
    r "该遮的要害都遮住了。这对你来说才是最重要的。现在去问问他们的意见，然后回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_c20ab467:

    # e "Rahim. I got the feedback you need. Lothar, Jog and Amble like it. Lothar even wants one for himself."
    e "雷希姆，我拿到你需要的反馈了。洛萨尔、乔格和安布都喜欢，洛萨尔甚至想给自己弄一套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_c8bb9898:

    # "Rahim grunts."
    "雷希姆哼了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_112ce8ae:

    # r "As if he can pay for one. Anyway, well done. Now onto the next set."
    r "他哪付得起啊。算了，干得不错。接下来是下一套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_5f3f3577:

    # r "This is... for the tavern."
    r "这一套是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_48bf5784:

    # r "That bat never come to visit but I hear that he has been entertaining more customers since you arrived."
    r "那只蝙蝠从不来找我，不过我听说自从你来了以后，他接待的客人更多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_bea7df11:

    # "For the customers' sake, I've designed a new waiter's outfit. Try it on."
    "为了顾客着想，我设计了一套新的侍者服。试试看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_aff9c099:

    # "Rahim hands you what appears to be a pair of chaps."
    "雷希姆递给你的，看起来是一条皮套裤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_7f8cfe8c:

    # "After you changes, you can't help but feel a little breezy."
    "换好之后，你忍不住觉得凉飕飕的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_2c66ff69:

    # e "Rahim, are you sure this is alright?"
    e "雷希姆，你确定这样没问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_02_d38291b6:

    # r "Keep the questions for the townspeople. Since this set is designed with the tavern in mind, you should get the bat's feedback. Don't forget everyone else too."
    r "有疑问就去问镇民。既然这套是为酒馆设计的，你应该去听听那只蝙蝠的反馈。别忘了其他人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_677bda18:

    # r "That took longer than expected and why are you all flushed?"
    r "这次花的时间比我预想的久。你怎么满脸通红？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_81d01cc5:

    # "You open your mouth and you don't quite know how to answer."
    "你张开嘴，却不知道该怎么回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_2e465c12:

    # r "No matter. I see that bat hasn't changed at all."
    r "算了。我看那只蝙蝠一点没变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_592d2e95:

    # r "that kid also would react like this whenever he came from the tavern..."
    r "那个孩子以前从酒馆回来时，也总会是这副反应……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_2b334075:

    # "Rahim lets the sentence linger."
    "雷希姆没有把话说完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_52ed08f1:

    # r "You should know that the apron belonged to the kid who worked for the bat before he... He was a good kid."
    r "你应该知道，这条围裙原本属于那个曾在蝙蝠手下工作的孩子……在他出事之前。他是个好孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_783d15e1:

    # r "You reminded me a lot of him."
    r "你身上有很多地方像他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_2e43639a:

    # e "Cane... said that about me... too."
    e "凯恩……也这么说过我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_f415e1f3:

    # r "However, you are your own person. I've come to realize that. It's one of the reasons why this piece is created."
    r "不过，你就是你自己。这一点我终于明白了。这也是我做这件衣服的原因之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_38c89ab8:

    # r "The apron is yours because the bat has given it to you."
    r "围裙属于你，是因为那只蝙蝠把它给了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_1b4884d8:

    # r "But you are you."
    r "但你就是你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_cbe498ce:

    # "Rahim coughs and turns serious."
    "雷希姆咳了一声，神情严肃起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_1869e700:

    # r "I'm sure the tavern has enjoyed that new outfit."
    r "我想酒馆的人很喜欢那套新衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_80d1d10e:

    # "Rahim sighs and breathes under his breath."
    "雷希姆叹了口气，低声嘟囔着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_ec0e59ed:

    # r "Just be careful."
    r "当心别被那种氛围冲昏头脑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_65352677:

    # r "...Enough sad talk."
    r "……不说这些伤感的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_cd51c49e:

    # r "This is an everyday wear. It's quite long so make sure you don't step on it accidentally."
    r "这是日常穿着。它做得很长，记得别不小心踩到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_bd5c63e4:

    # "You change."
    "你换上了衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_a28c4b7c:

    # e "Rahim, I don't see any innerwear. Am I not supposed to wear anything underneath?"
    e "雷希姆，我没看到内衣。我不该在里面穿点什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_af28e841:

    # r "yes."
    r "对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_d4993d94:

    # e "But..."
    e "可是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_d5259cc6:

    # "Rahim cuts you off."
    "雷希姆打断了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_03_01d24678:

    # r "Go off now. Walk around town and get people's reaction."
    r "现在走吧。去镇上转转，听听大家的反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_3f042727:

    # e "Rahim, I got the comments for the outfit. Haskell especially likes it."
    e "雷希姆，我拿到大家对服装的反馈了。哈斯凯尔尤其喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_a715ceb7:

    # r "Haskell? You mean Ole's friend who makes all their potions at the shop?"
    r "哈斯凯尔？你是说奥利那个在店里给大家做药剂的朋友？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_5020d334:

    # e "Yes. He wears a lot of robes. He said he might visit you to have you make some for him."
    e "对。他很常穿长袍。他说可能会来找你，请你给他做几套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_b5ecb9fa:

    # r "Interesting."
    r "我欢迎识货的顾客。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_09728c42:

    # r "Now that you've tried out all three outfits. Which one do you prefer?" nointeract
    r "你已经试过三套服装了。你更喜欢哪一套？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_6a685a8f:

    # r "Good choice. Take good care of it."
    r "不错的选择。好好保管。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_79c8fdaf:

    # r "Don't let Lothar pressure you into give you the armor."
    r "别让洛萨尔逼你把这套护甲交给他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_a869f733:

    # r "He might Lutherfield's hero but he's not getting anything for free."
    r "他或许是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄，但别想白拿任何东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_0dfaa213:

    # r "Not a bad choice."
    r "选得不差。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_83cec16e:

    # r "And... Um... Don't let the bat knows that I'm giving you this for free."
    r "还有……呃……别让那只蝙蝠知道我免费给你这套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_2c1e89a9:

    # r "That creep will never stop taking advantage of it if you do."
    r "不然那个混蛋会没完没了地占便宜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_cdc7d258:

    # r "Practical and fashionable."
    r "实用又时髦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_3c0e486c:

    # r "Thanks for bringing to my attention Haskell's appreciation for this style of clothing. Maybe I shall visit him first."
    r "谢谢你让我知道哈斯凯尔喜欢这种服装风格。也许我该先去拜访他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_3424e235:

    # r "I also added some tailoring changes with Ole and Sebas's input."
    r "我还结合奥利和塞巴斯的意见，做了些裁缝上的调整。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_a77bd734:

    # r "I've added some tailoring changes based on the feedback."
    r "我也根据大家的反馈做了一些调整。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_c3d41cc3:

    # r "Thanks for treating this seriously. I'm not sure you would. This doesn't normally fall under the job scope of a courier."
    r "谢谢你认真对待这件事。我本来不确定你会不会认真做——这本来就不属于信使的职责范围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_9ad5955e:

    # e "No... Thank you Rahim, for letting me try out all of your designs and gifting this one to me."
    e "不，该谢谢你，雷希姆。谢谢你让我试穿了所有设计，还把这套送给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Outfit_End_ae397942:

    # r "Hmm..."
    r "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_eda3fc98:

    # r "That's been the final decision for years, Sebas. I am not changing my mind whatever you say."
    r "这就是多年来的最终决定，塞巴斯。无论你说什么，我都不会改变主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8a45bf3b:

    # "A calm and collected voice emerges from inside the house, who you assume to be the house' owner."
    "屋里传出一个沉着冷静的声音，你猜那是房主。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_de3d5d0f:

    # s "That was YOUR decision, not our village's. Stop living in the past, old bull."
    s "那是你自己的决定，不是我们村子的决定。别再活在过去了，老牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_a885819a:

    # r "If you want to go and get kil-"
    r "你要是想去送命——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_e722cccd:

    # "You enter the house, rather casually, pretending you didn't hear anything from them."
    "你若无其事地走进屋里，假装没听到他们刚才的谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3171675f:

    # s "Hey, there buddy."
    s "嘿，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9095243f:

    # "Sebas' eyes widen as he notices you, waving his hands nervously."
    "塞巴斯注意到你，眼睛一睁，紧张地挥了挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b21f6698:

    # e "Oh... am I interrupting?"
    e "哦……我打扰你们了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_241a4587:

    # s "Nah, not even slightly, we were just chatting. Buddy you should just join in!"
    s "哪有，完全没有。我们就是随便聊聊。伙计，快进来一起聊！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_28fa195d:

    # "Rahim crosses his arms, staying on his chair while you find a chair to sit on."
    "雷希姆抱起双臂，仍坐在椅子上；你也找了把椅子坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b728c220:

    # r "Sebas, anything else you want to know...?"
    r "塞巴斯，你还想知道什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_fb6e8863:

    # s "Oh, well. How about fixing the bridge..."
    s "哦，这个嘛。要不先把桥修好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_73ae705d:

    # r "No."
    r "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_d4223b9f:

    # s "...Between us and the goat tribe."
    s "……我们和山羊部落之间的桥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_0b3e6b23:

    # "Sebas coughs."
    "塞巴斯咳嗽了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_cfbe3e2d:

    # s "You know, our relationships are like ropes, you can cut them off, but when you put them back in, you pull both ends closer together."
    s "你知道，关系就像绳子。绳子可以被剪断，但重新接起来时，两端反而会拉得更近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7e8d1f28:

    # "It was a weird metaphor, but the way Sebas presents it he doesn't seem to find it odd."
    "这个比喻很奇怪，但塞巴斯说得一本正经，似乎完全不觉得奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1db76dc9:

    # e "Is that really how it works."
    e "真的是这样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_73ae705d_1:

    # r "No."
    r "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b92e5eeb:

    # "He scritches his chins again."
    "他又挠了挠下巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_956e1f75:

    # s "You must know this one. Well, relationships are like stray threads, when it frays. It's our hands that must mend it, weaving... trust, and understanding, back into the fabric."
    s "你肯定知道这个。关系就像散开的线头，一旦磨损，就得靠我们的双手把它修好，把信任和理解重新织回这块布里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_011724ec:

    # r "That's the same thing."
    r "这不还是一回事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_edd51907:

    # s "N-no it's not. If you keep those relationship unchecked, they'll unweave and you get a huge hole, in your fabric, but also, your heart. It's a different metaphor."
    s "不、不是。如果放任关系不管，它们就会一根根散开；你的布料上会出现一个大洞，心里也会留下一个洞。这是另一个比喻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_73ae705d_2:

    # r "No."
    r "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_561546ec:

    # s "Relationship is a garden that needs nurturing, forgivness is the fertilizer and magic-"
    s "关系是一座需要照料的花园，宽恕是肥料和魔法——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_73ae705d_3:

    # r "No."
    r "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ffd18b2b:

    # s "Relationship is a ship that sails-"
    s "关系是一艘扬帆远航的船——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_73ae705d_4:

    # r "No."
    r "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_af6b8f68:

    # s "Relat-"
    s "关——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_252a87f5:

    # e "I don't think Rahim is gonna be convinced by you, Seb."
    e "我觉得雷希姆不会被你说服的，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1484d302:

    # s "Well, Ole loved these lines from his books, ughhh. Mister Rahim please reconsider your position before I go absolutely insane."
    s "好吧，奥利倒是很喜欢他书里的这些台词。唉……雷希姆先生，请在我彻底发疯之前重新考虑一下你的立场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_673d529e:

    # "Sebas turns to you, with the same pleading eyes he uses on Rahim."
    "塞巴斯转向你，摆出和对雷希姆说话时一样的恳求眼神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2084ba48:

    # s "Buddy, don't you also agree that we should keep the peace?"
    s "伙计，你不也觉得我们应该维持和平吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_db314ce0:

    # e "Well, I've been there lately, so yeah, I agree with Seb."
    e "我最近去过那里，所以……对，我同意塞巴斯的说法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5b8fe2d3:

    # "You notice Rahim scoffs at your response."
    "你注意到雷希姆对你的回答嗤之以鼻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3ef29fb0:

    # r "Goats? I've heard you became their hero overnight. Saving the chief from a cave?"
    r "山羊？我听说你一夜之间成了他们的英雄。还从洞穴里救出了首领？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_393186ae:

    # e "Well-"
    e "呃——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_0bc63d98:

    # r "I'm actually not interested."
    r "其实我没兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b438c76c:

    # r "I'm not going to change my mind, so you two conspirators better give up soon and leave, the door's right ther-."
    r "我不会改变主意，所以你们两个共谋者最好赶紧放弃，然后离开。门就在那边——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_be9052d6:

    # "Just as he was about to point at the door, it opens to reveal a familiar figure."
    "正当他要指向门时，门开了，露出一个熟悉的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7926dd1f:

    # o "Hey, Rahim, door's not closed."
    o "嘿，雷希姆，门没关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ef4ca43a:

    # r "What is it, Ole."
    r "怎么了，奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8d03c570:

    # o "Someone wants to see you now."
    o "有人现在想见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5ebfc027:

    # r "W-who?"
    r "谁、谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b0d87eca:

    # r "If you want to go and get killed by those treachous goats, so be it. But you're not dragging us with you. There's no way I'm allowing this."
    r "你要是想被那群卑鄙的山羊杀掉，随你。但别想把我们也拖下水。我绝不允许。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_37ca7bc1:

    # s "See, I don't even fucking kno-"
    s "你看，我他妈根本不知道——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9272e4f9:

    # r "Language, kid."
    r "注意用词，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_da26c88d:

    # s "I don't even know why you're so... pressed. It's been years. What happened to Hala, it wasn't even the goat's fault, it was just an accident!"
    s "我就是不明白你为什么还这么……耿耿于怀。都过去这么多年了。哈拉的事又不是山羊的错，只是一场意外！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_06324a76:

    # r "If you put my daughter's name in your mouth one more time, I'll stitch you up with this needle right here, kid."
    r "你要是再提我女儿的名字，我就用手里这根针把你缝起来，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2d026608:

    # r "How about you stop crying all over the ground and accept what's been reality for years already, I'm not your father."
    r "你能不能别再趴在地上哭哭啼啼，接受现实？这都已经是多年前的事了。我不是你父亲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5aca47fa:

    # r "Go on with your own life, didn't I give all my business to your pawn? Isn't that enough?"
    r "过你自己的生活去。我不是已经把所有生意都交给你的当铺了吗？这还不够？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_49715fd3:

    # s "Rahim. You know how much we earn."
    s "雷希姆，你知道我们赚了多少钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_493858a4:

    # s "The most I've earned was from that blue werewolf [e] brought us the other day. And it was... "
    s "我赚得最多的一笔，就是前几天[e]带来的那只蓝色狼人。而且那笔生意……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_a160cdb4:

    # r "[e] brought a werewolf to our village?"
    r "[e]带狼人来我们村？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3840a120:

    # s "I-I... he doesn't look ferocious. O-Or something."
    s "我、我……他看起来也不凶。或者……应该吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_4bef95e7:

    # s "My point is, only regulars are in the shop, travelling merchant's been getting rar-"
    s "我的意思是，店里现在只有熟客，旅行商也越来越少——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6e952f8d:

    # s "The shop's been dead, and in a few months it's going away for real."
    s "店里的生意一落千丈，再过几个月就真的要关门了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_bfac63a2:

    # r "You're supposed to have the biggest shop in the village, if anything, it's on you. No one else."
    r "你本该经营村里最大的店。真要怪，也只能怪你自己，不能怪别人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_c5e035c0:

    # s "There's something else-"
    s "还有一件事——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_86de5497:

    # "Your hand slips, making a loud thumping sound right on the wall, you can feel they pause just to your voice."
    "你的手一滑，正好在墙上发出一声巨响。你能感觉到屋里的人停了下来，像是在听动静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1059247f:

    # s "What's that sound?"
    s "什么声音？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_852e6883:

    # "Someone is approaching..."
    "有人正在靠近……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7b78b635:

    # "Instinctively, you hop and throw yourself right under the window."
    "你本能地一跃而起，扑到窗户下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_a389d874:

    # "A lion, peeks out of the window. Sebas looks left and right, unaware of you under the window."
    "一头狮子从窗户探出头来。塞巴斯左右张望，完全没发现你躲在窗下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7d073b9c:

    # "You can barely hold your breath, just enough for Sebas to take a sigh and returns to Rahim."
    "你勉强屏住呼吸，直到塞巴斯叹了口气，转回去面对雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3bfbf24a:

    # s "Doesn't seem like anything out there."
    s "外面好像没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_38830f17:

    # r "What were you talk about again."
    r "你刚才说到哪儿了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f918492f:

    # s "Uh, I forgot. That sound distracted me."
    s "呃，忘了。那声音把我弄分心了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_82a29a47:

    # "The two takes a quick pause, before you hear someone reaching into their pockets."
    "两人短暂地停了下来，然后你听见有人把手伸进口袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7c182da3:

    # r "Are they coming after you."
    r "他们是不是在追你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_4c4bfca5:

    # s "No, not them. And... well."
    s "不，不是他们。还有……嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_bc2c3e36:

    # r "For gods' sake. Can't you just cut off your tail and call it a day? You don't need to see him to survive."
    r "看在诸神的份上，你就不能把这条尾巴切断，一了百了？你不见他也能活下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_c41d5b84:

    # s "Shhh! Stop shouting like you're talking to a goat."
    s "嘘！别像在跟山羊说话一样大喊大叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3ab5deb1:

    # r "Huh, maybe I am, if I stab these two needles on your head you'll look like one."
    r "呵，也许我就是。我要是把这两根针插到你头上，你看起来就像山羊了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3c17d0e0:

    # s "O-OUCH! Fuck! Alright, I get it. Don't need to actually do what you're threatening to."
    s "啊——疼！操！好吧，我懂了。你没必要真的动手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_19c72d30:

    # s "I am just a messenger, okay? Maybe if you consider this option we can finall-"
    s "我只是个传话的，好吗？也许你考虑一下这个办法，我们终于能——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3a3a84b8:

    # r "Did I not make myself clear enough, don't ever mention them in front of me again. It's all useless."
    r "我还没说清楚吗？以后别再在我面前提他们。说什么都没用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_de831280:

    # s "I didn't mention the forbidden word, yet..."
    s "我还没提那个禁忌词呢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1c936252:

    # r "Kid, you're giving me a headache, as if two aren't already enough."
    r "小子，你快把我说得头疼了，难道我已经有两个麻烦还不够吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b6a95233:

    # r "I'm tired of all of you trying to ruin the only thing left for me to live."
    r "我受够了你们一个个想毁掉我仅剩的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_04236127:

    # s "Mister Rahim..."
    s "雷希姆先生……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7fc2f5b4:

    # r "I could have just minded my own business here, but no, you have to going around buzzing like a fly in my ears."
    r "我本来可以在这里安安静静地管自己的事，可你却非要像苍蝇一样在我耳边嗡个不停。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_c6a62f64:

    # r "Everything would've been fine if you young people do your job, live for the day, and learn to listen for once."
    r "要是你们这些年轻人做好自己的事，过好每一天，也学会听人说话，一切本来都会好好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ad0ce4b8:

    # "He pauses for a moment, scratching his head."
    "他停了一会儿，挠了挠头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ddf885b9:

    # r "No more talks, aren't you here for the shop's spares?"
    r "别再说了。你不是来拿店里的备用零件的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7c598581:

    # "As you press your ear against the wall, a shadow looms over you."
    "你把耳朵贴在墙上时，一道阴影笼罩了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_958c1992:

    # "Your eyes widen, but the familiar shape of a lizard tells you it's Ole."
    "你睁大眼睛，但那个熟悉的蜥蜴身影告诉你，来的是奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_c2957718:

    # o "{size=30}W-what are you doing here, [e].{/size}"
    o "{size=30}你、你在这里做什么，[e]？{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7c0f40cd:

    # "He whispers quietly, seems to have already understood your intention perfectly before answering."
    "他压低声音，显然在开口前就完全明白了你的意图。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f85303ab:

    # "You turn your head and face the lizard, who just smiles at you."
    "你转过头，面对那只蜥蜴；他只是朝你笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_25414e7e:

    # o "Well, Kiddo. Next time find a better hiding spot if you want to listen more clearly."
    o "小鬼，下次要是想听得更清楚，最好找个更好的藏身处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_72944a05:

    # o "There's something more important now, stand up."
    o "现在有更重要的事。站起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9a2f1569:

    # "He pats your shoulder to gesture you to stand, while you're still in shock."
    "你还没从震惊中回过神来，他便拍了拍你的肩膀，示意你站起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_aae91936:

    # "You follow behind Ole as he knocks on the door three times, the discussion has stopped, almost immediately."
    "你跟在奥利身后。他敲了三下门，谈话几乎立刻停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5bb5c819:

    # o "Hey, Rahim. Someone's outside our village."
    o "嘿，雷希姆。有人在我们村外面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_4e124331:

    # "You glances at the lion and the bull, staring at the lizard awkwardly."
    "你尴尬地看着那头狮子和公牛，又看了看蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_92a51f9c:

    # s "Goooooood F-"
    s "好极了——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8172e429:

    # r "Who?"
    r "谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7b78b635_1:

    # "Instinctively, you hop and throw yourself right under the window."
    "你本能地一跃而起，扑到窗户下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7856aa36:

    # "But a small misstep plunges you into the grass right next to you."
    "但你一个小失误，跌进了旁边的草丛里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9d332801:

    # "Sebas pokes his head out of the window, and immediately notices your weak attempt at hiding."
    "塞巴斯从窗户探出头来，立刻发现你这拙劣的藏身尝试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1262880f:

    # s "Uh...buddy? You cozy right here?"
    s "呃……伙计？躲在这里舒服吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_fd47bfaa:

    # "You see the lion stares at your posture, face full of grasses and leaves."
    "你看见那头狮子盯着你的姿势，你脸上沾满了草叶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_fbfb4027:

    # e "Y-yes."
    e "是、是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ed36c118:

    # "Caught right in the act, you nod slowly and get up from the greenery."
    "当场被抓住，你慢慢点头，从草丛里爬了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_a69402f6:

    # r "[e]? How much did you hear."
    r "[e]？你听到了多少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6dbeea97:

    # "The bull peeks from the window, noticing your feeble attempt at hiding yourself."
    "公牛从窗户探出头来，注意到你这拙劣的藏身尝试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_34926850:

    # e "Uh... not much, I was about to come in like a minute ago."
    e "呃……没多少。我大概一分钟前正要进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b2688fa3:

    # r "R-right..."
    r "对、对……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_de43e975:

    # s "Our buddy's just curious haha! I've been listening into the nature lately too."
    s "咱们的伙计只是好奇嘛，哈哈！我最近也一直在听大自然的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_cfa9ca5f:

    # r "That's not the same!"
    r "这根本不是一回事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_073e266f:

    # e "I'm so sorry, Rahim. I didn't mean to interrupt you two talking."
    e "对不起，雷希姆。我不是故意打断你们谈话的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8a661687:

    # r "And those words wasn't meant for you to listen, yet you choose to sneak up."
    r "那些话本来就不是说给你听的，可你偏偏选择偷偷摸过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_dbb1f3a2:

    # r "Ugh... you young people are really the same, huh? No matter the worlds you live in."
    r "唉……你们年轻人真是一个样，不管活在哪个世界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_77ad53f1:

    # s "Well, you should still come in, [e]."
    s "你还是应该进来，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_934f862e:

    # "You reluctantly enter Rahim's house, directly facing the frustrated bull."
    "你不情不愿地走进雷希姆的房子，正对上那头沮丧的公牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_a80bf846:

    # r "Should I take your blind honesty as some kind of virtue?"
    r "我该把你这毫无防备的诚实当成某种美德吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_509f5657:

    # r "So, what are you doing here? Just casually spying on us like a fly on the wall?"
    r "所以，你来这里做什么？像只趴在墙上的苍蝇一样，随便偷听我们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_09af5b7f:

    # s "Or, a flea on the bull."
    s "或者说，像趴在公牛身上的跳蚤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1965f947:

    # "Rahim shakes his head."
    "雷希姆摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_d81dea2f:

    # e "I'm-"
    e "我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_451dfc11:

    # "Just as you open your mouth once more, a familiar figure emerges from behind you."
    "正当你再次张口，一个熟悉的身影从你身后出现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_52cbf4fc:

    # o "Hey, door's not closed."
    o "嘿，门没关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_0b40cd4e:

    # "Ole walks in casually, not aware of the situation you're currently in."
    "奥利若无其事地走进来，完全没意识到你目前的处境。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_aa33783d:

    # r "What! Are everyone going to come here right now?"
    r "怎么回事？现在所有人都要来这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8d03c570_1:

    # o "Someone wants to see you now."
    o "有人现在想见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5ebfc027_1:

    # r "W-who?"
    r "谁、谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7d2e2993:

    # "You walk over the door, right as Sebas was about to peek out of the window."
    "你走到门边，正好赶上塞巴斯准备从窗户探头出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_fa787f0d:

    # e "Hey, R-... Seb?"
    e "嘿，雷——……塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_a3a2cd11:

    # "Sebas turns right, glancing at you with an awkward smile."
    "塞巴斯转过身，尴尬地朝你笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1c9cd6f9:

    # s "Well, good fu-"
    s "嗯，早他——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_bcee6ec3:

    # r "Language."
    r "注意用词。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_55f6af1a:

    # s "-King Morning, [e]."
    s "——妈，早上好，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_93160067:

    # "You see Rahim rolls his eyes, obviously tired of Sebas' shenanigans."
    "你看见雷希姆翻了个白眼，显然已经厌倦了塞巴斯的花招。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f8cd7b02:

    # e "Hey, I heard someone talking here, what were you guys talking about?"
    e "嘿，我听见有人在这里说话。你们在聊什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_825320a6:

    # s "Of course it's you, buddy. Haha, guess we spoke of the devil."
    s "当然是你啊，伙计。哈哈，真是说曹操曹操到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1915b094:

    # s "Whoops, Rahim might not seem like it but he's obviously enjoying his time with you!"
    s "哎呀，雷希姆可能看不出来，但他显然很享受和你待在一起的时间！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2ac6ee9c:

    # r "Huh...?"
    r "嗯……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_909287b8:

    # s "Just kidding haha, if Rahim does, he's definitely the one who doesn't say anything about it."
    s "开个玩笑，哈哈。要是真这样，他肯定是那个什么都不说的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_dc4eb06b:

    # s "Buddy, did you hear anything? Like... anything while you came through the door."
    s "伙计，你刚才听到什么了吗？比如……你从门口进来时听到了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f27df6d4:

    # e "N-nothing really, I just wanted to use Rahim's tool."
    e "没、没什么。我只是想用一下雷希姆的工具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ab0bc760:

    # r "I-it's right ther-."
    r "就、就在那——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_724696b0:

    # "Just as Rahim opens his mouth once more, a familiar figure emerges from behind you."
    "正当雷希姆再次张口，一个熟悉的身影从你身后出现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_52cbf4fc_1:

    # o "Hey, door's not closed."
    o "嘿，门没关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ef4ca43a_1:

    # r "What is it, Ole."
    r "怎么了，奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8d03c570_2:

    # o "Someone wants to see you now."
    o "有人现在想见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5ebfc027_2:

    # r "W-who?"
    r "谁、谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ef4d2b63:

    # o "Furkan. He said he wants to see you, in person."
    o "弗坎。他说想亲自见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_abcdfa2d:

    # r "T-that... You are joking right? Isn't the lion enough of a nuisance already?"
    r "弗、弗坎……你不是在开玩笑吧？光是那头狮子还不够让人头疼吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_c836fe7f:

    # s "He didn't mean that."
    s "他不是那个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5ac169b0:

    # "Sebas whispers to you."
    "塞巴斯低声对你说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7d4de124:

    # r "Bring me to him right now! I need to know what he's thinking coming to our place like this."
    r "现在就带我去见他！我得知道他为什么跑到我们这边来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_df9f995d:

    # r "And Sebas, I don't want to hear a words about the goats again."
    r "还有，塞巴斯，我不想再听到你提半句山羊的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2e754991:

    # "He points at you and Sebas."
    "他指了指你和塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_fea4027b:

    # r "Stay put until I come back."
    r "待在这里，等我回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_69f45981:

    # "You nod, along with the oblivious lion."
    "你和那头毫不知情的狮子一起点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2597308b:

    # s "Well, roomie. Didn't know our bull has so much visitors today."
    s "室友，没想到咱们这头公牛今天来了这么多客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2c00434d:

    # s "Me, you, Ole, Furkan. That's four more buddies than the average buddies he sees in a day!"
    s "我、你、奥利、弗坎。这比他平时一天见到的朋友多了四个！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9cd4fc93:

    # e "So that was... zero?"
    e "所以，他平时一天见到的朋友是……零个？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_eb619674:

    # s "Uh..."
    s "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_4a9d0a1b:

    # s "Anyway, that's pretty silly for him to think we're staying here until he's back, isn't that right roomie?"
    s "不管怎样，他以为我们会一直待在这里等他回来，实在有够傻，对吧，室友？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_50f7ba6d:

    # s "Speaking of, are we following Rahim?" nointeract
    s "说到这个，我们要跟在雷希姆后面吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_cf5b4096:

    # e "Maybe we should take a look?"
    e "也许我们该去看看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_c9aa9c90:

    # s "Good idea! It's gonna be something very important. Well, that's why we should join in!"
    s "好主意！肯定是件非常重要的事。正因为如此，我们才该一起去！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_40871fda:

    # "You are not sure if he is sarcastic or genuinely oblivious. But, you've made the choice to go along with Sebas."
    "你不确定他是在讽刺，还是单纯没意识到问题。但你已经决定跟塞巴斯一起去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_c1b3b3e4:

    # "Walking through the paths in Lusterfield, it's actually not too far until you hear the familiar grumpy voice of Rahim."
    "沿着乐斯民菲尔德的小路走了一段，你很快就听见雷希姆那熟悉的暴躁声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_52fe6365:

    # r "You had the guts to talk to me right here... we could've had you killed here for what your people had done on this land."
    r "你还真敢在这里跟我说话……就凭你们的人在这片土地上做过的事，我本来可以让你死在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_012d25a2:

    # f "You can, you are too reasonable to be doing that."
    f "你可以这么做，但你太讲道理，不会真的这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2f8a0a51:

    # "You soon realise it's a bad idea to join in. Sebas takes a few steps backwards as the bull rolls his eyes, furiously."
    "你很快意识到，加入他们不是个好主意。公牛怒气冲冲地翻了个白眼，塞巴斯往后退了几步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9db60de5:

    # r "Leave."
    r "滚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_999dab99:

    # s "We're just-"
    s "我们只是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_e42b9247:

    # r "Don't make me say it again."
    r "别让我再说一遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9554a7ee:

    # "Sebas immediately turns back, he brings you a few steps away from the two leaders."
    "塞巴斯立刻转身，把你带到离两位首领几步远的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_677730ba:

    # s "Let's go back to our shop instead, buddy."
    s "我们还是回店里吧，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_be8ab3d0:

    # "You nod. It's certainly not a good idea to have a target on your back when Rahim is angry."
    "你点点头。雷希姆正在气头上，还是别让自己成为他的靶子为好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6e40606d:

    # "Entering the shop, you can still faintly hear Rahim and Furkan talking in the middle of the village."
    "走进店里后，你仍能隐约听见雷希姆和弗坎在村子中央交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_e46e855b:

    # "Ole is nowhere to be seen. You assume perhaps he's working on the shop inventory upstairs."
    "奥利不见踪影。你猜他可能在楼上整理店里的库存。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_e64a4aa6:

    # "Sebas presses his ears against the wall curiously. Trying to figure out what they're talking about as you join in."
    "塞巴斯好奇地把耳朵贴到墙上。你也凑过去，试图弄清他们在说什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f1e70186:

    # r "-talk me through your thought process, what happened to your measly little goat brain- why do you think coming up to me is not a complete waste of time?"
    r "——把你的想法从头到尾说清楚。你那可怜的小山羊脑袋到底出了什么问题？你凭什么觉得跑到我面前来不是在浪费时间？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3eb10f3c:

    # f "We have to talk."
    f "我们得谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ec8aec47:

    # f "The primordial runes, we sensed its energy being unleashed again lately."
    f "原初符文。最近我们又感知到了它的能量正在释放。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_74713bc0:

    # r "We know it's capability."
    r "我们知道它的威力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_546fb7b4:

    # f "But-... the problem is, our general can feel its power being somewhere very near. We are afraid if they were the same personels who had stolen our basin."
    f "可……问题在于，我们的将军感觉到它的力量就在附近。我们担心，偷走我们盆器的可能就是同一批人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_e567fbef:

    # f "Someone is brewing up a plan, and it's unfathomable how the runes would be used for."
    f "有人正在酝酿计划，而我们无法想象他们会拿符文做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_84877592:

    # r "Get to the point."
    r "说重点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9d50aa59:

    # f "We should join our forces, our people, and your people. To prepare for the looming threat."
    f "我们应该联合双方的力量和人民，为迫在眉睫的威胁做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b29baad6:

    # f "We're the closest to each other, we need to rebuild the bridg- and figure out what exactly happened. At least if someone is preparing for an attack, we will be ready for it."
    f "我们彼此相邻，必须重建这座桥——并查清到底发生了什么。至少，如果有人正准备发动攻击，我们也能有所准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_970b96ef:

    # r "Why?"
    r "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_e5530304:

    # f "W-why... for our people of course. Do you really believe we have the intention to hurt yours at any point."
    f "为、为什么……当然是为了我们的人。你真觉得我们什么时候想过伤害你们吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6ea5bed0:

    # "The bull doesn't even speak."
    "公牛甚至没有开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_bd0b5cd6:

    # "Furkan shakes his head."
    "弗坎摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_54e83f5f:

    # f "It was all a misunderstanding from the beginning to the end. We were about to retreat from you when casualties happene-"
    f "从头到尾都是误会。伤亡发生时，我们正准备从你们面前撤退——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_209926a0:

    # r "Casualties."
    r "伤亡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6417f006:

    # r "So you think all of the lost lives here were just casualties out of nowhere?"
    r "所以你觉得这里死去的所有人，都只是无缘无故的伤亡？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_0d899c36:

    # r "It was your people's doing. Your father and his reckless soldiers' spell crumpled our houses like they were his playthings, must be accidents that people happen to be inside."
    r "这都是你们的人造成的。你父亲和他那些鲁莽的士兵施放的法术，把我们的房子像玩具一样压垮；人们恰好在屋里，当然就只是意外了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_e51d452c:

    # f "We didn't mea-"
    f "我们不是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b7e0ed33:

    # r "Your spells and magicks doesn't work now, so you come here and do what? Beg me to send you more casualties to waste away?"
    r "你们的法术现在不管用了，所以来这里干什么？求我再送些人命给你们糟蹋吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_4de8da1d:

    # f "Someone was behind what happened between us, Rahim. And, I think you know this. My father would never... risk his whole tribe to conquer your village."
    f "我父亲绝不会……拿整个部落去冒险征服你的村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_fcf2d4dd:

    # r "Maybe you don't know your father, then."
    r "那也许你根本不了解你的父亲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_de3ecacb:

    # f "Look, I don't know what you two had talked about, right before the war broke out. But Tevfik would never try to do something like this, to their most loyal ally."
    f "听着，我不知道战争爆发前你们谈过什么。但特夫菲克绝不会对他最忠诚的盟友做这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_cad6a584:

    # f "Rahim, I know it's a difficult situation, and it takes time to consider. We all trusted you, and I trust you to make the wise decision that's the best for both of us."
    f "雷希姆，我知道这很难，也需要时间考虑。我们都信任你，我相信你会做出对我们双方都最好的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_626b4f23:

    # "Furkan turns around with a nod, he turns around slowly until Rahim shouts."
    "弗坎点了点头，转身准备离开；他才刚慢慢转过去，雷希姆就喊住了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_419a8a12:

    # r "...Don't you walk away from me, coward."
    r "……你不许就这么走，懦夫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8efab021:

    # "The chief turns back, with a doubtful glance."
    "酋长迟疑地回过头来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ec3a180d:

    # f "Excuse me?"
    f "你说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2aefffaf:

    # r "You come here all alone, showing me all this grand gesture of peace. Yet you walk away, right after you lay all that responsibility onto me?"
    r "你一个人跑来这里，摆出这么一副和平的姿态。可你把所有责任都推到我身上之后，就打算转身走人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_87577517:

    # r "Is that what you always end up doing, Furkan. Just walk away from all the troubles you've made."
    r "你总是这样，弗坎。把自己惹出来的麻烦全都甩在身后就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_de460849:

    # f "That's not my intention."
    f "我不是这个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_102692ff:

    # "Furkan retorts, crossing his arms as Rahim chides."
    "弗坎抱起双臂回嘴，雷希姆的责骂让他也恼了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_3e3b8830:

    # r "I can't even imagine, how naive are you to think that things could ever go back to the way it was."
    r "我简直无法想象，你竟天真地以为事情还能回到从前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_d2aa24f1:

    # r "Or are you so thick in the head that you want to live with the person who killed your father right there."
    r "还是说你脑子太顽固，竟然想和杀害你父亲的人住在一起？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_d06b153b:

    # "You and Sebas stare at each other in disbelief as Rahim shouts louder and louder."
    "你和塞巴斯难以置信地对视，雷希姆的声音越来越高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_dd6f3625:

    # f "I- I will try, if it means my tribe will thriv-."
    f "我、我会试试，只要这能让我的部落继续繁荣——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f242ebb2:

    # r "For years we have been living through the loss of our loved ones. A-and you come here and tell me that I should try... like you?"
    r "这么多年，我们一直在承受失去亲人的痛苦。可、可你现在跑来告诉我，我应该试试……像你一样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6954ca1f:

    # "It's rare to see Rahim gets, this emotional. His voices are trembling and he's choking in his words."
    "很少见到雷希姆如此情绪化。他的声音在颤抖，说话时几乎哽咽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5476e881:

    # f "We... I just think we should put away our own ambition when it comes to the safety of the tribe."
    f "我的意思是，关系到部落安全时，我们应该放下自己的野心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_a6998ae5:

    # r "Ambition. How charitable, I should just forget about everything that had happened because you did. Because you weren't even there for your father when everything went down."
    r "野心。真是慷慨啊。就因为你做到了，我就该把发生的一切都忘掉？因为事情发生时，你甚至不在你父亲身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_4fbb6662:

    # f "Rahim, I came here to talk- not to dwell over what happened between us."
    f "雷希姆，我来是想谈谈——不是来反复纠缠我们之间发生的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6f3c16d7:

    # r "All I wanted was a peaceful life, and it all went to ruins because you goats were too stubborn to take a hint."
    r "我想要的只是一种平静的生活，却因为你们这些山羊固执得听不进暗示，全都毁了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_361ab74c:

    # f "My apologies, if that is how you feel."
    f "如果你是这么觉得的，我很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6e377da3:

    # f "But I reckon I shall not stay this long."
    f "不过，我想我不该再待下去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_bea5acbc:

    # f "Take care, Rahim."
    f "保重，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2ef8c524:

    # "Furkan turns around once more."
    "弗坎再次转过身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_fb8c2f2a:

    # r "Leave, that's all you know."
    r "走吧。你只会这一件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5b972187:

    # "The streets falls into dead silence as Furkan leaves the village. There is not a sound of footsteps so you assume Rahim is still standing there."
    "弗坎离开村子时，街道陷入死寂。没有脚步声，所以你猜雷希姆还站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_ef42fccc:

    # "You and Sebas are in shock, the lion steps away from the wall soon after."
    "你和塞巴斯都惊呆了。没过多久，那头狮子也从墙边退开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_0f29cad7:

    # s "Damn..."
    s "该死……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_882cff6f:

    # "He whispers, trying to keep it low as you both can still feel the anger of Rahim looming by."
    "他压低声音，尽量不让声音传远，可你们仍能感到雷希姆的怒火在附近翻涌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8795d133:

    # s "That- just happened."
    s "刚才……真的发生了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_4f3b2b66:

    # e "Stop talking."
    e "别说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_60997360:

    # "You shake your head as the both of you get back to work."
    "你摇了摇头，和塞巴斯一起回去工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1e1571bb:

    # e "Should we go check on Rahim?"
    e "我们该去看看雷希姆吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5cdb0e1d:

    # s "Wait it out, roomie. With this loud he's screaming today, he's gonna sew your mouth shut if you're existing within his visible distance."
    s "先等等，室友。他今天喊得这么大声，要是你出现在他眼前，他会把你的嘴缝起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8df9ac1c:

    # "Sebas grins for the while. But he's right, perhaps it'd really be a good idea not to bother Rahim so soon."
    "塞巴斯暂时没再插科打诨，但他说得对：现在就去打扰雷希姆，或许不是个好主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_123a599b:

    # e "Maybe... we should stay here for a while, like what he talked about?"
    e "也许……我们该在这里待一会儿，就像他说的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f740e14b:

    # s "Eh, yeah you're right, roomie. It's between him and Furk."
    s "嗯，你说得对，室友。这是他和弗坎之间的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7b2752b2:

    # "Sebas grins as you two stay put, occasionally you hear Rahim's shout, though it's not loud enough for you to make out what he's saying. And soon Rahim is back."
    "你们俩留在原地。期间偶尔能听见雷希姆的喊声，但声音太小，听不清他在说什么。很快，雷希姆回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_82d1dc8f:

    # r "Y-you two are still here...?"
    r "你们两个还在这里……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_20bf78a6:

    # s "So... shall we contin-"
    s "那……我们继续——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_b461a52b:

    # r "Leave me be, would you?"
    r "别管我，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_8e2701be:

    # "Rahim is completely exhausted. His eyes watering up."
    "雷希姆已经精疲力竭，眼里泛着泪光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_5d4a0355:

    # e "We understand."
    e "我们明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7a89dc01:

    # "You feel he's desperately holding back his breath, his teeth gritting against each other."
    "你感觉他正拼命忍住哽咽，牙关紧咬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_089c7764:

    # r "T-thank you."
    r "谢、谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_88d681a2:

    # "Sebas raises his brows, tugging on his snouts curiously."
    "塞巴斯挑起眉毛，好奇地扯了扯自己的鼻子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_2afb8986:

    # "Without any question, you lead the still confused Sebas out of his house."
    "你没有多问，带着仍然困惑的塞巴斯走出了他的房子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_6bbfd321:

    # s "Uh, that was weird."
    s "呃，这有点奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_0c8c2b2e:

    # e "I- I'm not sure what has happened there."
    e "我、我不确定刚才发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_f3c0c5a6:

    # s "I told you buddy we should've followed Rahim, the mystery is making me go absolutely insane like he does!"
    s "我就说吧，伙计，我们应该跟着雷希姆。这个谜团快把我逼疯了，简直和他一样！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_10d541a5:

    # s "But, uh. Yeah, privacy. I get it, how fucking cool was that."
    s "不过，呃……隐私。我懂。刚才真他妈酷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7a941fb9:

    # s "Anyway, how long were you sitting there, well. Usually Rahim really doesn't like people being sneaky around him."
    s "不过，你刚才坐在那里多久了？雷希姆通常真的很讨厌有人在他附近偷偷摸摸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_9d789091:

    # e "Uh... just a minute. I was wondering if I should knock on the door."
    e "呃……就一分钟。我当时在想要不要敲门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_7eb588a0:

    # s "Hah, fair, fair. I guess he's not really that angry with you anyway, not after what he and Furkan talked about."
    s "哈，有道理，有道理。我猜他其实没那么生你的气——至少在他和弗坎谈过之后不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_1c02d480:

    # s "But wait it out before you go knock on his door again, roomie. With this loud he's screaming today, he's gonna sew your mouth shut if you're existing within his visible distance."
    s "不过，室友，你再去敲门前先等等。他今天喊得这么响，要是你进入他的视线，他准会把你的嘴缝上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Reconciliation_Begin_730d6c80:

    # "Sebas grins for the while. But he's right, perhaps it'd really be a good idea not to bother Rahim soon."
    "塞巴斯咧嘴笑了一会儿。但他说得对，最近还是别去打扰雷希姆为好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_add8d3c4:

    # e "Hey, Rahim. Everything going right... after that day Furkan was here?"
    e "嘿，雷希姆。弗坎来过那天之后……一切还顺利吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_2bea0a2c:

    # r "W-why are you asking."
    r "你、你为什么这么问？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_d35f5c59:

    # e "Uh- I'm just looking out for you, Rahim."
    e "呃——我只是关心你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_9bb72926:

    # "Rahim gives an inquisitive eye, he puts down his needle and stares at you."
    "雷希姆投来探究的目光，放下针，盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_70b46e90:

    # r "You can just sneak outside my house again. That'd make it easier."
    r "你大可以再从我家偷偷溜出去。那样反倒简单些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_eabfa98a:

    # r "Do you? I don't see you ever listening to what I say."
    r "是吗？我可没见你什么时候听过我的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_0ba7071d:

    # r "...yeah. Thanks."
    r "……嗯。谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_66ba7ac0:

    # "You two remain silent for a while as Rahim frowns."
    "你们沉默了片刻，雷希姆皱着眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_eea3820b:

    # "He glances at you for a few more times. One that's more awkward than it needs to be."
    "他又看了你几眼，其中一眼尴尬得有些过头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_61f52e72:

    # r "I... I've been distracting myself with the same thing ever since everything went down."
    r "自那件事之后，我一直靠手上的活计转移注意力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_7203e691:

    # r "Yet all I had in my mind, was reliving that terrible memory take place right in front of me, over and over again."
    r "可我脑子里反复重演的，却只有那段可怕的记忆——它一遍又一遍地发生在我眼前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_54243231:

    # r "I was stuck in the past, and I allowed myself so."
    r "我困在过去，也任由自己一直困在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_ff50f68f:

    # "Rahim looks down in frustration, you try to offer your hand but he waves it away."
    "雷希姆懊恼地低下头。你想伸手安慰他，他却挥手拒绝了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_85e6b1e5:

    # r "Furkan, he was a much better boy than I am. He surrendered his dignity to talk to me, and I... I was the one who ran away."
    r "弗坎……他比我好得多。他放下自己的尊严来和我谈话，可我……我才是逃走的那个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_de14003c:

    # e "What do you mean, Rahim?"
    e "你是什么意思，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_1cddb46d:

    # r "After talking with Furkan, everything was crammed into my head all at once. And all I could do, was to hide myself behind that closed door."
    r "和弗坎谈过之后，所有事情一下子全挤进了我的脑子。我唯一能做的，就是躲在那扇关上的门后面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_22f7ed3b:

    # r "I had been awake the whole night, day, and then night. And the only time I fell asleep, I saw my daughter."
    r "我整整熬过了一个夜晚、一个白天，又一个夜晚。唯一睡着的那一刻，我看见了我的女儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_1e646f76:

    # e "Y-your daughter? Was it... in a dream?"
    e "你、你的女儿？是在……梦里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_b897a495:

    # r "I don't remember it very well. But... I- recall hugging my precious princess right there, I held her tight in the air."
    r "我不太记得了。但……我、我记得自己抱住了我珍爱的公主，把她高高抱在怀里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_8f086346:

    # r "I saw her chuckling, making a silly face. And- I was frozen. I stood there for a long while."
    r "我看见她咯咯笑着，做了个傻乎乎的鬼脸。而我——却僵在原地，站了很久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_8c41d2cb:

    # r "Her features are getting foggy, and I just realised I didn't even recognise what her face looks like."
    r "她的面容越来越模糊，而我这才意识到，我甚至已经认不出她的脸是什么样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_d926d49f:

    # r "One day I'll forget her voice, her face. Or... even her whole existence."
    r "总有一天，我会忘记她的声音、她的脸。或者……甚至忘记她曾经存在过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_4e1598a3:

    # e "Rahim..."
    e "雷希姆..."

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_817d1be7:

    # r "In that dream, she was just in my hand, until whatever happened and she turned into a giant spider, wrapping me there inside of the spiderwebs-"
    r "在那个梦里，她明明还在我手中，随后不知发生了什么，她变成一只巨大的蜘蛛，把我缠进蛛网里——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_445ead9f:

    # "Rahim squints his eyes, his lips curls into a state of sadness."
    "雷希姆眯起眼睛，嘴角牵出悲伤的弧度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_cde013f6:

    # r "Well, I'm starting to talk nonsense now."
    r "好了，我开始胡言乱语了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_a1a9909c:

    # e "No, no. It's a nightmare what you've been going through, I- I really can't compare my experience, but coming to this, whole new place. It's been largely different."
    e "不，不。你经历的一切简直就是一场噩梦。我、我实在没法把自己的经历与你相比；但来到这样一个全新的地方，我看到的一切完全不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_b0c40c73:

    # e "Everyone has been nice all around the place, I can't even imagine you two being in war for each other's head."
    e "这里的每个人都很友善，我根本无法想象你们两个曾经为了彼此的性命而交战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_187ad7c9:

    # e "I remembered... my allfather- the chief of my tribe. He would gather us all around him. I forgot most of what he said... but he has a verse he likes to recite whenever some of us are sad."
    e "我想起了……我的大长老——我们部落的首领。他总会把我们召集到身边。我已经忘了他说的大部分话……但他有一段诗，每当有人难过时，他总喜欢念给我们听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_2b2661df:

    # e "{i}'Like the eternal stars that flicker in the night, let us sparkle with the timeless light.'{/i}"
    e "{i}“如同夜空中闪烁的永恒星辰，让我们以不朽之光熠熠生辉。”{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_e98012e4:

    # e "{i}'The past is a lullaby of memories, but the present is where the undying forces take flight.'{/i}"
    e "{i}“过去是记忆的摇篮曲，而现在才是永恒力量展翅高飞的地方。”{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_c5dfca71:

    # e "I'm not sure if this finds you well- but I guess it left all of us at peace at the time."
    e "不知道这番话对你有没有用——但至少在那时候，它让我们所有人都平静了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_181fb0e3:

    # r "It does. That was a comforting wisdom that I never imagined coming out of your mouth. Thank you, [e]."
    r "有用。真是句令人宽慰的智慧，我从没想过会从你嘴里听到。谢谢你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_74820f9c:

    # r "If anything, a part of me wants to move on with my life, and another part forbids me so."
    r "要说的话，我一部分想继续过自己的生活，另一部分却不允许我这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_949801e2:

    # r "But this is never just about an old bull like me as painful as it would be for me to realise."
    r "不过，这从来不只是我这头老公牛的事，尽管承认这一点让我很痛苦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_e815898b:

    # "You look back up and notice Rahim's sharp glare, it's not as stern as he usually does."
    "你重新抬眼，发现雷希姆正以锐利的目光注视着你，只是那目光没有他往常那么严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_3d32195c:

    # r "Maybe after everything has settled down with your problems, we'll share some more wisdom with your chief."
    r "等你的麻烦都平息下来，也许我们可以和你的首领再交流些智慧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_05eb3a09:

    # "He smiles at you, it's just so rare to see him finally be happy, even if it's just a glimpse."
    "他朝你笑了笑。哪怕只有一瞬，也真难得见他终于露出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_c77151f7:

    # "You indulge in the silence once more, Rahim kneads on his tense forehead, before taking a deep breath."
    "你们又沉默了一会儿。雷希姆揉了揉紧绷的额头，然后深吸一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_33741c33:

    # r "There's just one thing, I've made up my mind."
    r "不过有一件事，我已经想清楚了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_0489cc22:

    # r "I will announce that a voting day is to come soon. It will decide whether we will form an alliance with the goats once more."
    r "我要宣布，投票日很快就会到来。届时将决定我们是否再次与山羊结盟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_c610d578:

    # e "W-wait, Rahim. Are you sure?"
    e "等、等等，雷希姆。你确定吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_13bfb3d0:

    # r "Well, take it as I am not the one to decide the fate of our people. I can't take all that baggages onto my back."
    r "就当我不是那个该替整个族群决定命运的人吧。我不能把所有负担都背在自己身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_91c0e542:

    # r "I have my grudge with them. But there are people like you, you see things more differently than an old bull does."
    r "我确实对他们心怀怨恨。但世上还有像你这样的人，你看事情的角度和我这头老公牛不一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_b46bd4f5:

    # r "You deserve something on your plate, for the better or worse."
    r "无论结果好坏，你都该在这件事上拥有自己的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_40ceff5c:

    # e "I'm glad you turned around, Rahim."
    e "我很高兴你改变了想法，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_31217b1e:

    # r "Don't be so sure we'll ally up with the goats I tell you, and if so, good. I've done my part, Sebas would have no reason to come and bother me once more."
    r "别急着认定我们会和山羊结盟。我只是说，如果真是那样，也好。我该做的已经做了，塞巴斯也就没理由再来烦我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_25decc9f:

    # r "This is a once-and-for-all vote. We'll never talk about this again, alright?"
    r "这是一次彻底了结的投票。我们以后再也不谈这件事了，明白吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_Ready_e2c72058:

    # r "If so, we'll start preparing for the announcement. It should take five days for everyone to make up their mind." nointeract
    r "那就开始准备公告吧。大家还有五天时间考虑清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_Ready_b77ba7a9:

    # e "Ok, I think it's fair. We're ready."
    e "好，我觉得这样很公平。我们准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_Ready_86adcaa5:

    # e "Maybe we still need more time."
    e "也许我们还需要一点时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Quest_Begin_Ready_1ada8197:

    # r "Okay."
    r "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_a02e5f98:

    # r "Good."
    r "很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_f4c0d478:

    # "You follow Rahim out of his hut. Towards the center of the village. A few people gathers, some murmurs."
    "你跟着雷希姆走出小屋，来到村子中央。几个人聚了过来，低声议论着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_bdbff523:

    # r "Ahem."
    r "咳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_aeb2e849:

    # r "Greetings, everyone. Please gather around here, I have something to say."
    r "大家好。请都到这里来，我有话要说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_837d63f1:

    # "More people approach as Rahim stands on the stage, he clears his throat and takes a deep breath."
    "雷希姆站上台后，越来越多的人围了过来。他清了清嗓子，深吸一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_19e0fc30:

    # r "I have not been standing here for, well. Since the last mayor passed away long ago."
    r "我已经很久没有站在这里了——嗯，自从上一任市长多年前去世以后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_c0cd01fc:

    # r "For the past few years, Lusterfield has been living on its own, isolated."
    r "过去几年，乐斯民菲尔德一直独自过活，与世隔绝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_598b4d7f:

    # "The crowd stares curiously, if not with a surprised face."
    "人群好奇地望着他，脸上还带着几分惊讶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_ca76a86c:

    # r "And it was my sole decision. You all had looked up upon me during hard times. You elected me as the leader."
    r "这是我一个人的决定。艰难时期，你们都把希望寄托在我身上，选我做了领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_516c2130:

    # r "But ultimately, I was selfish. And I had lost my way of leading the village to prosperity out of personal vendetta."
    r "但归根结底，我很自私。我因为个人的仇怨，迷失了带领村子走向繁荣的方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_5487af4b:

    # r "So, I suppose it's only appropriate for us to embrace a change."
    r "所以，我想我们是时候接受改变了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_c3521728:

    # r "On [todaydayofweekfromrahimvote!t], we will hold a vote to decide whether we should form an alliance with Goat Tribe once more."
    r "在[todaydayofweekfromrahimvote!t]，我们将举行投票，决定是否再次与山羊部落结盟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_5a7f2833:

    # r "It has been a long time coming, and I can only hope whatever the result will be, both sides of you are satisfied."
    r "这一天迟早会到来。我只希望，无论结果如何，你们双方都能接受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_ca2d6d42:

    # r "Thank you, everyone, and may the spirits bless our endeavors."
    r "谢谢大家。愿诸灵保佑我们的努力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_05025644:

    # "Rahim gives a solemn sigh, and returns to his house without another words."
    "雷希姆庄重地叹了口气，一言不发地回了屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_3c6851d1:

    # "You hear some crowd murmurs, both sides are discussing the result of the vote. Some of them in protest of Rahim's decision."
    "你听见人群低声议论，双方都在讨论投票结果；其中一些人甚至开始抗议雷希姆的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Announcement_01e128d3:

    # "There are 5 days until the vote begins, perhaps you should ask others about their opinions."
    "距离投票开始还有五天，也许你该去问问其他人的想法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_65fb0d94:

    # e "So, what do you think about the vote?"
    e "那么，你对这次投票有什么看法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_65c7f61b:

    # r "The vote I'm holding...? I've already told you what I felt. If I had to decide, there won't be one to begin with."
    r "这场投票？……我已经告诉过你我的感受了。要是由我做决定，根本不会有这场投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_1701de0e:

    # e "But you did decide to hold a vote."
    e "但你确实决定举行投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_93bfdfd4:

    # r "You people's voices sometimes get on my nerve, I just wanted to shut all your mouth up, once and for all."
    r "你们的声音有时真让我恼火。我只是想一劳永逸地让你们全都闭嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_edf195c3:

    # "Rahim says with a monotone, puncturing the fabric with the needle."
    "雷希姆用单调的语气说着，针尖一下下刺穿布料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_87848074:

    # e "Maybe sometimes it's good to take a step back, you know."
    e "有时候退一步也不是什么坏事，你说呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_d1d9383a:

    # r "I took a step back, I took a step back back when the goats come here taking everyone hostag-"
    r "我早就退过一步了——在山羊来到这里、把所有人都当作人质——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_9f604b28:

    # "He suddenly stops mid-sentence, something must be bothering him for ages."
    "他话说到一半突然停住，看来有件事已经困扰他很久了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_a36ea1af:

    # r "Ugh..."
    r "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_76dff6fd:

    # e "Maybe the fact that you changed your mind... is because you never considered them a threat?"
    e "也许你之所以改变主意……是因为你从未把他们视为威胁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_e9db1cbb:

    # "You try to console the bull, but he gives you the grumpy face instead."
    "你试图安慰这头公牛，可他反倒皱起眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_ebedf2cf:

    # r "That's what a part of me wants to believe, but it's not the reality."
    r "那是我心里一部分想相信的事，但现实并非如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_21eb90f4:

    # r "If histories want to repeat itself, I don't want to get in its way again."
    r "如果历史注定重演，我不想再挡在它前面了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_d2cdd83c:

    # e "What changed?"
    e "是什么改变了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_569a4df5:

    # r "Nothing."
    r "没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_3f73a50d:

    # "He says, before you even finished your sentence."
    "你还没说完，他就打断了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_9246b078:

    # e "Really? I don't believe a ruthless bulls like you will suddenly change your mind over night, after what happened with Furkan."
    e "真的？像你这样冷酷的公牛，在弗坎那件事之后，不可能一夜之间突然改变主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_26049733:

    # r "I said Nothing. I will still vote against the goats, if that is what you want to say."
    r "我说了，没什么。如果你想问的是这个，我仍然会投票反对山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_237c8306:

    # r "I am just doing this for the welfare of the village, whatever it means."
    r "我这么做只是为了村子的福祉，无论这究竟意味着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_2461ffd7:

    # "Rahim remains calm, before he shifts his attention back on the cloth."
    "雷希姆神色平静，随后又把注意力转回布料上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_9645b53d:

    # e "O-okay, I guess so."
    e "好、好吧，我想也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_96571dec:

    # "He continues working as you pondering leaving, but suddenly he speaks to you again."
    "你正思索着要不要离开，他继续手里的活，却突然又开口对你说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_7388251e:

    # r "Once the vote is over, come back and see me."
    r "投票结束后，回来见我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Voting_Opinion_4a2cc905:

    # "You nod, before taking your leave."
    "你点了点头，随后告辞离去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_c55795b4:

    # e "Hey, Seb, how do you think about the vote?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯，你对这次投票怎么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_ef4ee862:

    # s "Ha buddy, well. I guess maybe my charm is just so much to handle for Rahim."
    s "哈哈，伙计，我猜我的魅力对雷希姆来说实在太难招架了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_24fdbbfc:

    # s "Look."
    s "看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_aa5a9c7c:

    # "Sebas leans his head forwards, showing you his two blinking eyes."
    "塞巴斯把头往前一探，让你看清他那双不断眨动的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_1b9e1512:

    # s "See, even that old bull's not invulnerable to my persuasion skills on those blinkers."
    s "看吧，就连那头老公牛也挡不住我这双眼睛的说服力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_05e7d16e:

    # e "I was pretty sure the vote wasn't because of you."
    e "我还以为这次投票跟你没关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_6d4540e7:

    # s "Ha, buddy you know me the best, of course! It's Rahim who announced the vote."
    s "哈哈，伙计，也就你最了解我。当然是雷希姆宣布要投票的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_c14757a8:

    # e "Uh-"
    e "呃——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_681446b3:

    # s "And he's letting me organise everything, like a stamp with this lion face here."
    s "他还把所有筹备工作都交给我了——比如用这个狮子脸印章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_60060c8e:

    # "He grins, showing you a box full of stamps with the gleaming eyes."
    "他咧嘴一笑，给你看一盒印章；每一个狮子脸上的眼睛都闪闪发亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_ea51ae1a:

    # s "These precious little chops are from some pledges I got earlier, just repurposed it and added my own pattern."
    s "这些宝贝印章原本是客人拿来抵押的物件，我之前把它们重新利用了一番，还加上了自己的图案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_63b5b01d:

    # "Basically, I've prepared for everyone a paper with two boxes, when the day comes you come here and make a stamp on either box to vote."
    "基本上，我给每个人都准备了一张纸，上面有两个框。到投票那天，你来这里，在其中一个框里盖章投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_7dc23268:

    # e "T-that's very impressive actually."
    e "这、这确实很厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_924c5a5d:

    # s "I know! I'm dreading the day we vote so I can collect papers with a lion face from everyone."
    s "我知道！我都开始发愁投票那天了，好收齐每个人盖下的狮子脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_a22cd23f:

    # e "Ah, so, how will you vote?"
    e "啊，那你会投什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_2d44d1e6:

    # s "Well, ally with the goats of course, trade, let the goats come and visit our shop, that'll probably solve everything."
    s "当然是和山羊结盟。做做生意，让山羊来逛我们的店，这大概就能解决一切了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_48edff0a:

    # e "Did something changed your mind on the goats? You didn't sound too enthusiastic about them the last time we talked."
    e "是什么改变了你对山羊的看法？上次我们谈到他们时，你听起来可没这么热情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_332f4a05:

    # s "Hah, well. I didn't change my mind, I-I just thought it's cool to have more customers, to you know... give us money."
    s "哈哈，我没改变主意。我、我只是觉得多几个顾客挺不错的，你知道……能给我们送钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_4ba1e2e8:

    # s "But my Big Ol' didn't look very happy about it. At least as compared to how I feel, hah."
    s "不过我的大奥利看起来不太高兴。至少，和我的态度比起来是这样，哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_bd274b45:

    # s "Maybe you'd be better off asking him, maybe make him change his mind."
    s "你最好去问问他，说不定还能让他改变主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_aeef7a54:

    # e "Why are you not asking?"
    e "你怎么不自己问？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_050e15f9:

    # s "I did! But Ole is a stubborn lizard, you know. Once he believes in something, he really does stuck with it all the way through."
    s "我问过了！可奥利是条顽固的蜥蜴，你知道的。他一旦认定了什么，就会一路坚持到底。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_c27b89ac:

    # e "Oh, so your presuasion skills on those blinkers aren't working on Ole?"
    e "哦，所以你那套眨眼说服术对奥利不起作用？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_fc3e2629:

    # s "No way, how can my blinkers not work? I know they'd already worked on you, heh."
    s "怎么可能？我这套眨眼功夫怎么会不管用？我知道它已经对你起效了，嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Opinion_e7ad92f4:

    # "Sebas chuckles as he whistles playfully."
    "塞巴斯一边俏皮地吹着口哨，一边咯咯笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_efef9743:

    # e "Hey, Lothar, how do you think about the vote."
    e "嘿，洛萨尔，你对这次投票怎么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_664a3b97:

    # l "Bad, disciple. It's bad. What was Rahim even thinking, after so much I've proven that the goats are evil incarnation of cult following brainless magical dirtball. I can't believe he's still choosing to not just trust them, but ally?"
    l "糟糕，门徒。糟糕透顶。雷希姆到底在想什么？我已经证明过，山羊就是邪教的邪恶化身，追随一团没脑子的魔法泥球。我真不敢相信，他居然不只是选择相信他们，还要和他们结盟？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_8e8d0926:

    # e "He's giving all of us an option, Lothar. I think he won't really vote for the goats himself."
    e "他只是给了大家一个选择，洛萨尔。我觉得他自己不会投山羊的票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_1d99fb1d:

    # l "The bull's disrespecting the hero's opinion once again. Afterall, I eliminated that whole threat for him."
    l "那头公牛又一次不尊重英雄的意见。毕竟，是我替他消除了那场威胁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_7613f00b:

    # l "I guess people forgets what was done to them too easily, huh?"
    l "看来人们太容易忘记别人为他们做过什么了，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_3b683483:

    # e "So... you're voting against it?"
    e "所以……你会投反对票？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_49715e3c:

    # l "Yeah. Are you not?"
    l "是啊。你不投吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_32d7e825:

    # l "Are you asking a stupid question or trying to rile me up again, disciple."
    l "你是在问蠢问题，还是又想惹我生气，门徒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_880bf075:

    # "He glances at you for a moment, before averting his gaze."
    "他看了你一会儿，随后移开视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_271f7bc9:

    # l "Either way, I've told Amble and Jog what to do already, there's no way the goat sympathizers can win this one."
    l "不管怎么说，我已经告诉安布和乔格该怎么做了。那些山羊同情者不可能赢下这次投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_209707be:

    # e "Uh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Opinion_ed9922da:

    # l "There's no way I tell you, [e]. And don't let me see you vote otherwise."
    l "我才不会告诉你该怎么投，[e]。别让我看见你投了另一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Ask_Cement_50d15ed8:

    # e "What do I need for the bridge again?"
    e "桥还需要哪些材料来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Ask_Cement_58ae9b24:

    # a "20 wooden logs, and three buckets of mortar, known as masonry fix."
    a "20根原木，还有三桶砂浆——也就是砌筑修补料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Ask_Cement_00688bc9:

    # a "So, we'll need some irons, some clays, some slate rocks."
    a "所以，我们还需要一些铁、黏土和板岩。"

