translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_1edb25b1:

    # o "We'll need more wood to support, probably tighten the strings up a little more."
    o "我们需要更多木头来支撑 可能还要把绳子绑紧一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_4f7f8fdd:

    # e "So, it should be higher than [ole_voting_wood_num]."
    e "因此，它应该高于[ole_voting_wood_num]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_77d06eb9:

    # o "I think the wood is built perfectly, there's not much more a problem here, but..."
    o "我认为木头的构造很完美，这里没有太多的问题，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_3cb1c4ab:

    # "You nod as he turns to the glistening strings."
    "当他转向闪闪发光的弦时你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_dc64ff72:

    # o "Maybe there shouldn't be too much strings here, the spacing between them are too crammed."
    o "也许这里不应该有太多的绳子，它们之间的间距太短了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_ba5561bd:

    # "He plays the harp once more, you can hear a lot of echoes meshing together."
    "他再弹一次竖琴 你就能听到很多回声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_35ded832:

    # o "Yep, definitely a problem. Unless the supplier wants to strum ten chords at once, I think we should lower than the number of strings here."
    o "是的，绝对是个问题 除非供应商想同时 修十根和弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_f014090f:

    # e "So, it should be lower than [ole_voting_string_num]."
    e "因此，它应该低于[ole_voting_string_num]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_9852da37:

    # o "I think the strings are too sparse, the air might affect how the sound turns out."
    o "我觉得弦太少了 空气可能会影响声音的形成。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_55be9aa9:

    # e "So, it should be higher than [ole_voting_string_num]."
    e "因此，它应该高于[ole_voting_string_num]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_adc3e2cf:

    # "He nods."
    "他点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_c4177371:

    # o "However, the strings are perfect as it seems."
    o "然而，条件似乎完美无缺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_64efcb47:

    # e "Well... that was the last gem I have."
    e "嗯…… 那是我最后的宝石了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_f5755b1a:

    # o "It's all good. The harp is useable, and I sort of start to understand why the supplier insisted on Gwyddyon making a harp like this."
    o "这很好。竖琴是有用的，我开始理解为什么供应商坚持要格维迪翁 做这样一个竖琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_e6567982:

    # o "There were a lot of nuances and nitty-gritty hidden in the building of a harp, I was even pleasantly surprised you can make one so quickly."
    o "在竖琴的建筑里 隐藏着很多细微的细微差别和微小的刺痛，我甚至感到很惊讶你能这么快就造出一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_2a0f4d66:

    # e "I did, but it wasn't too perfect and I've wasted your gems."
    e "我做到了，但它不是太完美 我浪费了你的宝石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_938016a7:

    # o "Hah, it's all good. Regardless of how the meeting goes, I think I've learnt a lot from this, from both the books, and you."
    o "不管会议如何进行，我想我从中学到了很多东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_45def9c1:

    # e "Really? I didn't think I've done that much."
    e "真的吗 我没想到我做过那么多事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_95a90b46:

    # o "Yes, you've got my vote, kiddo."
    o "是的，你得到了我的投票，孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_83d62a5a:

    # e "Thank you so much, Ole."
    e "非常感谢你,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_fa1664f4:

    # "He scruffles your hair as he packs away the harp."
    "他把竖琴打掉的时候 弄脏了你的头发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_b2061764:

    # e "Are you not going t-"
    e "你难道不打算——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_f114573b:

    # o "Here's the rewards for your help. Be sure to spend them wisely."
    o "这是给你的帮助的回报 一定要明智地花掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_a9587ebb:

    # o "Oh, the harp. I'm putting it away. It's not as wise to present up a subpar harp to someone who didn't ask for that."
    o "哦，竖琴，我把它收起来 向一个没有要求的人 展示一个地下竖琴是不明智的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_f0e4decb:

    # e "Aw..."
    e "Aw……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_712bc4e6:

    # o "Don't worry, kiddo. With this one, maybe I'll learn to play some Harp for myself once in a while."
    o "别担心 孩子 有了这个 我偶尔会自己学哈普。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_b261742b:

    # "He speaks softly, patting your shoulder for a few times."
    "轻轻说话 拍拍你的肩膀好几次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_aa39877a:

    # msg "You received 500 gold from Ole."
    msg "你从奥利收到500金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_a17607b6:

    # e "Alright, I got it. I'll adjust the number."
    e "好吧，我明白了，我会调整号码的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_eaa7fd1a:

    # o "Wait, one second."
    o "等一下，等一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_041af2d2:

    # "Ole holds his harp and suddenly demolishing it into different pieces of Elderwood and [ole_voting_string_name]."
    "奥利拿着他的竖琴 突然把它拆成 不同的旧木和[ole_voting_string_name]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_3ee57311:

    # e "Wait, how did you do that?"
    e "等等，你怎么做到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_9260ed9f:

    # "He hands you the remaining materials as the resonator gem inside is easily shattered."
    "他把剩下的材料交给你 因为里面的共振器宝石很容易粉碎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_cea0ac98:

    # o "Nothing fancy, these materials are just reuseable."
    o "没有什么花哨的，这些材料只是可以再利用的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_806c6d6d:

    # e "A-alright, thank you, Ole."
    e "A对，谢谢你，欧里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Testing_Harp_c7d9b0f1:

    # "Ole waves at you as he walks out of the door."
    "他走出门时向你挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Ask_Where_Ole_17c91927:

    # e "Hey, Seb. Where's Ole?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯，奥利在哪？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Ask_Where_Ole_5a734a4f:

    # s "Uh, going on a meeting with Gwyddyon, that's what he told me. He's coming back late tonight though."
    s "呃，他告诉我自己要去和格威迪恩开会。不过他今晚会很晚才回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Ask_Where_Ole_f69c2ce7:

    # s "Roomie, I think he's bringing a Harp over there, my big ole Ole's playing music now, haha."
    s "室友,我想他带了个哈普人过来 我的大乐手奥利现在在演奏音乐,哈哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_9b994022:

    # e "Should we go now?"
    e "我们该走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_a41f01fb:

    # o "Yes well, I've got everything ready, hopefully we won't bother the bard too much."
    o "是的，我已经准备好一切了 希望我们不会太麻烦了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_2bfdc802:

    # "You nod as Ole waves to Sebas, who's sitting on the counter rather boredly."
    "你点头像奥利向塞巴斯的波浪, 他坐在柜台上相当无聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_92980d45:

    # "And soon, you arrive to Nocturnal Trunk, Cane walks up swiftly to greet the both of you."
    "很快,你来到夜之龙 凯恩迅速走来迎接你们俩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_097d2399:

    # c "Hiya, rare pair to see 'ere, anything I can help?"
    c "嗨，难得的一对看\"ere，有什么我能帮忙的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_4eed85a5:

    # o "Mhm... may I ask if Pirkka the bard is here?"
    o "嗯…… 我能问一下 酒吧的皮尔卡是否在这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_9d6d045f:

    # c "Hah, do I look like his caretaker or somethin', caus' that'll probably be a better earning job than working 'ere."
    c "哈，我看起来像他的看管者吗？原因，这也许比工作更赚钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_75b8f97c:

    # c "Did yer two lads hear how much fuzz that minstrel's causing here? Haha, business' been better than ever."
    c "两个小伙子有没有听说 雀斑鸟在这里造成的毛发有多模糊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_1ee73411:

    # c "Well, 'nough of the ol' blabbering, m' lads. He's right upstairs, yer gonna hear him soon enough."
    c "他正在楼上，很快会听到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_2c2197b7:

    # o "Thank you, Cane."
    o "谢谢你,凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_022fe633:

    # "The tavernkeeper smiles as he returns to scrub the tankards with his towels."
    "酒馆管理员在回来用毛巾擦油箱时笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_7bb599b9:

    # "As soon as you walk upstairs, you spot Pirkka near the fireplace, entertaining a small crowd with his lively tunes."
    "你一上楼 就会在壁炉附近发现皮尔卡 用他那热闹的曲子招待一小群人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_80dba057:

    # p "Well met, m' friends! What brings you to my corner of the world today?"
    p "朋友们，今天你们怎么来到我这个角落？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_caff3fa5:

    # p "Corner being, the generous Cane's newly refurbished floor. I'm slowly gettin' to love this tavern."
    p "拐角的是,宽宏大度的凯恩人刚装修的地板 我慢慢地开始喜欢这间酒馆了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_083e86a8:

    # p "Though, everyone's been talking about the alliance accord, so I might as well, strum {i}a chord{/i} on my lute."
    p "虽然大家都在谈论联盟协议 所以我也不妨 在我的润滑剂上 摆出{i}a和弦{/i}。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_43180432:

    # "His jokes are corny as always, but nonetheless you still laughed wholeheartedly with Pirkka."
    "他的笑话和往常一样俗气 但你仍然全心全意地嘲笑皮卡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_50bd3503:

    # p "So... how may I help you?"
    p "那么…… 有什么可以帮你的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_193f90e7:

    # e "We're looking to ask some question about a harp, and we've heard you might be able to help."
    e "我们想问些关于竖琴的问题 听说你也许能帮上忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_1f45e416:

    # o "We thought your musical expertise might come in handy."
    o "我们以为你的音乐专家会派上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_942e7b13:

    # "Pirkka's eyes light up with excitement, and he sets his lute aside."
    "皮尔卡的双眼闪耀着兴奋的光芒 他把月光抛在一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_71c9509b:

    # p "A harp, ye say? 'Tis but a noble instrument, indeed. As what we say among the minstrels, a good harp befits a soul in search of beauty and harmony."
    p "你说:这是一件高贵的功过簿，我们用它做薄荷糖，一个美的功过簿，是一件优美的功过簿，是一件善事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_395d28dc:

    # p "Well, I {i}harp-pen{/i} to know some gists of making these fine instruments, but {i}string{/i} me along, what will be the story of this harp." nointeract
    p "嗯，我对制作这些精美乐器的窍门{i}略知一二{/i}，但{i}先说说吧{/i}：这把竖琴究竟有什么来头？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_a1364fe4:

    # e "Well, I actually wanted to learn to play harp, but there's nothing like that anywhere else."
    e "其实我其实想学弹琴 但别处都没什么比这更棒的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_7c013f5d:

    # "Ole stutters as he glances at you, probably a little shocked as you speak."
    "奥利在看着你时会口吃 可能你说话时会有点震惊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_f2b711aa:

    # p "Admittedly, I'm not an expert on harp, I've been known to strum a harp or two in my time. Perhaps you'll one day sing a great song with me."
    p "诚然，我不是竖琴专家，我曾经知道 我曾经唱过一两首竖琴，也许有一天你会和我一起唱一首伟大的歌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_f62ee477:

    # e "Ole's supplier for his shop wanted a harp, it's a long story actually."
    e "奥利的店铺供应商想要竖琴 其实说来话长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_162fb847:

    # p "What a strange requirement for your supplier, after all, a harp isn't something an ordinary person might be interested in."
    p "毕竟对于你的供应商来说 竖琴并不是普通人感兴趣的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_2a9d1612:

    # o "Of course. That's why we thought of asking you."
    o "当然，所以我们才想问你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_aa9b3c23:

    # "You remain silent and wait for Ole to speak."
    "你保持沉默,等待奥利说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_6e8c1009:

    # o "It's kind of embarrassing to say, but it's for a friend who's really into harp."
    o "说起来有点尴尬，但对于一个真正喜欢竖琴的朋友来说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_e7788625:

    # p "Oooh, a friend? Someone significant?"
    p "朋友 重要人物吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_586d0162:

    # o "Can't say if he's significant enough by your standard, but can you help us make one?"
    o "不能说他是否足够重要 以你的标准，但你能帮我们做一个吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_f4104472:

    # "Pirkka chuckles softly and nods, his fingers tapping a gentle rhythm on his knee."
    "轻轻地笑着点头 他的手指在膝盖上 轻轻地拍动了节奏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_1c5f5990:

    # p "It's a certain surprising development since the last time we met, Misters. But I can feel we'll mesh together perfectly."
    p "这是自上次我们相遇以来的一个令人惊讶的发展，先生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_067402f7:

    # p "Crafting a harp is like coaxing music from the heart of the wood itself, now, tell me, what kind of harp are you looking to create?"
    p "铸造竖琴就像从木头的心脏里 调出音乐，现在，告诉我，告诉我，你想创造什么样的竖琴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_c8aefa00:

    # o "Just one that you think is perfect, we're not experienced enough to pinpoint which kind suits the best."
    o "只是一个你认为完美的，我们没有足够的经验 来确定哪种类型适合最好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_f2c67b57:

    # p "Aye, crafting a harp requires patience and a keen eye for detail. The wood must be chosen with care, resonating with the melodies that lie within."
    p "雕刻竖琴需要耐心和敏锐的洞察力。必须谨慎地选择木柴，与里面的旋律相呼应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_76268427:

    # p "And the strings… ah, the strings are like the very threads of fate, binding the instrument to the soul of the musician."
    p "弦…… 啊，弦就像命运的线条 将乐器绑在音乐家的灵魂上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_5c59320a:

    # p "Different materials weaves together to make for music in different tones. Are you sure {i}any{/i} materials will suit you?"
    p "不同材料交织在一起，会产生不同音色。你确定{i}任何{/i}材料都适合自己吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_f7f7e311:

    # o "Well, we don't have all materials in the world, but here's the materials we have."
    o "世界上没有所有的材料 但这是我们所拥有的材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_02bdf770:

    # "Ole hands Pirkka the catalogue he wrote down a while ago, containing all materials that the supplier sells to Gwyddyon."
    "奥利把自己之前记下的目录递给皮尔卡，里面列有供货商卖给格威迪恩的所有材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_6772e35b:

    # "Pirkka leans forward, his expression thoughtful, as if pondering the possibilty of each combination."
    "皮尔卡 向前倾斜，他的表情深思熟虑，好像在思考每种组合的概率一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_11a87d38:

    # p "Crystal strings... moonstones, elderwood... enchanted pearls?"
    p "水晶弦 月石 长木 魔法珍珠？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_30794f26:

    # p "These are... some exotic materials you have there, Ole."
    p "这是... 你那里的一些异国素材,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_0f8a66c5:

    # p "I'd suggest you use the crystal strings, some people might use silk or nylon but they're not easily tuned for a mellow and warm sound."
    p "我建议你用晶晶弦 有些人可能用丝丝或尼龙 但很难调出 温柔和温暖的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_57d4dbe4:

    # p "Elderwood can provide a rich sound and reverb for the harp, it can be tergid enough to support these strings, oak will suffice if you can't find enough elderwood."
    p "长木能为竖琴提供丰富的声音和回响，它可以被放大到足以支持这些弦，橡木足够，如果你找不到足够的长木。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_9a9b7900:

    # p "You'll need some small resonator gems also, that'll vibrate upon the lateral side of the harp."
    p "你还需要一些小的共振器宝石 可以在竖琴的侧面振动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_2bddeba6:

    # p "These are the basic materials you'll need for a traditional harp, well, if you're not looking for anything too fancy."
    p "这些是基本材料 你需要一个传统的竖琴，如果你不寻找任何 过于奢侈的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_3229cfd4:

    # o "What about the numbers? Can you help us figure out how many of these materials we need?"
    o "那数字呢 你能帮我们弄清楚我们需要多少材料吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_460a5144:

    # "Pirkka ponders for a moment, before he asks for Ole's pen and drawings on the catalogue Ole gave him."
    "皮尔卡在问奥利的笔和奥利给他的目录图纸前 思考了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_70dae1a9:

    # "With a couple of strokes, he drew a small harp, and begins counting how many strings he has drawn."
    "他画了一把小竖琴 开始计算他画了多少弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_8a45e2eb:

    # p "These are the general numbers that'll fit your harp."
    p "这些是适合你竖琴的普通数字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_44f5c5ef:

    # e "Thank you, Pirkka, for the advice."
    e "谢谢你，皮尔卡，你的建议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_448ceb4e:

    # p "'Tis my pleasure to assist, dear friends. After all, you've been very helpful in retrieving my dear prose."
    p "亲爱的朋友们，我很乐意协助你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_19f40b64:

    # p "And I'd have loved a better deal than what we had the other day, well. Consider it a lesson learned."
    p "我本来喜欢比前几天更好的交易 把它当成教训。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_24bb44c3:

    # p "I've even written songs about our story, it's a memorable ones, but nonetheless fantastic."
    p "我甚至写过关于我们故事的歌，是一个难忘的故事，但无论如何，还是很棒的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_d08eb6c8:

    # o "Thank you so much, Pirkka. I'm sorry for both your troubles the first time we met. May this compensates for your favour."
    o "非常感谢，皮尔卡，很抱歉，我们第一次见面时 两次惹麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_362994d3:

    # "Ole hands Pirkka a pouch of gold, but he simply rejects and waves the bag away."
    "奥利手 皮尔卡 一袋金子 但他只是拒绝 挥动袋子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_90a2fd0e:

    # p "You're pulling on my heartstring on this one, but no. Consider it my thanks for the prose, they're one of the few things in this land that golds cannot buy."
    p "你让我心烦意乱，但是没有，就当感谢我的传言吧，他们是这块黄金买不到的土地上的少数东西之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_dbd96f4d:

    # "Pirkka smiles as Ole puts away the gold."
    "奥利把金子扔掉后 皮尔卡的笑容也随之而来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_2734e632:

    # o "Well, you're leaving me restless, Pirkka. How else can I repay you?"
    o "你让我焦躁不安，皮尔卡 不然我怎么报答你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_6120d6d0:

    # p "How about, you start spending some times of your days to come take a seat, I'll play you a nice song."
    p "怎么样，你开始花一些时间 你的日子来坐下，我会弹一首好歌给你听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_4f7c9bff:

    # p "I'd like to get to know some friends around the village. And both of you are worth knowing more, might I say."
    p "我想认识几个村里的朋友 你们俩都值得多了解一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_4d390c88:

    # o "I don't come to the Tavern too often, but if that's what floats your boat, I'm down."
    o "我不常来酒馆 但如果这就是你船上的漂浮物 我下来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_9e280f00:

    # e "Me too."
    e "我也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_3cfda64c:

    # "Pirkka picks up his lute again, and strungs a few chords."
    "皮尔卡又拿起他的润滑油 并绑了几根和弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_7cc53d79:

    # p "May your hands craft a harp that weaves dreams into melodies, and may the muse bless your efforts."
    p "愿你们的手搭配一把竖琴，将梦想编成旋律，愿穆斯保佑你们的努力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_b90c3af0:

    # "With his soft voice echoing in your ears, you and Ole bid farewell to Pirkka."
    "你和欧莉向皮尔卡告别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_3426b0a0:

    # e "Ole, what should we do now?"
    e "奥利，我们现在该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_7afadd9b:

    # o "Gathering materials, of course. You'll just need to buy the silk and elderwood from Gwyddyon's shop. Take a look at the numbers..."
    o "当然，你只需要从格维迪顿的店里买丝绸和长木。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_5a10b6ad:

    # o "And I'll take care of the resonator gems, I don't think Gwyd sells them directly so I'll have to source from other places."
    o "我会处理那些共鸣宝石，我不认为Gwyd直接卖掉它们，所以我得从别的地方来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_ba361594:

    # o "But that's the plan. Luckily Pirkka gave us the exact numbers we need."
    o "但这就是计划。幸好皮尔卡给了我们所需的准确数字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_5d8c3c27:

    # e "Yeah, he's very helpful."
    e "是的，他很有帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_7777ed43:

    # o "Mhmm... I didn't expect him to ask us to listen to his songs exactly, I'm not one for music."
    o "我没想到他会要求我们 听他的歌，我不喜欢音乐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_9c56d9c5:

    # e "Well, maybe you'll grow to love it, I think he sings very well."
    e "也许你会爱上它 我觉得他唱歌唱得很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_9353cdc0:

    # o "That I don't doubt, mhmm."
    o "我毫不怀疑，Mmmh。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_0591073e:

    # "Ole raises his head once more, his scaled hand lands onto your shoulder with a certain weight."
    "奥利再次抬起他的头 他的手伸到肩膀上 用一定的重量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_43178b74:

    # o "I'm so sorry for getting you between all of these, after getting the harp done, I'll handle everything from here."
    o "我很抱歉让你介于所有这些之间 完成竖琴后 我会处理这里的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_e7c5b323:

    # e "We're in this together, don't we? You can always count on me if you need anything."
    e "我们在一起，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_dfd68bae:

    # "He chuckles, perhaps Ole didn't think that as the helper he had always been, one day he'd get someone by his side."
    "他笑着说，也许奥利不认为 作为他一直以来的帮手 有一天他会找人陪着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_59823d02:

    # "Maybe it's been a while since he's got this feeling, the same as you do."
    "也许他很久没有这种感觉了 和你一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_b036720c:

    # "Right now, everything's quiet and serene, but perhaps that's what it takes for you to fall for someone like that..."
    "现在，一切都平静宁静 但也许这就是你爱上那种人的原因……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_79d12e5d:

    # "Your heart pumps faster and faster, just as you see your own reflection in his eyes, there were so much things you want to say, all emotion scatters around your head, Appreciation, admiration, embarrassment... nervousness, love..."
    "你的心跳越来越快。你从他的眼中看见自己的倒影；有太多话想说，感情在脑海中纷乱交织：感激、仰慕、羞涩……紧张、爱意……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_6b1f361e:

    # "Ole's face blushes red, his hand hovers from your shoulder for quite a moment before he turns around."
    "奥利的脸红红，手从你肩膀上晃了一阵子 之后他转过身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_53ec325c:

    # o "I-..."
    o "我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_3ec98b24:

    # "Almost by instinct, your hand reaches out to his back, and he stops for a moment."
    "几乎凭直觉，你的手伸到他的背上，他停下来了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_6554b1b0:

    # e "I'll... see you back home."
    e "我会…… 回家后看到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_53cd22cb:

    # o "Y-yes."
    o "是、是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_7430e258:

    # "You can almost hear Ole gulping, before he walks away slowly."
    "你几乎能听到奥利的口供 在他慢慢走之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_0a3f2310:

    # o "That I don't doubt, kiddo."
    o "我毫不怀疑，孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_1c0b723a:

    # "He raises his palm and pinches onto your cheeks."
    "他抬起手掌，捏住你的脸颊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_ae8a8ecd:

    # e "Ouch... Do you really need to do that?"
    e "你真的要这么做吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_fd53145e:

    # o "No. See you back in the shop."
    o "不。在店里见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Asking_Pirkka_34851145:

    # "He turns around slowly, and returns to the shop."
    "他慢慢转过身 回到店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Report_Pirkka_bc01ed4f:

    # e "Hey, I've got the materials you need, Ole."
    e "我有你需要的材料 奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Report_Pirkka_99eade41:

    # o "Oh, good. Then hold this resonator gem. I found it around the storage in our shop."
    o "哦，很好，然后拿着这个共鸣宝石，我在店里仓库附近找到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Report_Pirkka_2284cff2:

    # o "I reckon according to Pirkka, we can build a Harp, with this gem and the materials you have."
    o "我想根据皮尔卡的说法 我们可以用这宝石和材料 来建造哈普。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Report_Pirkka_3208cf7a:

    # "You nod, and take the gem from Ole's scaled hand."
    "你点头 从奥利的手上拿宝石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Report_Pirkka_16cbc0c9:

    # e "Thank you, Ole."
    e "谢谢你,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Report_Pirkka_cd844a59:

    # o "Good luck!"
    o "祝你好运！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_ceeb732b:

    # o "Hmmph..."
    o "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_c095a4c6:

    # "Ole handles the harp, adjusting the sound as it plays, he seems satisfied, if not surprised as everything so far has gone so well."
    "奥利手持竖琴，调整音响的弹奏，他似乎感到满意，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_ff87d755:

    # "If it's not for living with him for so long, you'd think he has had decades of experience on musical instruments, not hours."
    "如果不是因为和他住这么久 你就会认为他有几十年的乐器经验 不是小时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_8aec5858:

    # o "Oh, that's good. The sound is just right."
    o "哦，那很好，声音很正确。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_386c5c1b:

    # "He flings the strings for a few more times."
    "他又把绳子开了几次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_31239bca:

    # o "This is just perfect. I'll present this to the supplier later."
    o "这太完美了，我晚点把这个交给供应商。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_aa183112:

    # e "You seem so much more experienced than Seb. Why aren't you the one on the counter."
    e "你似乎比塞巴斯经验丰富，为什么不在柜台的不是你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_91858872:

    # o "Don't worry, I'm always watching over his back. And he's one talented pawnbroker too."
    o "别担心，我总是看着他的背 他也是个有天赋的当铺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_8ed5be1c:

    # o "Sometimes, being good with your brain doesn't always translate well with getting what your customers want."
    o "有时候，做你的大脑好 并不总是好翻译 得到你的客户想要的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_c0445711:

    # o "And sometimes a good heart and a good mouth gets you more money than if you play it straight."
    o "有时候，善良的心和善良的嘴 让你赚的钱比你打的还多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_40fd30de:

    # o "Just know that it doesn't always mean either side is more deserving. I'd like to think of us as two opposite sides that complements each other nicely."
    o "只要知道这并不总是意味着双方都更值得。我想把我们看作是两个对立的两面，彼此相辅相成。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_9a268746:

    # e "Damn, am I the third wheel here?"
    e "该死，我是这里的第三轮吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_1f60fcbb:

    # o "No-no! I don't mean that. I think you're the one in the middle, always pulling everyone together a little closer to each other, and... to you."
    o "不，我不是那个意思，我想你是中间那个，总是把大家拉在一起，互相靠近一点，然后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_e7b87fbc:

    # e "Haha, stop teasing me, Ole."
    e "哈哈,别取笑我,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_91a64b70:

    # o "You've always seemed to have that invisible string in your hand."
    o "你手上总是有那条隐形的绳子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_44a1e114:

    # o "The first day you woke up, you've got Seb entranced, going crazy over seeing you. And then Lothar suddenly had almost like an obsession over you."
    o "你醒来的第一天，你已经得到了塞布进入，疯狂地看到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_c49e6a17:

    # o "And now, after so many days have passed, even Rahim, a stoic, withdrawn guy. Suddenly he flipped everything around and gave us a ballot to vote for the one he hated the most?"
    o "现在,在过了这么多天之后,即使是雷希姆,他也是个被推翻的老家伙。 突然他翻翻了所有东西,给了我们一张选票来投票支持他最讨厌的那个?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_19c9bb79:

    # "He stares forwards, mindlessly plucking his finger onto the soft strings. The sound was terrible, but he doesn't even seem to be aware."
    "他向前看，毫不留情地把手指伸到软弦上。声音很可怕，但他似乎并不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_aafc24ce:

    # e "I didn't even realise that."
    e "我甚至没有意识到这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_765530ee:

    # o "Just bit by bit, the village changed ever since you live under our roof. Even if it's so small, it's the first time I've felt, that there's a bright future ahead of us."
    o "村落从你住在我们屋檐下以来就变了，即使它这么小，这是我第一次感觉到，我们面前的未来是光明的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_832ca67b:

    # "He takes a pause to lean forward, your snout is so close to him you feel they're gonna touch anytime soon."
    "他停下来往前倾斜 你的鼻子离他太近了 你觉得他们很快就会碰他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_0ea1a81f:

    # "His hand reaches towards your direction, and slowly climbs onto yours as he nudges against you."
    "他的手伸向你的方向 慢慢地爬到你的身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_5f2e0907:

    # o "That time I was sick, I can feel you there."
    o "当我生病的时候 我能感觉到你在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_acfc74e4:

    # e "M-me?"
    e "M-me？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_3b231a19:

    # o "It was the first time someone took a hold of me, it felt like such a shock when you wiped away my sweat."
    o "这是第一次有人抓住我，感觉如此震惊 当你擦去我的汗水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_69d444bd:

    # o "Well, it wasn't how I imagined you'd see me... without clothes."
    o "我没想到你会看见我…… 没有衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_422158fc:

    # e "It's not like I haven't seen cock and slits before."
    e "我又不是没看过鸡巴和剪片。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_ed77ab56:

    # o "Ha, you're right."
    o "哈，你说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_a2f1953f:

    # "His glances are so... loving, you wish you have the courage to reach forward and kiss him. But both of you aren't taking the chance."
    "他的眼睛是如此……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_38ec9b01:

    # o "So... how did you pull that off?"
    o "那么……你怎么做到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_d7bf05f9:

    # e "Hmm?"
    e "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_9629edf1:

    # o "The strings."
    o "字符串。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_572adf60:

    # "Ole sits beside you, he turns his head towards your face unbelievably close."
    "奥利坐在你旁边 他把头朝你的脸朝着 难以置信地靠近你的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_b55d8c14:

    # e "I... I just tried my best to help people. Anyone, really. I liked being around you a lot."
    e "我只是尽力帮助别人 任何人，真的，我很喜欢在你身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_a2ab3aba:

    # o "Heh, I meant crafting the harp."
    o "嘿，我的意思是 设计竖琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_1aff58f1:

    # e "Hey! Are you teasing again?"
    e "嘿！你又在开玩笑吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_5ed850f2:

    # o "Nope."
    o "没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_f78aa27e:

    # "Ole stands up swiftly, his tail softly brushes against your legs."
    "奥利迅速站起来 他的尾巴轻轻地 刷在你的腿上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_2ebd7ce2:

    # o "Thank you so much for the Harp. I'll bring that to the meeting, hopefully I can impress the supplier."
    o "非常感谢哈普，我会带去开会 希望我能给供应商留下深刻印象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_36c29c08:

    # o "Thank you and the bard for the Harp. I'll bring that to the meeting, hopefully I can impress the supplier."
    o "谢谢你和哈普酒馆的酒保 我会带去开会 希望我能给供应商留下深刻印象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_a1bbef71:

    # e "Ole."
    e "奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_3de4efc4:

    # o "If we can do that, it'll give me a much higher leverages against Gwyd. Then, well. We can start talking about price."
    o "如果能做到这一点，我就能在对付格威迪恩时占据更大优势。然后，我们就可以开始谈价格了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_376b9b3d:

    # e "Ole!"
    e "奥利！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_72a6f257:

    # "You hear a soft sigh as you shout."
    "你喊叫时听到轻轻的叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_72f43588:

    # o "It's be fun hanging out with you, kiddo. You've impressed me everytime we're together, here's the reward for you."
    o "每次我们在一起，你都给我留下深刻印象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_236b2b47:

    # e "W-wait! Can you at least tell me what you were thinking about?"
    e "等等，你能至少告诉我你在想什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_7c2acaec:

    # "Ole takes another pause as he stares at you, almost frozen in place, just pondering something."
    "奥利在盯着你的时候又暂停了一段时间 几乎冻结在原地 思考着一些事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_256da502:

    # o "Nothing."
    o "没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_dc393b25:

    # "He quickly picks up the harp and hops onto the stairs, leaving you staring into the wall."
    "他很快抬起竖琴 跳上楼梯 让你盯着墙看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_495da60e:

    # o "It's true! I think you're a great newcomer- I shouldn't say that, you're already one of us."
    o "是真的，我觉得你是一个伟大的新来者 我不该说，你已经是我们的一员了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_96e6bfdd:

    # e "R-really?"
    e "真、真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_d46a7f20:

    # o "Yes, there's a certain magic to you that whatever you do, it seems people suddenly forget all anger and frustration, like a hot spa."
    o "是的，有一定的魔法给你，不管你做什么，似乎人们突然忘记了所有的愤怒和沮丧，像热温泉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_6da06074:

    # e "If I'm that good... Why don't I have an effect on you?"
    e "如果我有那么好，为什么不对你产生影响？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_0a93b630:

    # o "Ha..."
    o "哈……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_6d2ab0df:

    # "Ole glances at you deeply with a bright smile."
    "满眼的笑容 深深地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_02713c7c:

    # o "You have an effect on this Harp, it's perfect and I think we can snatch an easy agreement out of Gwyd now."
    o "你对这个哈普有影响 完美极了 我想我们现在可以从格维德那里 抢走一个简单协议了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_83a2756f:

    # o "With that leverage, it's gonna save us a lot of future money of being scammed by that ram."
    o "有了那把杠杆 就能省下我们今后 被那头公羊骗的钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_a8db6f81:

    # "He picks up the Harp with ease as he stands up from your bed."
    "他从你的床上站起来时 轻松地捡起哈普号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_575c6d7f:

    # o "Well, you should spend more time with Seb too."
    o "你也应该多花点时间陪赛博。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_b83b068f:

    # e "I get it, Ole."
    e "我明白了,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_33dee1cf:

    # o "Hey! Don't worry kiddo, you've got my vote."
    o "嘿，别担心，孩子，你得到我的选票了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_3fe9cab4:

    # "Ole faces you with a slight concern, perhaps he'd become aware that your vision is becoming so much more blurry."
    "奥利对你有点担心 也许他会意识到 你的视力变得模糊多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_5826a356:

    # "For a moment, your heart seems to have paused."
    "有一瞬间，你的心好像停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_4a39f832:

    # "As soon as you've returned to your sanity, Ole's already gone... leaving you alone inside your own room."
    "一旦你恢复理智 奥利已经走了 把你一个人留在自己的房间里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_70737dec:

    # e "Shit... what did Ole mean by that."
    e "妈的... 奥利是什么意思?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Good_Finish_aa39877a:

    # msg "You received 500 gold from Ole."
    msg "你从奥利收到500金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_2d78ca68:

    # e "Hey, Ole. How did that meeting go?"
    e "嘿,奥利,会议怎么样?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_03eff89d:

    # o "Perfectly, weird as I say. I think the harp we got wasn't miles better than Gwyd's one."
    o "说来奇怪，我觉得我们做出的竖琴并没有比格威迪恩的好上多少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_82ec5b2b:

    # o "And the supplier, he was quite peculiar. I guess he wasn't ready for a competition, nor did Gwyddyon."
    o "供货商确实很古怪。我猜他没准备好面对竞争，格威迪恩也是如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_1db3343b:

    # o "But, in the end. Gwyd wasn't the wisest one when it comes to holding in their emotion in his face. He wasn't having it when I mentioned... everything."
    o "不过说到底，格威迪恩并不擅长掩饰脸上的情绪。我提到……所有事情时，他显然无法接受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_3bad3f69:

    # o "I guess that tantrum he threw really hurt the chance of him signing another exclusive contract with the supplier."
    o "我猜他发的脾气 确实伤害了他和供应商 签署另一份独家合同的机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_7763daa3:

    # e "Oh? Was Gwyd that angry?"
    e "Gwyd那么生气吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_c5b33790:

    # o "Not as much as you'd expect actually, but the supplier... also is a combative type of person, so there're some turbulence during the meeting."
    o "但供应商…… 也是有战斗力的人 所以在会议期间会有一些动荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_4424fd8f:

    # o "And well, long story short, I've got the piece of paper."
    o "长话短说 我有一张纸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_c6a13a6f:

    # "He shows you the contract, signed with both Ole and the supplier's name in the corner."
    "他向你们展示了合同 与奥利和供应商的名字签在角落里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_56cd4e7e:

    # o "Now, of course I wasn't going after Gwyd entirely. He got his own contract also, but at least we have the upper hand now, with Haskell's deal, and some part of Rahim's clothes."
    o "当然,我并没有完全去追Gwyd。他也有他自己的合同, 但至少我们现在占了上风, 哈斯凯尔的交易,还有雷希姆的部分衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_e5969d2f:

    # e "Does that mean, you're choking Gwyd out of the business?"
    e "你是说你把Gwyd从生意上挤下来了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_d2f666c7:

    # o "No, no. Our contract is more or less equal for both parties, last contract we had, he got a lot more from it than we did, so I just wanted to see him squirm now."
    o "不，不，我们的合同对双方都差不多一样，我们上次的合同，他从合同中得到的比我们多得多，所以我想看看他现在的脾气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_a79f040e:

    # o "Anyway, that's gonna ensure some money and reputations in our pocket, all thanks to the harp you helped making."
    o "不管怎么说，这能保证我们口袋里有钱有名，都是因为你帮忙造的竖琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_2f01b3ea:

    # e "I-I'm just glad."
    e "我很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_dc89a66d:

    # o "Regardless of the outcome, I'll be voting for the goats. As a part of the contract we just had, and also an appreciation for your help."
    o "不管结果如何，我都会投票支持山羊，作为我们刚刚签订的合同的一部分，也感谢你的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_591b550d:

    # o "It went alright. Gwyd's harp was just better than ours, I think it was a right choice to leave the harp."
    o "一切还算顺利。我觉得格威迪恩的竖琴确实比我们的好，所以放弃制作竖琴是正确的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_cf98332f:

    # e "Aw... I'm sorry we couldn't make one in time."
    e "抱歉我们没能及时赶到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_8e8a2c44:

    # o "Well, we didn't get to finish the Harp, I guess it takes more time than we expected."
    o "我们没有完成哈普号，我想它需要的时间比我们预期的要长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_cf98332f_1:

    # e "Aw... I'm sorry we couldn't make one in time."
    e "抱歉我们没能及时赶到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_4752fde3:

    # o "It's okay, [e]. We still have Haskell helping so the meeting went so and so."
    o "没关系，[e]，我们还有哈斯凯尔帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_3df3ace7:

    # o "Turns out, the supplier really was looking for Gwyd to understand his materials, so the meeting ended up being the two of them talking."
    o "结果，供货商确实是想让格威迪恩理解自己的材料，所以那场会面最后变成了他们两人的交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_0c0f6248:

    # o "But, we've got a better contract from Gwyd. That's gonna save the shop some money."
    o "不过我们从格威迪恩那里拿到了更好的合同，这能为店里省下一些钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_b8e9afbe:

    # e "I'm glad it turns out fine, Ole."
    e "我很高兴事情进展顺利,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_6f4c6504:

    # o "Yeah, I guess there's no excuse for me to not vote for teaming up with the goats now."
    o "是啊，我想我没有理由不投票 支持现在和山羊队合作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_0b4b5c23:

    # "Ole smiles faintly as he pats your shoulder."
    "他拍拍你的肩膀时 眼泪微弱的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_fa1ec12f:

    # o "We didn't get to know what Gwyddyon was up to with his supplier, but apparently he made a harp for him. And the supplier seemed pleasantly surprised."
    o "我们不知道格威迪恩和供应商有什么关系,但显然他给他做了竖琴。供应商似乎很惊讶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_941c64df:

    # e "Damn, I should've known."
    e "该死，我早该知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_4752fde3_1:

    # o "It's okay, [e]. We still have Haskell helping so the meeting went so and so."
    o "没关系，[e]，我们还有哈斯凯尔帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_9cfa35b9:

    # o "So in the end, we've got a better contract from Gwyd. That's gonna save the shop some money."
    o "所以最后，我们从格威迪恩那里拿到了更好的合同，这能为店里省下一些钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_b8e9afbe_1:

    # e "I'm glad it turns out fine, Ole."
    e "我很高兴事情进展顺利,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Meeting_0b4b5c23_1:

    # "Ole smiles faintly as he pats your shoulder."
    "他拍拍你的肩膀时 眼泪微弱的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_893b2396:

    # e "Hey, Cane. Have you heard of the Vote from Rahim?"
    e "嘿,凯恩,你听说过雷希姆的选票吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_c47acbb6:

    # c "Aye, everyone in the tavern was talking about the news."
    c "是的，在酒馆的每个人都在谈论新闻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_fdb07fd6:

    # c "Ain't that old geezer a sight to behold, eh? I betcha he's missing the goats."
    c "那个老家伙是不是看得见啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_c5700d5e:

    # e "I thought he said he's voting against allying up with the goats."
    e "我以为他说他投票反对 与山羊纠缠不休。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_9ae75309:

    # c "Heh, the nefarious bull has a softer heart than ye think, m' lad."
    c "邪恶的公牛比你想的 更温柔的心 小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_0fab270c:

    # e "I hope you're right, kinda. But how would you vote yourself?"
    e "希望你是对的，但你投什么票？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_96bc82a5:

    # c "I ain't votin' for nothing. I've got a whole tavern 'ere waiting for an extra mug of beer."
    c "我不是白费口舌，我有一整个酒馆在等多喝杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_eaef8589:

    # "Cane says carelessly, his hands scrubbing the tankards almost by instinct."
    "凯恩粗心粗意地说 他的手几乎用本能来洗罐头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_b6a7d7a3:

    # e "So you're not voting for anything?"
    e "所以你不投票吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_b8338f56:

    # c "Laddie, it's a waste of time whatever sides yer' on. What's the odds yer single slide of paper makes a difference."
    c "莱迪，这是浪费时间，不管你站在哪一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_ddd70da8:

    # e "Hmm... that's odd. The Cane I knew cared about many more than money."
    e "奇怪,我认识的凯恩人关心的不只是钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_36078000:

    # "The barkeep's eyes widen, his face contorts into a lingering grin that hides a hostility."
    "狗狗的眼睛变宽了 他的脸变形成一个 隐藏敌意的 挥之不去的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_17cc4788:

    # c "Yeah, but-"
    c "是的，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_f88f0626:

    # "There seems to be much to be told, but the bat stops himself before you hear anything."
    "似乎有很多话要说 但蝙蝠在你听到任何声音之前就停下来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_4379eaff:

    # c "I was just saying... lad."
    c "我只是说…… 小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_a8c20167:

    # "Weirdly, the bat does not bring himself up to your eyes, his hands are still scrubbing the tankards, thoughtlessly."
    "奇怪的是，蝙蝠没让你看清 手还在擦罐头，不知不觉地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_6f609e96:

    # c "Ya know what? If yer ass is free, why don't cha come help a needy fella 'ere."
    c "如果屁眼是自由的 为什么不来帮助一个穷苦的人呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_5b529431:

    # "He brought his voice back up again, as if someone suddenly pushed a lever."
    "他又恢复了声音 好像有人突然按下杠杆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_4c84b89c:

    # e "I guess so. It's your choice to make after all."
    e "我想是的 毕竟这是你的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_27549d5e:

    # "You shrug, the disappointment in your face is not entirely subtle to the bat."
    "你尖锐地挥舞，你脸上的失望 对蝙蝠来说并不十分微妙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_e88e7cac:

    # c "Aye, aye. Look at that pouty face, I get it-... yer mad I hadn't have time to leave my tavern for one second."
    c "瞧瞧那小脸蛋，我明白了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_d6edc6d5:

    # e "I didn't say that."
    e "我没有这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_739a59ed:

    # c "Laddie, I've known ya for how long, ya think I can't tell when yer trying to make me feel better?"
    c "拉德迪，我认识你多久了 你觉得我分辨不出 你什么时候想让我好过点？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_629cba9e:

    # "Cane's hands slams onto either sides of your neck tenderly, his fingers trace across your shoulder before squeezing it softly."
    "拐杖的手伸到你脖子两侧 轻轻地 手指在你的肩膀上 轻轻地挤压前 摸摸你的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_cd48f1d0:

    # c "Lookie 'ere. Ya don't need to go soft on this ol' geezer."
    c "看啊，你不需要对这个老头发脾气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_238b2aae:

    # "His thumbs gently press against your shoulder, and you lean closer to Cane, just enough to feel his warmth emanating over you."
    "他的拇指轻轻地按在肩膀上 你靠在凯恩附近 足以感觉到他为你而燃起的温暖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_05632831:

    # c "If I ain't right, ya gotta tell me."
    c "如果我不对，你得告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_d7a0db1d:

    # c "I make lotta mistakes, too many to count. And my eyes' not working like it used to, ya know... It's part of the perks of growing older, not wiser."
    c "我犯了很多错误，太多的错误不能算。我的眼睛不像以前那样工作，你知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_650c5a85:

    # "You smile faintly, as your palms wrap around the bat's waist, forming a mutual embrace between the two of you."
    "你笑得不笑，当你的手掌绕着蝙蝠的腰，形成你们两个的相互拥抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_0f1540f4:

    # e "If you need a hand, Cane... I'm always here."
    e "如果你需要帮忙,凯恩..."

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_1d07d6f9:

    # c "A hand? I've got just the right job for ya."
    c "一只手？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_15a96f72:

    # e "Oh? You wanted me to serve the tavern?"
    e "你想让我为酒馆服务？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_d5f65cb9:

    # c "Naaa-ah, it's just that someone's been bugging the ol' trunk, or rather, something."
    c "直啊，只是有人在窃听后备箱 或者说，什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_4cdf157e:

    # e "So... what is it?"
    e "那…… 是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_35f58ac5:

    # c "I have no idea. A ghost, maybe, a patron of mine said he spotted a shadow 'ere at night, right 'ere."
    c "我不知道，一个幽灵，也许，一个我的守护者说 他看到一个影子在晚上，对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_d395890f:

    # "The bat points at where he stands, right behind the counter."
    "蝙蝠指着他站的地方 就在柜台后面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_0ebb80f5:

    # c "I ain't gonna lie, he's been making a scene these past days, on that day he claimed to see the ghost, that lad's scream enough to spook some of m' dearest patrons away."
    c "我不会撒谎，他最近几天一直在大吵大闹 那天他声称看到鬼魂 那小子的尖叫声足以吓跑一些最亲爱的老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_b39ca121:

    # c "Ya haven't seen it either, did ya?"
    c "亚也没见过吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_7460f7dc:

    # e "Not really, have you?"
    e "不是真的，你呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_61e4d604:

    # c "Nah, nothing. Those peeps listened to his story, and now telling me the ale's tasting off, like someone dropped a jar of honey in it..."
    c "那些偷窥者听他的故事 现在告诉我啤酒在尝着味道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_7358ac84:

    # c "But I ain't seeing nothin-, the ale tastes fine, nothing caught my eyes at all."
    c "但我什么都没看见 啤酒味道很好 什么都看不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_6b8c6778:

    # c "And now he's saying I'm some kinda ghost inside a bat's body, what a bunch of hogwash."
    c "现在他说我是蝙蝠体内的幽灵 简直就是一帮胡言乱语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_f14b35ef:

    # "The tavernkeeper furrows his brow."
    "酒馆的管家在眉毛上转悠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_4cf38ed6:

    # e "Why did he accuse you like that? Do you two have some sort of history?"
    e "为什么他要这样指责你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_258e68e1:

    # c "Ya remember Topu? That lad? Oh, Topu was a good lad, he liked helping with the tavern, he doesn't complain, and he has no temper. Up until he fell in with bad influences all around."
    c "托普是个不错的小伙子，他喜欢帮忙修酒馆，他没有抱怨，没有脾气，直到他陷入了坏的影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_24c77692:

    # c "The lad stopped talking with me as much after, he's gotten drunk all the time. And when I asked he always said nothing as if hiding something from me."
    c "之后他一直喝醉，我问他，他总是不说话 好像对我隐瞒什么一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_2f17c758:

    # c "It was proper to kick 'em bad influence out of my tavern, right? Even though m' lad shouted at me for doing that."
    c "把他们从我的酒馆里踢出来是适当的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_5f896321:

    # c "And now, one of 'em came back, now spreading rumors all around my place? I'd not respect m'self if I didn't give 'em a lesson."
    c "现在，他们中的一个回来了，现在散布谣言 遍及我的地方？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_b701b81e:

    # c "Ya wanna help?" nointeract
    c "您想帮忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_58eec354:

    # e "Alright, fine, you're the boss. What should I do again?"
    e "好吧，好吧，你是老板，我又该做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_78bcd756:

    # c "First thing first, find that fella who's been spreading the buzz. Blokes' came here a while ago, should be easy to spot him here."
    c "首先，先找到那个在传播消息的家伙，布洛克斯刚来过这里，应该很容易发现他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_14973119:

    # e "What's he look like?"
    e "他长什么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_7cccfb0f:

    # c "Looks like a grey rat. A nasty one, yer lil snout here might smell it from miles away."
    c "看起来像一只灰老鼠 一只讨厌的老鼠 可能从几英里外闻到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_2428ee99:

    # e "Mhmm, doesn't sound very appetising, won't he stink up your tavern?"
    e "听起来不是很开胃吗？他不会臭死你的酒馆吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_e677acc5:

    # c "Ya bet, that stink's so strong it's the first time I ain't smelling beer since I've been a bat."
    c "我打赌，那臭味太浓了 自从我当蝙蝠以来 我第一次没闻到啤酒的味道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_50e12f27:

    # "Cane's grin widens into a prideful smile."
    "凯恩的笑容会变成骄傲的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_db44c6bb:

    # c "Either way, go find that stinker and either ask something useful or just tell'em to shut it up."
    c "要么去找那个臭小子 要么问些有用的东西 要么就叫他们闭嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_9867154c:

    # e "What if what he said is true, then?"
    e "如果他说的话是真的呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_fe588d56:

    # c "Then we gotta catch that devious thief, [e]. You and I."
    c "那我们得抓住那个狡猾的小偷 [e] 你和我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_246767ff:

    # e "Perhaps some time later, Cane. I've got something else to do."
    e "也许等一会儿,凯恩,我还有别的事要做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Opinion_b19a4c9e:

    # c "Dang, well... okay lad."
    c "该死，好吧……行了，小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_78e315f7:

    # "The day of voting is here. Lusterfield is bustling with people, a lot more than usual."
    "投票日到了 乐斯民菲尔德和人在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_77d5483e:

    # "It was a momentous occasion, one that had the villagers abuzz with excitement and trepidation alike."
    "这是一个重大的时刻，村民们都欢呼着兴奋和惊恐的欢呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_08339cd2:

    # "Banners, that leads to the voting stage fluttered in the breeze as you follow the path slowly towards the town center."
    "班纳人，这导致投票阶段 在微风中摇摇欲坠，当你走的路径 缓慢地通往镇中心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_426d98f0:

    # "As you made your way to the center of the village, you could feel the weight of this moment in every step."
    "当你到达村中心时，你可以感受到每一步中 此刻的重量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_f3728219:

    # "Everyone is standing around, chatting, discussing the idea of allying up with the goats."
    "每个人都站在这里聊天 讨论和山羊纠缠的想法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_52903882:

    # "A wooden platform, a makeshift stage for the event dominated the scene. At its center stood a modest, yet significant, wooden ballot box."
    "一个木制平台，一个临时的舞台 以这个事件为主的场景。在它的中间，有一个小的，但很重要的 木制投票箱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b06b4ab6:

    # "You see a long line of people at the front of the platform, snaking all the way around the center."
    "你看到一排长长的人站在平台的前面，一路在中心周围偷窥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_071cffaf:

    # "Rahim stands in the middle while Ole is at the side of the ballot box."
    "雷希姆站在中间 而奥利站在投票箱的一侧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_eedbec0a:

    # "You take a piece of paper from the counter, and swiftly join the line, a sense of responsibility and duty guiding your steps."
    "你从柜台拿一张纸 迅速加入队伍 一种责任感和义务感 指导你的行动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_428ed26f:

    # "The choice is clear, yet... its implication might sprawl deep. A solemn sense of uneasiness pervades over your body as you inch forward."
    "选择是显而易见的，但是…… 它的隐含可能蔓延到深处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0f7875e4:

    # l "Disciple?"
    l "门徒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_2bb0defe:

    # e "Lothar? Have you voted yet?"
    e "洛萨尔?你投票了吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_1500154a:

    # l "Of course I did, as stupid as this whole event is, I guess it's time to settle all unneccessary noise these goat-lovers make."
    l "当然了，我做了，像这整个事件一样愚蠢，我想是时候解决这些爱羊人 制造的所有不必要噪音了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b649917c:

    # l "What are you voting?"
    l "你们投票什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_34911e6f:

    # e "Uh... No?"
    e "Uh…… No？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_50a1ba74:

    # l "Huh."
    l "哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_40f4b819:

    # l "I've strongly advised Amble and Jog to vote no. So, you better choose your choice wisely."
    l "我强烈建议安布和约格投票反对 所以你最好明智地选择自己的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_bac6fda3:

    # "Lothar pats all around your hips, it felt genuinely intrusive but he doesn't seem to care."
    "感觉真的很有侵扰性 但他似乎不在乎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_3a40084b:

    # "You remain silent as Lothar's hands wander all over your body, and it's right in front of the people behind you in the line."
    "你保持沉默,因为洛萨尔的手 徘徊在你的身体上, 它就在你身后的人面前 在排队。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5bf69d93:

    # e "Lothar?"
    e "洛萨尔?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_362509f2:

    # l "You better behave, Disciple. I'm not fucking joking around."
    l "你最好乖乖听话 朋友 我不是开玩笑的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c5025c58:

    # l "This is your last fucking chance, Disciple. You don't want to see me mad."
    l "这是你最后的机会了 朋友 你不想看到我发疯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_2b373947:

    # "Lothar leans forward as you instinctively lean back, your snouts are only an inch apart, you can clearly see his eyes glowing red."
    "你本能地向后倾斜的时候 洛德尔向前倾斜 你的鼻涕只是一寸隔开 你可以看到他的眼睛发红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_d651522d:

    # "His hot breath tells you his heart is pumping faster and faster. But something tells you it's not about you, and it gets awkward really fast."
    "他的热气告诉你 他的心脏跳得越来越快了 但有些事告诉你这与你无关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_d6caccac:

    # "For a moment it almost seems he's about to hit you with him holding onto you tighter and tighter. His face is distorting in one resembling pain and anguish."
    "有那么一瞬间，他几乎像是要动手了，抓着你的手越来越紧。他的面容扭曲，仿佛饱受痛苦与煎熬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0576fecb:

    # "You don't even dare to breath."
    "你甚至不敢呼吸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c342ba7a:

    # "Suddenly, he releases his grip on you. And you fall over."
    "突然间，他释放了对你的控制，你倒下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_07aeae74:

    # e "Hey! Stop that."
    e "嘿！停止！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_fcd79924:

    # "Your shout turns almost the whole village's attention onto you and Lothar. He retreats immediately but his furrowed brows doesn't fade."
    "你的呼喊几乎把整个村子的注意力 都转向你和洛萨尔了 他立刻撤退,但他的眉毛并没有消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b598f6a8:

    # "Lothar looks around, he sees a few dozen pairs of eyes just glancing at your direction."
    "洛萨尔环顾四周, 他看见几打双眼睛 盯着你的方向闪闪发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_4bd97121:

    # "Without leaving another word, he glances at you once more and leaves."
    "他再一眼就离开你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9f8e561c:

    # "T-that was a weird interaction, even for Lothar's standard. It does seem he takes the ballot very seriously, perhaps too seriously."
    "即使是按照洛萨尔的标准 他似乎非常认真地对待选票 也许太严肃了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_03c0b6be:

    # "You're genuinely scared of Lothar now, even though you know he can be possessive, there's still a point where you think it's too much for you."
    "你现在真的害怕洛萨尔了 虽然你知道他可以占有他人 但仍有一点你觉得这对你来说太过分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_4aceafc7:

    # "Some people's eyes remain onto your direction."
    "有些人的眼睛会盯着你的方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_1f0cf2c7:

    # "They are murmuring something, but you don't know what that is. So you pat your waists slowly to look for your voting paper."
    "他们有些杂念，但你不知道那是什么。所以你慢慢地拍拍腰去寻找选票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_ffae7aa6:

    # "At least it is still here, you reckon Lothar could have easily stolen from you, but maybe he thought against it."
    "至少它还在这里,你认为洛萨尔可以很容易地从你那里偷东西, 但是也许他觉得他反对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_fbc36b6d:

    # "After a while, the line clears fast, and soon it's your time to walk on the stage."
    "过了一段时间，线条很快就清空了 很快，你该上台了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_dde88a32:

    # "Ole greets you with a usual hug, he gestures toward the wooden platform ahead, where a modest, yet significant, wooden ballot box stood."
    "奥利用平常的拥抱向你致意，他朝前面的木板站着一个小的，但意义重大的木板投票箱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_cf6ca7c8:

    # o "Here's where you'll cast your vote."
    o "在这里你投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_ae82c287:

    # "He hands you a stamp with red ink on the table."
    "他给你一张有红墨印的印章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_7a1b4d7a:

    # o "Simply stamp your choice with that chop in either box."
    o "简单地在任何一个盒子里 印上你的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0e4b993b:

    # "You voted yes in the booth, and cast your ballot in front of Ole."
    "你在投票亭里投了赞成票 在奥利面前投了选票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9ee69d6d:

    # "You voted no in the booth, and cast your ballot in front of Ole."
    "你投票反对,在投票亭投票, 在奥利面前投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b4e17f27:

    # o "Hey, thanks for voting, [e]. You can wait out there, and after tallying all of them, Rahim will make an announcement."
    o "嘿,谢谢你的投票,[e] 你可以在外面等,等他们全部清点完后,雷希姆会宣布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_349df98f:

    # "With a friendly pat on the back, Ole moved to assist the next villager, leaving you to get off the stage quickly."
    "奥利带着一个亲切的拍拍背部 搬去帮助下一个村民 让你马上离开舞台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_ed2ae156:

    # "A few of the other helpers like Ole begin to count, and suddenly, you notice Lothar hovering around the counters, his gaze fixating on something."
    "像奥利这样的几个其他帮手开始数数 突然你注意到洛萨尔在柜台周围徘徊 他盯着什么东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_be7fa5d4:

    # s "Gooooooood fricking morning, [e]!"
    s "早上好，[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_80ad6f1f:

    # "A bright voice snatches your back as your attention turns to Sebas."
    "光亮的声音夺了你的背 当你的注意力转向塞巴斯时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_4fa2964d:

    # e "Oh Seb, didn't expect to see you here, and why aren't you swearing?"
    e "哦 塞巴斯 没想到你会在这里见到你 为什么你不发誓？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_e403cdb4:

    # s "Ha, I have to cast my super duper important vote, isn't that what the whole event is about?"
    s "哈，我必须投出我的超级 哑巴重要投票，是不是这是整个事件是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_77f349e1:

    # s "Also, it's so much better seeing people use my stamp. Hearing that crisp chop sound makes me feel a little tingly inside. HMmmmmmm!"
    s "听到那响亮的声音让我觉得内心有点刺痛！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_247fa38f:

    # "He raises you a thumbs up, which you follow suit."
    "他举起拇指给你，你们也跟着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_ace8f52c:

    # e "Good, I voted just now, your stamp is awesome though."
    e "很好，我刚刚投票了 你的邮票很棒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_049adb19:

    # s "I know, right? I've spent a lot of time thinking what I should use as the icon of Lusterfield."
    s "我花了很多时间想 我该用什么做乐斯民菲尔德的偶像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_8bc94050:

    # e "And you chose... lion?"
    e "你选择了……狮子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_f1d8886a:

    # s "How are you so smart, roomie! Of course! That's why every vote has my face on it, and... well the fellas on the stages are still counting."
    s "当然了，这就是为什么每次投票 都有我的表情，而且……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_957ae864:

    # s "You know, there aren't too many people in Lusterfield, so I'm not sure why they are taking so long, ugh."
    s "乐斯民菲尔德没有太多人 所以我不知道他们为什么花这么长时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_6a75ed0f:

    # e "I think they're recounting everything thrice."
    e "我想他们正在重复所有三件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a323ca1c:

    # s "Yeah, by this rate, it'll probably be done... at nine, earliest."
    s "以这个速度，它可能会完成…… 九点，最早。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_7578ce92:

    # "As you wait alongside Sebas, the weight of your decision settled upon you, and you couldn't help but feel the significance of this moment in the heart of Lusterfield."
    "当你和塞巴斯一起等待 你决定的重心决定在你身上 你不得不感受到这个时刻 在乐斯民菲尔德中心的意义。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_d416e88e:

    # "One side is with the goats, you'd love to see Furkan satisfied for once as the two factions mend their relationship, but on the other hand you have Lothar, who's guaranteed to rage if you are not voting no."
    "一方面是山羊, 你很想看到弗坎 满足了一次,因为两派已经修补了关系, 但另一方面是洛萨尔, 如果你不投票反对,他一定会生气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5ec8518d:

    # "You stay with Sebas for a while, waiting for the villagers to count the rest of the votes as more comes in."
    "你留在塞巴斯待一阵子 等村民们数下其余的选票 等更多人进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_8626c3f0:

    # "Eventually, the line gets shorter and shorter, until there are no more people waiting to vote."
    "最终，线条越来越短，直到没有人等待投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_34a716d3:

    # "It's only when you look back you notice Jog in the corner, and Amble talking with him. They look much more distressed than their normal selves."
    "只有当你回首往事时,你才注意到角落里有乔格,安布和他交谈,他们看起来比正常人更痛苦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_d5a9cf36:

    # "When they notice you, they quickly avert their gaze and leave. So you shrug and continue waiting with Sebas."
    "当他们看见你们的时候，他们忽然避开眼，就离开。你们就摇摆吧！你们在赛巴斯附近等待吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_80bdb269:

    # r "Greetings, everyone."
    r "大家好，大家好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_08a45b8a:

    # "Rahim walks up onto the stage as the last ballot box is closed and put away."
    "雷希姆在最后一张选票箱关闭后, 走上舞台,。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_ba0c3e3f:

    # r "We've counted the final number of votes. And, I have the fate of Lusterfield on my hand."
    r "我们计算了最后的票数 我手上有乐斯民菲尔德的命运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a0b6c3e6:

    # "Suddenly, the whole town center is silent, everyone is holding their breath, even Sebas."
    "突然整个镇中心都沉默了 每个人屏住呼吸 甚至塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_f3326f4e:

    # r "This is the first time the people of Lusterfield has spoken, I hope everyone respects the result, whatever that will be."
    r "这是乐斯民菲尔德人民第一次发言,我希望每个人都尊重结果,无论结果如何。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_3971cabb:

    # r "And we had to confirm the total votes over a few times to avoid any miscalculation."
    r "我们不得不确认总票数 超过几次 以避免任何误算。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_05e879a3:

    # "Rahim, holds the final tally in his trembling hands, sweat glistening on his furrowed brow."
    "雷希姆,握住最后的计数 在他颤抖的手, 汗水闪闪在他的 羽毛眉毛上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_7e7c6994:

    # r "So..."
    r "那么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_295c5426:

    # r "As the majority have already decided, we will reinstate our alliance with the goats."
    r "正如多数人已经决定的那样，我们将恢复与山羊的联盟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_8d156ccd:

    # r "It was a close vote, this decision is decided by only [vote_difference] vot-."
    r "这是一场势均力敌的表决，结果只由[vote_difference]票之差决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_1a62b764:

    # "A mixed chorus of cheers and murmurs ripples through the crowd around the stage. Seb raises his eyebrows beside you, his mouth hangs agape."
    "舞台周围的人群响起一片欢呼与窃窃私语。塞巴斯在你身旁挑起眉毛，张着嘴，满脸惊愕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a4b62a9b:

    # "Some villagers exchange smiles and pats on the back, while others bear expressions of uncertainty, their eyes revealing lingering doubts."
    "有些村民在背后微笑和拍拍手，而另一些村民则表示不确定，他们的眼睛暴露了挥之不去的怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_99b3fce6:

    # "You hear the sound of breaking porcelain rings out, alongside with a loud grunt coming from Lothar."
    "你听到碎瓷响的声音 以及来自洛萨尔的响亮呼声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9d6324ed:

    # "He sweep his arm across a table filled with plates, sending them crashing to the ground."
    "他将手臂扫过满盘子的桌子 送他们撞到地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a33c17c6:

    # r "Remember, the decision was made collectively by everyone. It is not my place, nor anyone, to question their choice."
    r "请记住，这个决定是由每个人集体作出的，我无权质疑他们的选择，任何人也无权质疑他们的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_3fb5afdf:

    # "Rahim says calmly, obviously targetting this statement to Lothar."
    "雷希姆冷静地说 显然这是针对洛萨尔的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_1f08e04d:

    # "Lothar stares at the broken shards for a moment, until suddenly his gaze is locked onto yours."
    "洛萨尔盯着碎碎片一眼 直到突然他的眼神 锁定在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_31f8526d:

    # "His brows slowly furrow, there is a flash of sorrow in his eyes."
    "他的眉毛慢慢的流逝，他的眼睛里有一股悲伤的闪光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_7f3ce90e:

    # "Without a single word, Lothar turns and storms off, his heavy footsteps echoing through the square."
    "没有一句话,洛萨尔就转身,暴风雨吹散, 他的重脚步声在广场上回响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_49ac49aa:

    # r "Ahem, although, I personally have voted against it, but it was a decision of everyone who has voted here."
    r "虽然我个人投了反对票 但这是所有投票人的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5df3120d:

    # r "Following today, we'll arrange a meeting with the Goat's leader. We will protect each other, from whatever might be happening out there."
    r "今天之后，我们将安排与山羊头目会面。我们将相互保护，防止那里发生任何可能的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a0fda9b3:

    # r "Their people are allowed to visit our village, and same goes to ours."
    r "他们的人民获准访问我们的村庄，我们的村庄也是如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c265bda4:

    # r "Thank you."
    r "我想谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b5b6b75c:

    # "The crowd soon begins to desperse also, while you and Seb walk away."
    "人群也很快开始消亡 你和塞巴斯走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_d77a277f:

    # r "The result, is surprising to say the least, I know some of us did not vote, but to end with the same vote to each side, is a miracle."
    r "结果，至少令人惊讶地说，我知道我们中有些人没有投票，但以对每一方的同一票结束投票，是一个奇迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_38e5b9b7:

    # r "I wish to resolve this as smoothly as possible, however we have to consider the logistics and your own time. So, it's not fair for us to waste everyone's time to hold another vote."
    r "我希望尽可能顺利地解决这个问题，然而，我们必须考虑后勤和你们自己的时间。因此，我们浪费大家的时间再投票是不公平的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_488d4053:

    # r "Therefore, as the leader of our village, I hereby forfeit my own vote against the alliance."
    r "因此，作为我们村的领袖，我特此放弃反对联盟的投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_1a62b764_1:

    # "A mixed chorus of cheers and murmurs ripples through the crowd around the stage. Seb raises his eyebrows beside you, his mouth hangs agape."
    "舞台周围的人群响起一片欢呼与窃窃私语。塞巴斯在你身旁挑起眉毛，张着嘴，满脸惊愕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a4b62a9b_1:

    # "Some villagers exchange smiles and pats on the back, while others bear expressions of uncertainty, their eyes revealing lingering doubts."
    "有些村民在背后微笑和拍拍手，而另一些村民则表示不确定，他们的眼睛暴露了挥之不去的怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c4bbea3d:

    # l "What the fuck, Rahim?"
    l "什么他妈的,雷希姆?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a19298f9:

    # "Lothar's voice, a thunderous growl, cuts through the commotion."
    "洛萨尔的声音,一阵雷鸣的咆哮, 穿过了骚动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_88097104:

    # l "The fuck are you doing? You're not helping the goats I tell you. You're-"
    l "你他妈在干嘛？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c5bbc8b5:

    # "His rugged face, lined with years of determination, contorts into a fierce scowl."
    "他坚硬的脸，与多年的坚定立场一致，扭曲成一个凶猛的石蜡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5d0f4e0e:

    # "The hero wolf climbs on top of the stage. Rahim is undeterred, calmly steps forwards to address Lothar."
    "英雄狼爬上舞台,雷希姆毫不犹豫,平静地向前迈出一步,向洛萨尔讲话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9726f083:

    # r "Are you done?"
    r "你玩完了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_e6ea4c50:

    # l "How could you be this dumb. I told you I have proof, their stones. Their fucking golem."
    l "你怎么能这么笨 我说过我有证据 他们的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b013a4c9:

    # "His words, laden with frustration, resonates through the square, commanding the attention of the villagers and elders alike."
    "他的话充满了挫折，在广场上产生共鸣，引起村民和长老的注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_fd71f72c:

    # "Lothar, his fists clench and eyes burning with anger, strides toward Rahim who had announced the result."
    "洛萨尔攥紧拳头，怒火在眼中燃烧，大步走向宣布结果的雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_ccdee50a:

    # r "We will continue in a moment."
    r "我们将在片刻内继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_26b71a4a:

    # "Rahim addresses the crowd, then quietly runs towards Lothar."
    "雷希姆向人群讲话,然后悄悄地跑向洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_6409e6aa:

    # l "You don't DO THAT! I tell you-"
    l "你不能这样做！我告诉你，"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_2d239ab4:

    # r "What I vote myself, is my own business. It's not your place to judge, Lothar."
    r "我投我自己的票,是我的事,不是你的判断权,洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_75e9a106:

    # "Sebas stares with bewilderment, the tension in the square escalates, as whispers of astonishment and concern spread among the crowd."
    "广场的紧张升级，人群中传来惊异和担忧的耳语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_f0e4e95a:

    # l "Not mine? I'm the fucking hero of Lusterfield, I saved you all from the goats and now, instead of TRYING to stay away from them like a normal person you're allying with them?"
    l "我是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄,我救了你们 远离山羊,现在, 而不是像正常人一样 远离山羊?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_79ee5c71:

    # l "Half of the Lusterfield voted No, why didn't you respect their opinion you fuckin' hypocrite."
    l "一半的乐斯民菲尔德人投票不 你为什么不尊重他们的意见 你个伪君子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b40a95a9:

    # l "The time I've spent, looking for evidence for you. And you're saying everything is fine now?"
    l "我花的时间 为你寻找证据 而你现在说一切都好？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0a94a1da:

    # r "Again, the vote today has already concluded-"
    r "同样，今天的表决已经结束 -- --"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_283d9c61:

    # "Lothar's face reddened, and his voice thundered across the town center."
    "洛萨尔的脸被重新洗刷 声音在镇中心被打响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_30efcf5c:

    # l "Where the fuck did you hide Rahim, huh? They fucking killed your daughter, stop pretending opinions of mere commoners matter anything to you-"
    l "他们杀了你女儿，别再装作普通人 对你有什么影响"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_209ef017:

    # "A slap, powerful enough to tear your ears apart, can be heard on the stage, the sound echoed through the square."
    "能够把耳朵撕成两半 可以在舞台上听到 广场上回响的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b374540e:

    # "Suddenly all murmur and rumbles has stopped as everyone stares at the hero and the leader."
    "突然间，所有的杂音和狂欢停止了 所有人都盯着英雄和领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_32b00c5f:

    # "Lothar staggers back, his grey cheek reddens from Rahim's rebuke."
    "洛萨尔的老手,他的灰色脸颊 红了雷希姆的怨恨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0d963177:

    # r "If what you're saying is true, then maybe it's time for the hero to protect the village for once."
    r "如果你说的是真的 那么也许英雄该保护村落一次了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_e7a5d895:

    # "Rahim says calmly, but his stare seems to say otherwise."
    "雷希姆平静地说, 但他的眼神似乎说别的方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a45346e6:

    # "Seb almost spilled his food as he watches the event unfold, the crowd comes to a complete silence as the hero is somehow humbled by Rahim's palm."
    "当他看着事件展开时，群众几乎把食物洒得一干二净，人群完全沉默，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5df3120d_1:

    # r "Following today, we'll arrange a meeting with the Goat's leader. We will protect each other, from whatever might be happening out there."
    r "今天之后，我们将安排与山羊头目会面。我们将相互保护，防止那里发生任何可能的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a0fda9b3_1:

    # r "Their people are allowed to visit our village, and same goes to ours."
    r "他们的人民获准访问我们的村庄，我们的村庄也是如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_235a40b6:

    # "Lothar stares as Rahim quietly steps away from the platform. The crowd soon begins to desperse also, while you and Seb walk away."
    "雷希姆静静地离开平台时,洛萨尔目光凝视着雷希姆。 人群也很快开始消逝,而你和塞布则离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a7b7dcd5:

    # "Just as you turn back, you notice Lothar is still... standing. But his gaze suddenly fixates onto yours. You quickly look away."
    "你转过身去,你注意到洛萨尔还站着, 但他的目光突然凝固到你的视线上,你快看远了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_6ae48654:

    # s "You see what Lothar did there?"
    s "你看到洛萨尔在那里做了什么吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b3a3e963:

    # s "I still can't believe Rahim slapped him that hard. He tolerated him the most out of everyone in this entire village, apart from the two lackeys."
    s "雷希姆竟然这么狠地扇他耳光,除了两个小仆人之外,他容忍他,是全村人中最不关心他的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_74ab1d0c:

    # "You walk alongside Sebas, whose expression remain astonished but cheerful."
    "你沿着塞巴斯走，塞巴斯的言语仍然令人惊讶，但欣喜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_8d6c5650:

    # "You remember Lothar searching around your body just as you stood in line, and then... when they counted the votes, he stood in the back row, observing something."
    "你记得洛萨尔在你身体周围搜寻 就像你在排队时一样 然后... 当他们计票时 他站在后排 观察着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_24094986:

    # "What could he have been possibly doing..."
    "他可能在做什么……。……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5dba2f1f:

    # e "What's wrong with Lothar?"
    e "洛萨尔怎么了?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_93dba618:

    # s "It's typical Lothar. Whenever something doesn't go along his plan, that wolf will go craaa-zy..."
    s "这是典型的洛萨尔 每当有事情不按他的计划去做时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_661d0082:

    # s "He's like a caged beast, a ticking time-bomb. You won't want to get near him when he explodes."
    s "他就像一个笼子里的野兽，一个定时炸弹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_b4b0cc40:

    # s "Maybe I should kick his balls more than once. That'll fix him."
    s "也许我应该再踢一次他的蛋蛋 那样他就会好起来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_8bc24195:

    # s "I still couldn't believe we didn't get to kick his balls while I've got the chance. Maybe that'll fix him."
    s "我还是不敢相信趁我有机会 我们没踢他的蛋蛋 也许那能治好他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_96bd4a06:

    # e "You can't fix people that way, Seb."
    e "你不能用这种方式来修人 塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_632c3333:

    # s "Roomie, you're absolutely right. Some people can't be fixed."
    s "室友，你说的对 有些人不能被固定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5f4c44fb:

    # "The lion raises his fingers, with a lopsided grin."
    "狮子举起他的手指，用一个倾斜的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_5df83a26:

    # s "A-anyway, we've got the goats on our side now!"
    s "无论如何，我们现在有山羊站在我们这边！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0e60d3ff:

    # e "To be honest, Rahim kind of shifted his opinions completely over nights. I wonder if there's any secrets he's still holding back."
    e "说实话,雷希姆在夜里完全改变了他的观点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9dbcd6e9:

    # s "Rahim forfeited his vote, I'd never think an old grumpy guy like him will ever want to see them goats again."
    s "雷希姆放弃投票了, 我从不认为像他这样的老暴躁的家伙 会想再见到他们的山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_013b90bf:

    # s "Hey, I told you Rahim's under my infatuating charm's control, wooooHOOO! Maybe I can make him return my favourite pebbles now."
    s "嘿,我告诉过你雷希姆在我的迷恋魅力控制之下,哇哦哦!"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a0e68785:

    # "You smile as Seb enters the shop."
    "塞布进入店里的时候你微笑着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_7244c1cb:

    # s "It's getting late, I should sleep after such a long day."
    s "已经很晚了，今天过后我该睡觉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9442d8e9:

    # s "Gotta get ready for some goat clients, Ole should also be coming back soon."
    s "得准备好迎接一些山羊客户 奥利应该很快就会回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0adc3925:

    # s "Have a good night, [e]."
    s "晚安，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c729581a:

    # e "Good night, Seb."
    e "晚安，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_6c09e9ef:

    # r "As the majority have already decided, our village will continue our business as usual."
    r "正如多数人已经决定的那样，我们的村庄将继续一切照旧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c75ba8ef:

    # r "Which means, we will not form alliance with the goats."
    r "也就是说 我们不会和山羊结盟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_ab391e81:

    # r "It was a close vote, this decision was decided by only [vote_difference] votes."
    r "这是一次密切的表决，这项决定仅以[vote_difference]票作出决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a173eead:

    # "Rahim declares, his voice steady yet laden with the gravity of the moment."
    "雷希姆宣称,他的声音 稳稳,但 与当下的严重性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a8014323:

    # r "We will only communicate with the goats, should we encounter any threat to the existence of our tribe."
    r "我们只和山羊沟通 以防我们部落的生存受到威胁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_1a62b764_2:

    # "A mixed chorus of cheers and murmurs ripples through the crowd around the stage. Seb raises his eyebrows beside you, his mouth hangs agape."
    "舞台周围的人群响起一片欢呼与窃窃私语。塞巴斯在你身旁挑起眉毛，张着嘴，满脸惊愕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_59d87339:

    # "Lothar seems to be in the cheering crowd, without the cheering part. He looked void of any emotion, turns away and walks off."
    "洛塔似乎在欢呼人群中，没有欢呼的部分。他看起来没有任何情绪，转身离开，走开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_4ce4623e:

    # r "There shouldn't be any further questions. Let's consider this the end of a chapter of Lusterfield."
    r "不应该再问更多的问题了 让我们考虑一下 乐斯民菲尔德的一章的结尾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a4b62a9b_2:

    # "Some villagers exchange smiles and pats on the back, while others bear expressions of uncertainty, their eyes revealing lingering doubts."
    "有些村民在背后微笑和拍拍手，而另一些村民则表示不确定，他们的眼睛暴露了挥之不去的怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_4de6d592:

    # "Sebas stands alongside you, his shoulders slumped, and his eyes downcast."
    "塞巴斯站在你旁边 他的肩膀下沉 眼睛下垂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9da9531c:

    # r "Our business will continue as usual, and we will embrace any challenges by our own selves."
    r "我们的工作将一如既往，我们将接受我们自己的任何挑战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_c265bda4_1:

    # r "Thank you."
    r "我想谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_41457f12:

    # "As the crowd begins to disperse, Sebas lingers for a moment, he can't help but to sigh, exchanging a glance with you."
    "人群开始散开 塞巴斯逗留了一会儿 他忍不住叹气 和你交换一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_bd5b7e75:

    # s "Damn, didn't think we'd lose, and by such a small margin."
    s "该死，没想到我们会输，这么小的利润。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a72f187c:

    # e "Well, you tried your best, Seb."
    e "你尽力了，塞巴斯."

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_7ec7274c:

    # "Sebas chuckles while he's looking down."
    "塞巴斯在低头看的时候笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_17816ea5:

    # s "Yeah, business continues as usual I guess."
    s "是啊，我想一切照旧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_9bc1841b:

    # "The path forward is clear, but the final decision still weighs heavily on his heart."
    "前进的道路是明确的，但最后决定仍然使他的心脏承受沉重负担。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_2a60b8de:

    # e "Seb, do you need anything from the goats?"
    e "塞巴斯，你需要山羊的东西吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_81ad5939:

    # s "No, roomie, I accept gold from anyone."
    s "不 室友 我接受任何人的黄金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_0eb1f710:

    # s "But it's definitely miles better for me that we're not in a perpetual stalemate with the goats."
    s "但对我来说最好不过几英里 我们和山羊之间没有永久的僵局。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_561ac332:

    # "Sebas sighs once more, before he enters the shop."
    "塞巴斯在进入商店前再次叹气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_a5683043:

    # s "Well, I need to go to bed soon. Have a great night, [e]."
    s "好吧，我需要睡觉了，晚安，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_87fea982:

    # "You nod as you watch Sebas slowly walks upstairs."
    "当你看着塞巴斯慢慢地走上楼时 你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_b7a52401:

    # "As you walk in the streets of Lusterfield, you are suddenly reminded of the voting day."
    "当你走在乐斯民菲尔德的街道上时 突然间你想起了投票日。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_edcc8e3c:

    # "Quickly, you run towards the town center, where the voting would be taking place."
    "快速，你跑到镇中心，投票地点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_67c5aa36:

    # "As you arrive, the crowd has already emptied, and Rahim is no where to be seen."
    "当你到达时 人群已经清空 雷希姆已经无处可去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_ace470fd:

    # e "Shit, did I miss the vote?"
    e "妈的，我错过了投票吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_e1d5c3a0:

    # "Walking towards the post. There were a large banner in the middle of the town center."
    "朝柱子走去，镇中心中间有大横幅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_3e93916a:

    # "It reads..."
    "它读取……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_d62118cb:

    # "As voted by the majority of Lusterfield, we will reinstate alliance with the goat tribe, a gratitude to everyone who participated in the vote."
    "由乐斯民菲尔德多数人投票, 我们将恢复与山羊部落的联盟, 感谢所有参加投票的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_1a398a06:

    # "As vote by the majority of Lusterfield, we will continue as usual, a gratitude to everyone who participated in the vote."
    "作为以乐斯民菲尔德多数投票的结果,我们将继续一如既往地向参加投票的每一个人表示感谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_86157e81:

    # "Apparently, the result of the vote is already announced. You stare at the banner in shock."
    "显然，投票结果已经宣布了，你震惊地盯着旗帜看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_8ce68763:

    # "With the way how Rahim worded the announcement, you are somewhat convinced he might not be happy with your absence."
    "以雷希姆对公告的写法 你有点相信 他可能对你缺席不满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_Late_be1315ce:

    # "You might want to talk with Rahim after..."
    "你也许想和雷希姆谈谈..."

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Opinion_a56d9532:

    # e "So, Jog. What do you think about... Lusterfield's Voting Day?"
    e "你觉得乐斯民菲尔德的投票日怎么样?"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Opinion_c90b8630:

    # j "Voting? That's the most booooo-oring activity someone can do, why don't people go to something more useful instead?"
    j "投票？这是别人能做的最牛的动作，为什么人们不去更有用的地方呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Opinion_4ad549e7:

    # e "Well, I wouldn't consider it exactly boring, the whole thing might take you... maybe ten seconds."
    e "好吧，我不认为这很无聊，整个事情可能要你…… 10秒钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Opinion_3d974b5e:

    # j "Yeah, well. And everyone's else are voting, in a millions in a million's case, my vote won't even end up being useful in any shape of form."
    j "其他人都在投票，百万人投票，我的投票 最终也不会有任何用处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Opinion_b2e4eb46:

    # j "Not to mention the time you're wasting on getting to know the goats, well, even though I already know what they're up to, it's still a chore to actually talk to these fools."
    j "更别提你浪费时间去了解山羊了 虽然我已经知道它们在做什么 但和这些傻瓜说话 仍是一种杂务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Opinion_b0b08fbc:

    # e "What about the one in a million's case, what if that vote end up mattering and you didn't vote?"
